<node id="AIiH 2026">
  <data key="d0">AIiH 2026</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">AIiH 2026, officially known as the 3rd International Conference on AI in Healthcare, is an academic event, conference, and publication venue listed within the Events category of the KnowledgeGraph. It is scheduled to take place from August 26 to 28, 2026, at Imperial College London.

The event serves as a significant destination for scholarly work, targeting various research endeavors, paper submissions, and presentations, specifically within the field of Artificial Intelligence in Healthcare. Several key research contributions are associated with AIiH 2026. The "RAG Second Brain Paper," specifically version 23.1, is either actively being prepared for submission with associated templates saved, or has already been submitted, with a goal for acceptance and planned presentation at the conference.

AIiH 2026 is also the designated target for the "NCD-CIE project," involving the submission and potential publication of the "NCD-CIE Paper" or "NCD-CIE-LLM paper," which is described as submission-ready and has been submitted to the conference. Additionally, research related to multi-source Knowledge Graph (KG) Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) for medical diagnosis is intended to be presented or published at this event.

Furthermore, specific data points, including T2DM AUC 0.68 and CKD AUC 0.67, are noted as submission-ready for AIiH 2026. The explicit inclusion of "AIiH 2026" within the names of projects, such as the "RAG Second Brain (AIiH 2026)" project, emphasizes its importance as an identifier for the intended event or year of submission for these research contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;An event or conference for which templates were saved and to which a paper was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;The event or conference to which the RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;A conference or event to which CMT Paper ID 18 - RAG Second Brain v23.1 was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;The event or conference to which the RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;The event or conference to which the RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;AIiH 2026 is an event or conference to which the paper "RAG Second Brain v23.1" was submitted.</data>
