<node id="OpenClaw">
  <data key="d0">OpenClaw</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">OpenClaw is a comprehensive software system, platform, or framework that serves as a core operational environment and underlying infrastructure. It represents the current brand name for this software, having been rebranded from its previous iterations known as Moltbot and Clawdbot. This rebranding was driven primarily by trademark issues and a strategic focus on security hardening, an area where OpenClaw received significant enhancements. The project has undergone continuous development, including various name changes, version updates such as v2026.1.30, and the `openclaw` 2026.2.19-2 software package which replaced `clawdbot`. It was further updated to version v2026.2.26, incorporating sandbox security fixes and establishing it as a new agent infrastructure.

Functionally, OpenClaw acts as the primary platform or system on which the AI agent Arthur operates, and it is also utilized as a tool by Anirach, often in conjunction with Arthur. It serves as the parent entity or system to which OpenClaw sub-agents belong, with these sub-agents typically running in Docker sandboxes. The system is associated with the workspaces created for writing team agents, and as an organization, it is linked to these workspaces. This infrastructure provides enhanced capabilities for agent orchestration, sub-agent spawning, and cron job management, effectively managing agents and their associated workspaces.

Beyond its robust agent management capabilities, OpenClaw also offers WebChat functionality and serves as a system for workflow orchestration. It is the core system for which its dedicated Web UI aims to provide remote access. OpenClaw is recognized as a specific project or topic that has been the subject of action items, initiated or discussed on 2026-02-01, and currently holds an open status.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform or system on which the AI agent Arthur is running.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform or framework that hosts and operates AI agents like Arthur.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization associated with the workspaces created for the writing team agents.&lt;SEP&gt;The platform on which the AI agent Arthur runs.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw is a software application that was updated to version v2026.2.26 on 2026-03-01.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3316dd810af55db2c42342b95d278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5125c828cf8928c4d9f36005ee5a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b9540765c9116547992f4b4a476e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f03d87d29d168bf712ab2a573dc369b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5a2a5ee9379f99260bf82e77d61e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214eb95bbeefec9c60503afe48c2e638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d20e1a818b86a3a5146ae93eab559dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0494f9964c512c3bd5182e3d233fba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237500f812903b7307cdca224b791a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26049e62b3ff21e3c067d7512d1d7293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8958041a8e38ef2d5adde44b86d37b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ea6d7871cd452fe1d5c6536cbd0937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1a879a09130cca84364cf74d7544cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-375d1246c2a13185ef31ee0b286cc66d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b18094093f4014f080a85150727b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691dc72e802a20ddfbc11e2793cf4e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60b689f3d71dd57c707b347058466c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c210fbf27b64754ccea3143cf2159603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d687ae0c2e320f41a3ed208b744ed0c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7e517a45d00cee8aed76a975af9bd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de0c831f333fdaf3139f9bbd6896f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c4c3af39228dfc818ea14fb6d2b998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e527b91e6a9ad23487f23991185d3899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cea9d91f2ca3cf48f1682c604afbf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f12cbfe862ebe1e62f29a7e11b350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f92681cbc13202ffab87956e20912b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff7e5c1e27b82737e07d089640954be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
