<node id="Healthcare AI">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare AI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare AI is an emerging and specific field of artificial intelligence, recognized as a new research area dedicated to applying AI within critical healthcare domains. Its primary focus lies in the application of AI in medical diagnostics and treatment planning. This research area is sometimes categorized under the broader umbrella of Longevity Healthcare Research.

The practical application of Healthcare AI involves developing AI technologies for use in diverse healthcare settings. These applications often target specific functionalities crucial for medical practice, such as ICD-10 coding and differential diagnosis. Notably, these AI solutions are being developed for and implemented in contexts like Thai hospitals. Furthermore, organizations such as Anirach actively collaborate with hospitals to advance and integrate AI into healthcare operations within this evolving field.&lt;SEP&gt;A project focusing on AI applications in medical diagnostics and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic area for relevant papers identified by the arXiv monitor.&lt;SEP&gt;The application of artificial intelligence in medical diagnostics and treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97fe0dddb24f17a6ff26b65970479fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40fa075485b63447273b59dcdd10fadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a1a85c141b50ecd59f3a228d81569a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76861888b327c0c03774d2fd66bfaab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76ef76bfb529eb0424bbe3db7d86acc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6403ad3df78ad1415d5338e0674cf444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5762a88e509b59d9d8b593ccc501736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb209bf42350b9e170471b4f0b4d8f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a2b27b656d4020fb0b84a1e76aa64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a903be8a6a1e664f8430b600a9d758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c312e934d2508ccc30b76067867db53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ff3f0f5d285d27b8ba97f792fba560e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34046874b056af12d4a0f9e5fe55895f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
