<node id="Teaching &amp; Courses">
  <data key="d0">Teaching &amp; Courses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Teaching &amp; Courses is a Master of Course (MOC) document updated on 2026-02-16, categorized under teaching and education.&lt;SEP&gt;An overarching category encompassing educational activities and planned curriculum.&lt;SEP&gt;A conceptual map of content (MOC) that encompasses various aspects of teaching and course development.</data>
