<node id="Course Development">
  <data key="d0">Course Development</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Course Development is a section within Teaching &amp; Courses that details the creation of new courses.&lt;SEP&gt;A person whose role is unknown, created on 2026-02-17, and associated with knowledge graph topics and course planning.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of creating and planning educational courses.&lt;SEP&gt;A category of activities related to creating and planning educational courses, as outlined in the MOC-Teaching document.&lt;SEP&gt;A section within the MOC-Teaching document that describes the development of courses like Education Technology and Vibe Coding.&lt;SEP&gt;Course Development is the process of creating educational courses.&lt;SEP&gt;A category or process related to the creation and planning of courses, included within the 'Teaching &amp; Courses' MOC.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f77abe8ec47d9bbe58f0df8cc9c74c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0565d753af602f369378d3c50ea774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8071a02051a6907a1d6bcf1d18784337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1741ecd860eca78e1c4e201ce55a458f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd865d06fa71004687431dfd89b42aec</data>
