<node id="Education Technology">
  <data key="d0">Education Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Education Technology, frequently referred to as EdTech, is a distinct and broad topic or field within the domain of education. It is primarily concerned with the methods, tools, and application of technology to enhance teaching and learning processes and outcomes. This field specifically focuses on developing and applying technology-enhanced learning and teaching methodologies to create effective educational experiences.

EdTech plays a significant role in course development, serving as a primary topic for integrating advanced methods into curricula. Beyond its application in curriculum design, Education Technology is also recognized as a specific area within research, highlighting its ongoing evolution and the continuous exploration of its principles and applications. Fundamentally, it encapsulates the application of technology to education in its various forms.

In some contexts, "Education Technology" may also refer to specific initiatives or projects. For example, it has been used to denote a particular knowledge graph project focused on the intersection of education and technology, with one such project noted to have been created on 2026-02-16.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f77abe8ec47d9bbe58f0df8cc9c74c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2952aa4f91af10dd793cdcbd918a60a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0565d753af602f369378d3c50ea774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c63f25617c9296922c676c76aabc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8071a02051a6907a1d6bcf1d18784337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1741ecd860eca78e1c4e201ce55a458f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd865d06fa71004687431dfd89b42aec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2534f07c3b5b1ae4a4a66caf5193b4c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b2b1e461dc1cc3f9a8b3ee049013f0a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772601825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vibe Coding">
  <data key="d0">Vibe Coding</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vibe Coding is a planned course mentioned under Course Development.&lt;SEP&gt;A planned course, potentially related to Antigravity.&lt;SEP&gt;A planned course, part of course development, also known as "Vibe Coding with Antigravity".&lt;SEP&gt;A topic or core component of the planned course "Vibe Coding with Antigravity."&lt;SEP&gt;A planned course mentioned under course development.&lt;SEP&gt;A planned course topic that is associated with 'Antigravity'.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibe Coding is a planned project that is also described as a course, created on 2026-02-16.</data>
