<node id="Course Preparation Team">
  <data key="d0">Course Preparation Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Course Preparation Team consists of 10 agents responsible for course creation.&lt;SEP&gt;A team consisting of 10 agents assembled for the purpose of course creation for the Course Preparation project.&lt;SEP&gt;A team responsible for preparing courses, for whom the Course Preparation Team Guide v4.docx is intended.&lt;SEP&gt;The Course Preparation Team is a project team established for course creation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Course Preparation Team is a comprehensive multi-agent system designed to generate complete, professional course materials from minimal input.&lt;SEP&gt;A team of 7 agents created for course preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f77abe8ec47d9bbe58f0df8cc9c74c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8071a02051a6907a1d6bcf1d18784337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1d98f8c226a5f8afbb5721c932b6038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbbcfe0be216f8fb001987c2a5a2045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572bc319ace0969403b23edbb05f1603</data>
