<node id="Home">
  <data key="d0">Home</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Home represents a fundamental navigational concept within a system, frequently serving as the main, primary, or root page and the principal entry point for user interaction. This entity is consistently described as a pivotal navigational point, providing a direct link or reference back to the core starting page.

Within the context of a Knowledge Graph system, Home is recognized as the main entry point or the root section for overall navigation. It functions as a key navigational link, enabling users to return to the central index or main page from various subsections, such as the Research section or the Documents index. Essentially, Home is the foundational page or section from which all other related items and system components originate or are accessed.&lt;SEP&gt;A linked destination from the Organizations Index.&lt;SEP&gt;Home is a navigational link pointing to the main or starting page within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Home is a navigational link pointing to the main section of the KnowledgeGraph.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference to a main or home page/document, linked as a related item.&lt;SEP&gt;A related navigational concept or page linked from the document.&lt;SEP&gt;A related concept or page linked to from the audit document, serving as a navigation point.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f77abe8ec47d9bbe58f0df8cc9c74c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2952aa4f91af10dd793cdcbd918a60a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32855dc2dff1a004e9b91107378406a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cae40cb3e01f7f44617fe6efce540e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6350d26186fa2215e4c64148f011ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c599f91be9d0271b2f173bcfb4111a87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12f048966679c5273b89937b7ee51924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18589a3ae5643f849f2a1a4ec242ec03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30ae3cffd532b289cddb3021692aea5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76ebd2fd8a6971743f9a176cc997ff13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-689042a2405cb0172a76bf202e09b476</data>
