  <data key="d2">Antigravity is a concept associated with Vibe Coding, appearing in the full course name 'Vibe Coding with Antigravity'.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept associated with the planned course "Vibe Coding".&lt;SEP&gt;A concept mentioned as part of the title for the planned course "Vibe Coding with Antigravity."&lt;SEP&gt;A concept or technology associated with the 'Vibe Coding' planned course.&lt;SEP&gt;Antigravity is an IDE (Integrated Development Environment) used in the Antigravity Setup phase.</data>
