<node id="NCD-CIE Paper">
  <data key="d0">NCD-CIE Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The NCD-CIE Paper is an active research paper and publication primarily centered on the field of causal knowledge. Its core focus involves the development and application of causal knowledge graphs specifically for the purposes of non-communicable disease (NCD) risk assessment and intervention. This paper forms a key component of the broader NCD-CIE Project.

The research embodied in the NCD-CIE Paper has reached a significant stage, evidenced by its "v4 final, delivered" status. It is currently targeting AIiH 2026 for its ultimate presentation or publication. As an academic paper concentrating on NCD causal inference, it has a dedicated folder under "Papers," and discussions are ongoing regarding the relevance of "Inoue et al. 2023" to its findings.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic paper submitted for AIiH 2026, detailing the NCD-CIE system, which went through multiple versions based on reviewer feedback.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7d1a4b472c4e9df7f727842d73c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1518d5fca22e0855028336810f3633c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3a13b8766f259c53695594b5a9b816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf118a7fabd05f686e24e7215e9dd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2af660d98585f1bf80724aaf6b78da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b311eaf06ea9868fe83648987d6180c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4a8365498de6d88dd8e9e7d2182caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2753f45f158b0a6204d83e9fa7880a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772609765</data>
