</node>
<node id="Anirach Mingkhwan">
  <data key="d0">Anirach Mingkhwan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Anirach Mingkhwan is a human individual who concurrently holds the roles of Principal Investigator and lecturer, affiliated with King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. As a lecturer, Anirach Mingkhwan's responsibilities include course preparation, curriculum design, and the development of academic assessments. In the capacity of a Principal Investigator, a role formally recorded as of February 16, 2026, Anirach Mingkhwan is tasked with crucial strategic decisions. These encompass the development of the ChartSense AI MVP, a full-stack clinical decision support system designed for Thai hospitals, and the revision of the AIiH v23 paper (also known as the AIiH paper) to address reviewer feedback. Further key decisions involve inquiries regarding performance improvements, the selection of a primary AI model, the migration to OpenClaw, and the framing of the RAG paper. Anirach Mingkhwan also holds ownership for decisions and action items related to the OpenClaw Web UI, a project they manage, and was involved in discussions concerning Web UI chat access, additionally making the decision to commission a Thai translation. Anirach Mingkhwan also manages the VPIPE Database.

Anirach Mingkhwan's project involvement is extensive, spanning several initiatives. These include the NCD-CIE project, the "Three Old Men" project, the ChartSense AI project, the RAG Second Brain project, the Bookshelf project, the Ai-Research-Dashboard project, the Claude-Skills project, the Bookshelf App project, the LobsterBoard project, the Helpdesk Booking project, and the Obsidian Vault project.

Anirach Mingkhwan is broadly associated with a knowledge graph and receives assistance from an AI agent named Arthur, in addition to various action items. Anirach Mingkhwan's human identity is consistently documented across multiple systems, being explicitly listed as "Human" in the People Index of a Knowledge Graph, referenced as the "human identity of 'Source Knowledge'" in a "Quick Reference" document (Quick-Reference.md), and identified as the human behind "Augmented Generation" and associated with "Based Medical." Anirach Mingkhwan also served as the main user who had a direct session at 14:45 and desired to test the GLM-4.7-Flash Model. Contact information includes Telegram ID 7579913696 and the email address anirach.m@fitm.kmutnb.ac.th. Anirach Mingkhwan has expressed a preference to always reply in English.&lt;SEP&gt;A human identity listed in the Quick Reference.&lt;SEP&gt;Anirach Mingkhwan is a human identified in the Quick Reference document.&lt;SEP&gt;Identified as a human in the Quick Reference, associated with a Telegram ID.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-209a10793a38ab9ffb1236b426b5f37a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3316dd810af55db2c42342b95d278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5125c828cf8928c4d9f36005ee5a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b9540765c9116547992f4b4a476e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88e992b721430779160720a86027f0b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48404c33a0cecaca96752c576cc8ff1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17156a5b505902e14a9d022cbd0a55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ec70c699368a1d1b9b05586b524c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e3f7a26a4c8d639a7927de46537f385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cbbc18d3bb92f6b0bdcfd80c466c2b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6201337fe894c42a726729fd7b3d568a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5a2a5ee9379f99260bf82e77d61e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7d1a4b472c4e9df7f727842d73c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1abf1dd7476e5eb1c0db2bb8d8add16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d310a4043708aa267f31226740ed083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf138f605cebd36b4d1e832a3e1e39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9379406cb3b5e65bc032ad0990719d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177684e236b3aa2b6deb2be4c371a77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1518d5fca22e0855028336810f3633c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2abe1f2f6521ebc01ceb8cb4f288930f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86793a1f22c5b47b2656851af199c86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9251a5e06851a7123de946ab9c6915a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e70d63a61fe7a75ad278b4906fa6902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a75b2ce01f9e8a4a