<node id="DuckMan">
  <data key="d0">DuckMan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">DuckMan is recognized as an individual and a person within the KnowledgeGraph, where they are specifically listed in the People Index. This entity is primarily identified as an active collaborator across various initiatives.

DuckMan's most notable involvement is with the ChartSense AI project, where they serve as a collaborator and were instrumental in the decision to build its Minimum Viable Product (MVP). Beyond this, DuckMan is associated with the `DuckMan.md` document within Obsidian's KnowledgeGraph. They also contribute to updates regarding the Causal Knowledge Graph project, with documentation found in Obsidian. Furthermore, DuckMan is linked to research concerning multi-source Knowledge Graph RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) for medical diagnosis.

Information pertaining to DuckMan, including their record, was documented or identified on 2026-02-15.&lt;SEP&gt;DuckMan is an individual who collaborates on the ChartSense AI project.&lt;SEP&gt;Anirach's collaborator, credited with the ChartSense AI concept and providing initial project documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c758a8c08dcaf507d7e3c18d75d2cefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7d1a4b472c4e9df7f727842d73c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1abf1dd7476e5eb1c0db2bb8d8add16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84cf29bb492f5df9040017ff94a75e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a6acf4ff121bf38f43ff721b71a701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-375d1246c2a13185ef31ee0b286cc66d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b18094093f4014f080a85150727b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d72af6b995c588bb7a33620adf0464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b311eaf06ea9868fe83648987d6180c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565cbd3991fde971e7c72b941083b823&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbc27820764894775d4457c170c4c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e9ea9f9ef3e6e49b68f230ad0b56ef</data>
