<node id="ChartSense AI">
  <data key="d0">ChartSense AI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ChartSense AI is an active artificial intelligence project, also referred to as an AI organization, primarily developed to address the specific needs of Thai hospitals. Its central mission is to construct a full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product (MVP) with the ultimate goal of enhancing healthcare services across the region. The project focuses on key areas such as healthcare, clinical decision support, AI differential diagnosis, chart completeness, and ICD-10 code suggestion, particularly related to ICD-10 functionalities and differential diagnosis.

The system utilizes a comprehensive technology stack to achieve its objectives. The frontend, specifically the clinical dashboard, is built using Next.js 14. Its backend is powered by PostgreSQL and is interconnected with FastAPI. A critical technological component is its strategic leverage of Neo4j for GraphRAG-based differential diagnosis, which facilitates advanced diagnostic capabilities. The entire technology stack is efficiently managed and orchestrated through Docker Compose.

ChartSense AI is developed at King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. It benefits from significant collaborations, most notably with DuckMan, with progress updates and details regarding this partnership frequently documented in MEMORY.md. Prominent individuals such as Arthur and Anirach Mingkhwan are actively involved with and contribute to the project. ChartSense AI maintains a consistent presence, being regularly listed within the Projects Index of the Knowledge Graph and is currently the subject of an action item. The broader ChartSense AI project encompasses and is related to the ChartSense AI MVP.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c758a8c08dcaf507d7e3c18d75d2cefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e3f7a26a4c8d639a7927de46537f385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7d1a4b472c4e9df7f727842d73c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237500f812903b7307cdca224b791a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84cf29bb492f5df9040017ff94a75e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a6acf4ff121bf38f43ff721b71a701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac86759c81403a13eab4bdb09f79eadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-375d1246c2a13185ef31ee0b286cc66d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b18094093f4014f080a85150727b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2af660d98585f1bf80724aaf6b78da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cec7408b70dbfa90ba1a725679aa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d14155767fde5f62677e73a2911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5156974771cb937584c35af037182dcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de2b52f89007f66ee562bf3b97c331a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c3ff39a4343014a1e3432784260076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2ee2032b2b6f519629d4e40d21f39de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afeede1bded2dc424cb8b91978908cac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbc27820764894775d4457c170c4c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28873878f8dcbd5abb8ed630f432e8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-454306d201a2fb212f19fe3fa3ddc91f</data>
