<node id="Imperial College London">
  <data key="d0">Imperial College London</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Imperial College London is identified as an organization, consistently listed across various forms of an "Organizations Index" within a Knowledge Graph. This includes references such as the "Organizations Index within the Knowledge Graph," the "'Organizations' index of the Obsidian knowledge graph," and simply the "knowledge graph's index," all indicating its entry in a dedicated index for organizations.

Additionally, Imperial College London is specified as the location designated to host the AIiH 2026 event, also referred to as the AIiH 2026 Conference.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization listed in the Organizations index.&lt;SEP&gt;Imperial College London is an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Imperial College London is a university and the designated venue for the AIiH 2026 conference.&lt;SEP&gt;The host of the AIiH 2026 conference.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04315d854ae167849bd91e0ae5938cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2247baf68504edcbb686f816523e53e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16405385759a81e20e5b226bbba714cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c599f91be9d0271b2f173bcfb4111a87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de2755e68bb6765bfec517e32a59e4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6476f93afca3bf94d0f25d8156e76b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3</data>
