<node id="ArXiv">
  <data key="d0">ArXiv</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ArXiv is an online, open-access repository and preprint server, functioning as a comprehensive platform and archive for electronic preprints, academic papers, and scientific research papers across diverse scientific and technical fields.

The repository, including the categories of its housed preprints and academic papers, is subject to automated daily monitoring. This oversight is conducted by specialized systems such as the Academic Research Workflow Automation System, the Daily ArXiv Monitoring system, or the arXiv monitor, which actively scan the platform.

Beyond its role as a research archive, ArXiv is also utilized for pre-submission checks and serves as a significant resource for literature searches. Furthermore, within a knowledge graph structure, ArXiv can be identified as a specific topic, marked by a unique ID and an associated date.&lt;SEP&gt;ArXiv is an online repository for scientific preprints across various fields, scanned for research papers.&lt;SEP&gt;A pre-print server for scientific papers that is monitored by the agent.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform for preprints of scientific papers, actively monitored for academic research across various fields and cited as a source.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform hosting papers of interest, including AttentionRetriever, BioModelsRAG, and RAG-GNN.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform for scientific preprints from which papers are scanned daily.&lt;SEP&gt;ArXiv is a repository from which papers are scanned daily.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52871670ef07a5a1ba116162391d222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec31c467d15fe3c5a28ca03d1304cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8633d83c79a5da228b3867f7281be838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5213a762ce016e71e34ba175a039776c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa16d640114a6b282a0112d48e402e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484af61c17248dd97c9673e37b363c48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73ac488745d210b519b8306ed123348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-937d61de271dcf8cb6de1c92083dda2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be32808c942011a178df2564dffe6d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a901a740e740e41f51c00e228b720c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ce30ce20ef800d9a7bb58b9b0461c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-235bc07c09f26fdcb46115a35a1fb596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b8c58cedfa24794136151188ad15e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f12cbfe862ebe1e62f29a7e11b350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
