<node id="Infrastructure">
  <data key="d0">Infrastructure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Refers to tools used in research.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure refers to underlying systems and components, described in the `MOC-Infrastructure.md` document.&lt;SEP&gt;A general concept tag related to the agent system migration.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification indicating that OpenClaw Web UI relates to fundamental underlying systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure refers to the underlying systems and services managed by the DevOps agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure management is a domain handled by the Devops agent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a764628ee2a0d96bcbab465f3adff1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d687ae0c2e320f41a3ed208b744ed0c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
