<node id="Medical Diagnosis">
  <data key="d0">Medical Diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical Diagnosis is defined as the process of identifying the nature and cause of a disease. This critical concept is described as the central focus and a key field of application for the RAG Second Brain Paper.

More specifically, Medical Diagnosis serves as the field of application for the Multi-Source Knowledge Graph Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) method, a technique that leverages multi-source knowledge graphs within the RAG framework. It represents a significant area of research where Machine Learning (ML) methods are actively applied and compared against various RAG approaches, particularly in the context of Biomedical AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb3a13b8766f259c53695594b5a9b816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2af660d98585f1bf80724aaf6b78da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b33eee641750b9ee67d76116f03226</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772597857</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NCD Risk Assessment">
  <data key="d0">NCD Risk Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">NCD Risk Assessment is a method and process dedicated to evaluating the risk of Non-Communicable Diseases (NCDs). This vital evaluation process serves as the specific application domain and primary purpose for various technological developments and research initiatives.

It is the field of application for the NCD-CIE Paper, which proposes a hybrid causal framework specifically for NCD Risk Assessment. Additionally, it represents the core application area for the NCD-CIE platform, the NCD-CIE system, and the NCD Causal Insight Engine. The development of a Causal Knowledge Graph is also explicitly undertaken with NCD Risk Assessment as its specific application domain or purpose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6716ce6b3848cb2033e87e55c6f4c37a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-186fc3dc78629c4e754c44f180def340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b311eaf06ea9868fe83648987d6180c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b880fa9519d18c32f4dc952756f8d33f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b833576f6ded00efd508619d87e78d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3</data>
