<node id="Machine Learning">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine Learning is a key topic situated under Artificial Intelligence (AI) and forms a core component of the broader AI/ML Stack. It encompasses broad techniques and statistical methods that empower systems to learn effectively from data.

This field holds significant importance, particularly in research pertaining to medical diagnosis. Within this domain, Machine Learning techniques are leveraged to compare supervised baselines, such as XGBoost and Random Forest, against Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) approaches to advance diagnostic capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A subfield of AI focused on systems that learn from data.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine Learning refers to statistical methods that enable systems to learn from data. It is central to research on medical diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbfecb1c1a2bb83afc8f0f8178ad4c06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a764628ee2a0d96bcbab465f3adff1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089de8c66b50fe90b117698cc664f772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36bc7aa9b32e316be7bff4a8f43fad50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2af660d98585f1bf80724aaf6b78da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b33eee641750b9ee67d76116f03226</data>
