  <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">General concepts and technologies related to Artificial Intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The overarching subject of the document, encompassing various sub-topics like Machine Learning, Large Language Models, AI Agents, Computer Vision, and NLP.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence is a specific topic area under Research.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence encompasses systems that can perform tasks requiring human-like intelligence; it drives agent teams, research automation, and clinical decision support.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a field of computer science focused on creating intelligent machines, applied in various domains including biomedical research.&lt;SEP&gt;Encompasses systems that perform tasks requiring human-like intelligence, driving agent teams, research automation, and clinical decision-making.</data>
