<node id="PostgreSQL">
  <data key="d0">PostgreSQL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PostgreSQL is a widely-used, open-source relational database system and management system technology. It serves as a core backend database for various applications and is a key component within a project's tech stack. This technology is recognized for its support of `pgcrypto` and is recommended for migration from SQLite for production-ready applications. Furthermore, patterns for this database technology are provided by a specific skill.

PostgreSQL plays a significant role in several projects. It functions as the database system for the VPIPE Database project, which is part of the broader VPIPE system, and specifically for the VPIPE CRM database. It also powers the ChartSense AI backend, contributing to the ChartSense AI MVP stack. The database technology is additionally used by the AI Research Dashboard and is related to the Bookshelf App project.

In a specific operational context, PostgreSQL was noted to be unavailable on the server, particularly for the AI Research Dashboard. Within a knowledge graph, PostgreSQL is identified by the ID "topic:postgresql."</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089de8c66b50fe90b117698cc664f772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-324bd841922db4db30ba10360e372195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e693dc32490e805f9674d6004e634e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3798f4a234fcc46c4df14537567aed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db2cbf7fe0012c6db40e7c54c9c9cbca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4d74588847aeaab263c27d6a5d7245f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae9c65716cfab1c177b3f20485ddadd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cea9d91f2ca3cf48f1682c604afbf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a77499fd86767b7b2628b024b4cadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdd7a8ac37441f958ecd1d004dda478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e9ea9f9ef3e6e49b68f230ad0b56ef</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772610166</data>
