  <data key="d5">1772607099</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Warehouse">
  <data key="d0">Data Warehouse</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An infrastructure designed for analytics.&lt;SEP&gt;A person, identified by the KnowledgeGraph/People/Data-Warehouse.md source and YAML metadata, whose role and organization are unknown.&lt;SEP&gt;A centralized repository designed for storing large amounts of structured data from various sources for analysis and reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;A system for data storage and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A centralized repository for structured data analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or concept representing a central repository for integrated data from one or more disparate sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089de8c66b50fe90b117698cc664f772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e693dc32490e805f9674d6004e634e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906</data>
