<node id="Next.js">
  <data key="d0">Next.js</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Next.js is a React framework specifically engineered for production web applications. While broadly applicable for web development, version 14 of Next.js is particularly highlighted for incorporating advanced features like the App Router, server components, and API routes, which enhance its capability as a robust frontend development tool.

This technology framework is extensively utilized across several projects. It serves as the dedicated frontend framework for ChartSense AI, where it powers the clinical dashboard. Furthermore, Next.js is an essential component of the technology stack for the Bookshelf App project. Its versatility also extends to building new projects, including specific applications such as an e-commerce dashboard, underscoring its role in various modern web development initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A web framework mentioned as a technology for badges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cec7408b70dbfa90ba1a725679aa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5156974771cb937584c35af037182dcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4d74588847aeaab263c27d6a5d7245f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbc27820764894775d4457c170c4c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bb69ddf92ab1babcdff33347dda2cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-631efd939c35e0e48c213128b1245c1a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772607899</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Docker">
  <data key="d0">Docker</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Docker is a widely recognized technology and platform primarily known for containerization. It provides a standardized method to package applications and their dependencies into isolated environments, referred to as containers or sandboxes. This approach facilitates reproducible deployments, enabling the efficient development, shipping, running, and deployment of software projects.

As a containerization platform, Docker is instrumental in managing sandbox containers and deploying software projects. It supports various applications, such as hosting OpenClaw sub-agents and powering full-stack applications like ChartSense AI, and is noted for its relevance to the OpenClaw migration. The technology is also associated with specific tools and configurations, including being part of the Docker Compose setup, and is sometimes mentioned in relation to badges.

Due to its significance in contemporary technology, Docker is a prominent topic in educational and knowledge management systems. It is a central subject in Week 4 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course, with further details provided in the corresponding Week 4 Handout DOCX. Furthermore, Docker is listed as a key entry in both the Knowledge Graph and the Obsidian topic index, underscoring its relevance and importance in modern technical discussions and information architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical topic covered in the DevOps with VibeCoding Course curriculum.&lt;SEP&gt;Docker is a containerization technology handled by the Devops agent and supported for deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c63f25617c9296922c676c76aabc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237500f812903b7307cdca224b791a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f35dde77733200df47f357a0679f2af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-502f8dd5c79c24e8566d5884525c199f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c210fbf27b64754ccea3143cf2159603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cea9d91f2ca3cf48f1682c604afbf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-631efd939c35e0e48c213128b1245c1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b5576904ddba71ef0e4ad0f9e1b507&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
