<node id="Knowledge Management">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The systematic process of creating, sharing, using, and managing knowledge and information.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of capturing, organizing, distilling, and expressing knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;The systematic process of creating, sharing, using, and managing knowledge and information.</data>
