<node id="LobsterBoard">
  <data key="d0">LobsterBoard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">LobsterBoard is a dashboard software application designed for installation and operation on a server, functioning as a comprehensive server dashboard system. Once deployed, it provides users with accessible data and controls, made remotely accessible via a specific IP address and often a particular port, such as HTTP. Its operational management is facilitated through a systemd service, which also allows for its configuration for auto-start, ensuring the system launches automatically upon server boot.

The software is configured with several widgets, including a specific weather widget, enhancing its overall utility. The project's source code is hosted on GitHub and is primarily associated with and developed by Curbob. Anirach Mingkhwan is noted as a contributor who works on the project, and individuals such as Arthur have configured it. LobsterBoard was developed at King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. It is also explicitly identified as a project within the Knowledge Graph's project index, with an associated GitHub repository.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard is a system or product that contains a weather widget requiring a fix.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or software component that was installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard is a software developed by Curbob, installed on a server to provide a dashboard.&lt;SEP&gt;A dashboard software installed on a server, accessible via HTTP, and managed by a systemd service, associated with Curbob's GitHub repository.&lt;SEP&gt;A dashboard software installed on a server, accessible via HTTP, and managed by a systemd service, associated with Curbob's GitHub repository.&lt;SEP&gt;A dashboard software installed on a server, accessible via HTTP, and managed by a systemd service, associated with Curbob's GitHub repository.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2137ff35cca3b6a1f530734272b671a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db30366d6e531336292702250ac47e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28873878f8dcbd5abb8ed630f432e8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2434edb652ea448af12b65c60768a71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4e01656ce29019cf97a36acd572183b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4</data>
