<node id="OpenClaw Web UI">
  <data key="d0">OpenClaw Web UI</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">OpenClaw Web UI is identified as a project focused on developing a web user interface for remote access. This interface is specifically designed to provide remote web chat access to OpenClaw. The project's current status is pending decision regarding its implementation. This pending decision pertains to the specific access methods that will be utilized, with considerations including solutions such as a dedicated macOS/iOS application or a Tailscale tunnel. Essentially, OpenClaw Web UI represents an initiative to offer a web-based portal for interacting with OpenClaw from a distance, necessitating a robust remote access solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A software project listed within the Knowledge Graph's project index.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw Web UI is a user interface for which remote access solutions are being considered.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw Web UI is a web user interface that requires a solution for remote access.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw Web UI is a web user interface for which a remote access option needs to be decided.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw Web UI is a web user interface for which a remote access option needs to be decided.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw Web UI is a specific web user interface whose access methods are the subject of an action item.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28fc80c7abcbb7c8f3a3662eecaddd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26049e62b3ff21e3c067d7512d1d7293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bfa5f27fd3e3a037eabf52850861f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c210fbf27b64754ccea3143cf2159603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d687ae0c2e320f41a3ed208b744ed0c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ab6e36e2e8bcc5f6a0716553ebc4adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7b17ffee9e2718e84789be096f8eb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12f048966679c5273b89937b7ee51924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b4f5c47b5b81ed70f92ba06ead4771&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98f61537e834b72ab7e7890749912feb</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772605327</data>
