<node id="Remote Access">
  <data key="d0">Remote Access</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The ability to access a computer or network from a distant location.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote Access is the general concept of accessing a system or interface from a remote location.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote access is the objective for establishing connectivity to the OpenClaw Web UI.</data>
