<node id="AI">
  <data key="d0">AI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AI, or Artificial Intelligence, is a broad concept, technology, field of study, and topic that functions as a category or tag within various knowledge systems, including knowledge graphs, Obsidian topic indexes, and KnowledgeGraph/Topics indexes. It serves as an entity representing the topic of Artificial Intelligence and is closely related to "AI Document" and Machine Learning, forming part of the broader AI/ML Stack.

A primary application of Artificial Intelligence is to assist in the software development workflow. This includes aiding in tasks such as writing requirements and specifically in Product Requirement Document (PRD) generation, making it central to "AI-assisted software development workflow." It is also associated with "AI-assisted coding," as seen in its relation to the Vibe Coding Antigravity course.

Beyond software development, AI has significant applications in the healthcare and biomedical fields. It contributes to medical diagnostics and treatment, identified as a key component of Medical AI. Furthermore, Artificial Intelligence influences the changing global healthcare context, affecting and being considered in healthcare standards. AI is also recognized as a related topic to Education Technology.

As a field of study related to intelligence and learning, the domain of Artificial Intelligence is actively monitored for relevant research, with papers frequently tracked on platforms like arXiv.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbfecb1c1a2bb83afc8f0f8178ad4c06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2189670463c8a51757c474d3cfabb455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c63f25617c9296922c676c76aabc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d52207fa065044e301f9e39da68c057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089de8c66b50fe90b117698cc664f772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d63e037554049f0f653ae6fd00b41f8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f35dde77733200df47f357a0679f2af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a2b27b656d4020fb0b84a1e76aa64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7606b85915bb233dbea5e7f567432c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc5e85ef9c048380daae758b9313250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13370da4542e0ab270fbb1a19946441a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2534f07c3b5b1ae4a4a66caf5193b4c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402751e915ac66eace343513a646b9aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b33eee641750b9ee67d76116f03226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed7db0d09c2f6c23c342cd0451173c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-132c6fc6e294620b0ff5157fe1165b60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14d55bcf9a1b416cefe3a95a593138a1</data>
