</node>
<node id="DevOps VibeCoding Course">
  <data key="d0">DevOps VibeCoding Course</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The DevOps VibeCoding Course is a structured educational program and program of study primarily focused on DevOps VibeCoding and broader DevOps topics. Its comprehensive curriculum delves into key areas such as Docker, Containerization, and Kubernetes.

This educational program is characterized by structured weekly progress and deliverables. It includes associated weekly presentation and handout materials that are actively being developed and delivered as an integral part of the curriculum. To facilitate access to these resources, associated Drive IDs are provided for the course materials. The course is an ongoing initiative for which educational content, including handouts and presentations, has been created and continues to be developed and delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;An educational course focused on DevOps VibeCoding, which requires the completion of specific slides and handouts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8012e399d9e5ea3f933ec3b0fee8988d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9402536e9419b42ab050ff6b9aa8ad11</data>
