<node id="KMUTNB">
  <data key="d0">KMUTNB</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok (KMUTNB) is an organization, specifically a university, known by its abbreviation KMUTNB. This institution is associated with individuals such as Anirach Mingkhwan, who is employed there as a lecturer, and Naphatsara, identified as a collaborator. Anirach Mingkhwan's association is further evidenced by their email address domain, `fitm.kmutnb.ac.th`, which explicitly links them to the university.

As an educational institution, King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok supports its activities, including those led by lecturers like Anirach, through the use of agent teams.</data>
