<node id="VPIPE Database">
  <data key="d0">VPIPE Database</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The VPIPE Database is a remotely hosted database system, specifically identified as an active PostgreSQL sales pipeline database project for the PPlus company. Its primary function is to offer read-only access for reporting purposes, particularly concerning sales activities.

Access to the VPIPE Database requires specific connection credentials and details. These include a designated host, port, username, and password. An essential security component for connection is a PGP Decryption Key, which is provided to facilitate secure access to this database system.&lt;SEP&gt;The VPIPE Database is a specific database system, central to the VPIPE Database Query Guide, for which connection details are provided.&lt;SEP&gt;A database named "vpipe" for which connection details, including host, port, username, and password, are provided.&lt;SEP&gt;An active project that generates reports and is tagged as a knowledge graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The VPIPE Database is a PostgreSQL sales pipeline database developed for PPlus Company, providing read-only access for reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific database instance named 'vpipe'.&lt;SEP&gt;A PostgreSQL database used for PPlus sales reports.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e6c0f12f725a7b639074653a878c82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7921c12728ce1b4fa1b4948ee21d50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558068083b50e64390babf7d3bc77da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df52a1a76319cb1ee476ee7b98d269ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-688abbc4283fd4efcb1b522726970ca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ea1205216aac0363f68a5fdf5990f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7cd5acdf11e79f105ad6c0fe18a818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2caade868a67ffa45b39b4f154f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29d77cee649032588ea6ec89a669b834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae9c65716cfab1c177b3f20485ddadd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42b2d817f88febf88e53eafe461680f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401</data>
