<node id="Opus Model">
  <data key="d0">Opus Model</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Opus Model refers to two distinct entities: primarily, an advanced artificial intelligence model or large language model, and separately, a person.

As an artificial intelligence model, the Opus Model is an advanced AI model or underlying technology utilized across diverse teams and for various functions within an agent system. It is specifically recognized as the foundational model powering the UX/UI Designer Agent. Its capabilities extend to facilitating thinking processes and handling thinking-heavy tasks. Within the coding team, it is assigned critical roles such as orchestrator, code-review, and db-specialist. The Opus Model is specifically allocated for thinking-heavy tasks within the Writing Team setup, particularly within the 6-Agent Professional Writing Team. Its versatility is further demonstrated by its employment within the Thai Translator Agent Project, where it also handles thinking-heavy roles. Additionally, this AI model is employed by several agents within the Course Prep Team and by agents in the Academic Paper Team, including roles like paper-architect, literature-lead, methodology-expert, peer-reviewer, data-analyst, and ethics-reviewer. Across these applications, the Opus Model is generally utilized by various agents for their respective tasks across different teams.

Separately, "Opus Model" is also identified as an individual whose activities involve the creation and delivery of course content.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific AI model allocated for thinking-heavy tasks within the Writing Team setup.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d395d729f7f4af176337bfefc3a79dd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c9f0047cf0851b406258ad13a0ecf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb41aa2ca304e58f55fd006f67adb483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a68fc9c7479f5ca8f832d201f36644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d310a4043708aa267f31226740ed083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b037432a7b9144971fd46cf952d906de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22dff12fa45dfc4789663451e530bd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9720ea6318619cc6647cfa0f2e2e7e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f6860faf24b5be6fe8f033e3ab403a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876c9d36604a2a00ba9d1acc186c490c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4a759f0caa83cf9e50057d50a49419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-962708e2b38cf807f5da24a5a99fe6a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-284d2efbc11f924a38ffe2ce9455fd8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
