<node id="Quick-Reference.md">
  <data key="d0">Quick-Reference.md</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Quick-Reference.md is a dedicated Markdown file and reference document integral to the Obsidian knowledge management system. It functions as a source file for quick reference, operating either as a standalone Obsidian note or as a crucial component within a larger knowledge graph. Its primary purpose is to systematically store critical IDs, links, and facts, making essential information readily available.

A key characteristic of Quick-Reference.md is its configuration to automatically load at the start of every Obsidian session, ensuring immediate and consistent access to its contents. Regarding its development lifecycle, the document has been noted as achieving an "MVP complete" status and subsequently reached "v4 final, delivered." Furthermore, Quick-Reference.md details the current status of its different language versions, specifically an English (Nobel Edition) and a Thai (Full translation). The most recent update recorded for this reference document was on 2026-02-17.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf138f605cebd36b4d1e832a3e1e39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de88caa5e86668356c547bf8ad59c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce281fe7e8c87e108642bd4ce24f9e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28ab9284ac169014e9c0488fb76a8e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d72af6b995c588bb7a33620adf0464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b311eaf06ea9868fe83648987d6180c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a65285fdf36b982f20efb250e9ce9</data>
