<node id="LLM-Based Medical Diagnosis">
  <data key="d0">LLM-Based Medical Diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An application area focusing on medical diagnosis using large language models, mentioned in the RAG Second Brain Paper title.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific application area mentioned in the description of the RAG Second Brain (AIiH 2026) project.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific application area for the RAG Second Brain project, focusing on using Large Language Models for medical diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;LLM-Based Medical Diagnosis is the application objective for which the RAG Second Brain (AIiH 2026) project aims to function as a "Second Brain".&lt;SEP&gt;LLM-Based Medical Diagnosis is the specific application area for which the "RAG Second Brain" project is designed.&lt;SEP&gt;The application of Large Language Models to assist in or perform medical diagnostic processes.</data>
