<node id="GitHub">
  <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub is a prominent web-based online platform primarily designed for version control and collaboration, particularly within the domain of software development. It functions as a central host for a diverse range of software development projects, their repositories, and source code, facilitating project management and collaborative work. The platform serves as a destination for pushing code and experimental results, and is also a source from which code can be cloned, reinforcing its role as a key online platform for numerous software and translation-related endeavors.

The platform hosts a variety of specific initiatives and projects. These include the Minimum Viable Product (MVP) of the ChartSense AI Project, the repository for the NCD-CIE project, and multiple project repositories for "Three Old Men," encompassing "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation," and "Three Old Men - Thai Translation," with the latter managed by Anirach for publishing translations. GitHub also provides a home for the LobsterBoard project, including Curbob's LobsterBoard, its source code, and software repository, as well as the RAG Second Brain project's repository. Additionally, it hosts the code repository for the Bookshelf project, where the Bookshelf App Project is planned to be pushed, the Ai-Research-Dashboard project's repository, the Claude-Skills project's repository, and the Obsidian Vault project's repository, being used for syncing Obsidian vaults. The platform is further specified as the location where V3 experiment code and results are to be pushed, with the main agent, Arthur, handling such push operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2cf3a796b09887b7b8355de43da736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17156a5b505902e14a9d022cbd0a55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6201337fe894c42a726729fd7b3d568a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2abe1f2f6521ebc01ceb8cb4f288930f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ac42e4b444b2aa35a9817c58b1eaadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6350d26186fa2215e4c64148f011ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80158534569e9914c5429dc29da51f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48b3d54886da3f671398a41160a0ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71c418372142e16d1946cb65109ced22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90bdd16f25c3e0e209e779bed9fc615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e426aeb3f853f4e4a70717b09a111a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4921daf2164de8d78817ea40ef7438fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-959cc787ebf7ba849ceed8fc31031862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7e10d09f982e9b7d5bb3d226d90b24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e788ba3e64d85e6086e324e92e602039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61736ce38c27461a2b10ba4645d7dc0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28965c521a6b72821b06f5ed20fa322d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e9ea9f9ef3e6e49b68f230ad0b56ef</data>
