<node id="Knowledge Graph Index">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Graph Index</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Knowledge Graph Index is an auto-generated index document or data structure, sometimes described as a digital document, interface, or content document. Its primary function is to offer a comprehensive overview of a knowledge graph's contents, structure, current state, and recent activity, thereby serving as a central reference point for the organization and evolution of the graph's data.

This index meticulously details categorized data and entities within the knowledge graph, tracking their respective counts. Common categories frequently highlighted include People, Projects, Decisions, and Action Items. Specific examples of categorized counts include 315 People, 129 Projects, and 6 Decisions. Additionally, it integrates relevant metadata such as source, type, update times, and tags, providing a rich snapshot of the graph's information.

The Knowledge Graph Index is dynamically and periodically updated to accurately reflect changes and recent activity, mirroring updates at various batch events and timestamps. Noted examples of update dates include 2026-02-17, 2026-03-03, March 4, 2026, at 18:00, March 5, 2026, at 18:00, 2026-03-05 at 23:00, and March 7, 2026, at 18:00. In the specific context of Obsidian, this structured index document is typically sourced from and located at a path like `KnowledgeGraph/_index.md`, and is sometimes referenced as `KnowledgeGraph/_index.index.md`.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6fcf70267592172f417dccb380b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0e1255b938172ca134381d029ccfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6624021287f55bbd038a25dfb41ea597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e964fa90440f30528a4e3fa28953961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae97dcf9e925fab8d0b67acde501abdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cfdf2156ab57f335e70ce67a52fd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d38a9ea2781994983d82c56aaf21d90c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b781e3e1d8f6931cf3aac3e89a4627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617117720e00673331b8823b4df194ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3681d76e566b4d7959ebff2e17fcfb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ef545088384ee9d14b145ae009a44f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f197e592637ef1737a9a8857200343b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e61da92e53b06903a4888daeacc373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932e70986da082d91d36bf6d3f117889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a448df3934c0032a1a381293f8854d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-521f51cb7088ea1256e4e2e3d6ab655d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4766a53f3a7b874f1a7885e6cdb3b9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a068b3c6e1458bfc283574e66abf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d9fab81d1eec0211cefd1449d9763e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a919f3748dda0a162989257025876c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c70fe043587284fd7384360f83de7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e97f01a6c76ac6d4715d960b78e484f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb061fa6be422bbf34b9117831dfcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e30357a2804cd093debf64cfb766376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7793c1816ef50dc976008de6c6e8601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc1acb7742fd80221f70cc930bc3f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdc26ddbfd5a67ff793d2535ecee5ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82dee78d437d05747e42bee23124ec36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2930106fa93d6381998b32a2282a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d36a38c7bfb8ffb8ea83f341e5f76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1804599fe5a3988c5fa6a0d70774afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c0edda5725534254122307b7c8815a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0393a6415c78258060096629d199fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad</data>
