<node id="People Category">
  <data key="d0">People Category</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The People Category is a specific classification, structural component, and designated category established within the Knowledge Graph Index. Its primary purpose is to organize, represent, categorize, and track information related to individuals or person entities. Functioning as a key component in managing human-related data within the broader Knowledge Graph framework, it serves a crucial role in structuring and tracking person-related entries and monitoring their total count within the system.

This classification is consistently tracked within the Knowledge Graph Index and is sometimes referred to as part of the Index Overview, Document, Overview Section, or Knowledge Graph Index File. It acts as a conceptual category specifically designed for counting individuals, thereby representing the total number of "People" entries.

Regarding the number of entries, the People Category is widely reported by multiple sources to currently contain 310 individuals, making this the most frequently cited and current count for person-related entries within the Knowledge Graph Index. While some descriptions, including earlier instances, have noted counts of 315 (with one source stating this as consistently shown), as well as 319 and 318 entries, 310 remains the prevailing figure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6fcf70267592172f417dccb380b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e064beaa9addbc9ee14f687e59311381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0e1255b938172ca134381d029ccfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57ca52f28d5bc68f21ab7c9caf670243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6624021287f55bbd038a25dfb41ea597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae97dcf9e925fab8d0b67acde501abdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cfdf2156ab57f335e70ce67a52fd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d38a9ea2781994983d82c56aaf21d90c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3681d76e566b4d7959ebff2e17fcfb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ef545088384ee9d14b145ae009a44f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f197e592637ef1737a9a8857200343b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626897db315a02419d7fa1861812cffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a65285fdf36b982f20efb250e9ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e61da92e53b06903a4888daeacc373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932e70986da082d91d36bf6d3f117889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a448df3934c0032a1a381293f8854d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4766a53f3a7b874f1a7885e6cdb3b9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a068b3c6e1458bfc283574e66abf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d9fab81d1eec0211cefd1449d9763e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a919f3748dda0a162989257025876c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c70fe043587284fd7384360f83de7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcb40ac7623a8d0795573d187ca42a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87973f7f18cf8516d82456867f60e79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e97f01a6c76ac6d4715d960b78e484f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e30357a2804cd093debf64cfb766376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc1acb7742fd80221f70cc930bc3f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdc26ddbfd5a67ff793d2535ecee5ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82dee78d437d05747e42bee23124ec36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d36a38c7bfb8ffb8ea83f341e5f76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1804599fe5a3988c5fa6a0d70774afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c0edda5725534254122307b7c8815a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d</data>
