<node id="KnowledgeGraph/_Index.md">
  <data key="d0">KnowledgeGraph/_Index.md</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">KnowledgeGraph/_Index.md is a specific markdown file, identified by the filename `_index.md`, that functions as the central index for a Knowledge Graph within the Obsidian application. This file serves as the direct source for the content of the Knowledge Graph Index.

Its primary role is to provide an organized entry point and overview for the entire Knowledge Graph. A key feature of this specific markdown file is its automatic update mechanism, which regularly incorporates the latest node counts and recent activity entries, ensuring the index reflects the current state of the Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The source file path for the Knowledge Graph Index document.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific markdown file serving as an index for the Knowledge Graph within Obsidian.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ef545088384ee9d14b145ae009a44f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eb57ca17daeb1dd32503d612878c20c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e30357a2804cd093debf64cfb766376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0393a6415c78258060096629d199fd2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910864</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
