<node id="System Optimization Session">
  <data key="d0">System Optimization Session</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The System Optimization Session was a significant event or activity conducted on March 1, 2026. This session was primarily dedicated to applying major performance tuning to a system, with the comprehensive aim of enhancing its overall performance and stability. It served as an event focused on improving system functionality through concentrated efforts.

During the System Optimization Session, key activities included the implementation of various essential fixes for system components. Notably, a specific fix was applied to address and resolve issues related to "Memory Search." This action was a crucial part of the overall strategy to improve system functionality and performance during this dedicated tuning event, which involved both significant tuning and the application of necessary fixes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48404c33a0cecaca96752c576cc8ff1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ec70c699368a1d1b9b05586b524c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae13fa55ad806299a2566ee6c8b4e8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de88caa5e86668356c547bf8ad59c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ee70ff66b5db6fafbda166046803fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a81e082bc50b15702ab13196b65fcf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910995</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Memory Search">
  <data key="d0">Memory Search</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Memory Search is a system component, function, or capability primarily designed for searching memory and facilitating semantic queries. It operates within a larger memory system context and is specifically noted as a command utilized by Arthur for performing these semantic queries.

This critical system function was identified as requiring and subsequently received a fix during a System Optimization Session. The intervention addressed a bug related to its `baseUrl` when interacting with the Google embedding provider. Prior to this fix, the functionality of Memory Search for searching memory was unavailable. The issue, which effectively presented as a performance or availability problem, was successfully resolved during the System Optimization Session, restoring Memory Search to its intended operational state.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical system function that was subject to a fix to resolve a performance issue.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory Search is a specific search function that was identified as fixed during the System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;A system function that was fixed during the System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific functionality that was fixed during the System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory Search is a specific search function that was identified as fixed during the System Optimization Session.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a96711df30e423083e5615749406cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48404c33a0cecaca96752c576cc8ff1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ec70c699368a1d1b9b05586b524c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae13fa55ad806299a2566ee6c8b4e8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de88caa5e86668356c547bf8ad59c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a81e082bc50b15702ab13196b65fcf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296f2856d7ea85e61339b7d5fc2466b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4652814dbdde910f7f2eb9c027d57b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910844</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Google Embedding Provider">
  <data key="d0">Google Embedding Provider</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Google Embedding Provider is an entity, service, or component developed by Google, primarily responsible for offering crucial embedding services. These embeddings are vital for various system functionalities, including playing a significant role in operations suchated to memory search.

This provider was identified to have a configuration issue where its `baseUrl` was incorrectly set. This misconfiguration specifically impacted its embedding-related functionalities, which in turn adversely affected memory search performance. As part of a broader initiative known as the "Memory Search Fix" and a dedicated system optimization session, the `baseUrl` for the Google Embedding Provider was successfully corrected.

The updated and accurate `baseUrl` is `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`, which is associated with the Generative Language API. The resolution of this configuration discrepancy was a critical step in optimizing the system's overall performance and ensuring the proper functioning of memory search.&lt;SEP&gt;A provider of embedding services whose `baseUrl` was implicated in a memory search fix.&lt;SEP&gt;An embedding provider whose `baseUrl` configuration was corrected as part of a fix.&lt;SEP&gt;A service provider whose base URL was corrected as part of the Memory Search Fix.&lt;SEP&gt;The Google Embedding Provider is a service provider for embeddings that was involved in a fix during system optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;A service provider whose `baseUrl` configuration was corrected as part of the memory search fix.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a96711df30e423083e5615749406cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48404c33a0cecaca96752c576cc8ff1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ec70c699368a1d1b9b05586b524c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae13fa55ad806299a2566ee6c8b4e8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de88caa5e86668356c547bf8ad59c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ee70ff66b5db6fafbda166046803fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a81e082bc50b15702ab13196b65fcf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Generative Language API">
  <data key="d0">Generative Language API</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The correct API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) used for the Google embedding provider.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the correct base URL endpoint used by the Google Embedding Provider.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the specific API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) to which the Google Embedding Provider's Base URL was updated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the specific API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) to which the Google Embedding Provider's Base URL was updated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the specific API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) to which the Google Embedding Provider's Base URL was updated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the specific API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) to which the Google Embedding Provider's Base URL was updated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Generative Language API is the specific API endpoint (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`) to which the Google Embedding Provider's Base URL was updated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd</data>
