<node id="BKK">
  <data key="d0">BKK</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">BKK primarily functions as an abbreviation for Bangkok, the capital and most populous city of Thailand. This designation provides crucial geographical context and serves as a location reference across various data applications and for specific geographical locations.

Its most prominent function is as a timezone identifier, consistently indicating the Bangkok timezone. BKK specifies this timezone for various timestamps, including recorded events, data, and session memory timestamps, such as session snapshots. For example, it denotes the location corresponding to a timestamp like 12:51 on 2026-02-23, acting as a concise identifier for Bangkok's locale in relation to the timing and placement of recorded data. It serves as the time zone reference for session snapshots and a location identifier associated with session memory timestamps, indicating the geographical location where a session snapshot was captured or an event occurred.

Additionally, BKK also functions as an airport code, particularly identifying the departure location of a flight.&lt;SEP&gt;A location identifier associated with a session memory timestamp.&lt;SEP&gt;BKK is an abbreviation for Bangkok, serving as a location reference for events.&lt;SEP&gt;BKK refers to Bangkok, serving as the time zone reference for the session snapshot.&lt;SEP&gt;An abbreviation for Bangkok, Thailand, indicating a timezone or location for the session timestamp.&lt;SEP&gt;BKK is an abbreviation for Bangkok, used to specify a time zone for a timestamp.&lt;SEP&gt;A location identifier associated with a session memory timestamp.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada2e9500cf083516501a8b590959545&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f30a8d91993f68af9395b1e286ae615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d38a9ea2781994983d82c56aaf21d90c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c00b0fb925fc0fb38b49b2e8d3100b63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ef545088384ee9d14b145ae009a44f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320e464065b3308d7db948d1e827156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932e70986da082d91d36bf6d3f117889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d9fab81d1eec0211cefd1449d9763e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87973f7f18cf8516d82456867f60e79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906</data>
