</node>
<node id="Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main">
  <data key="d0">Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main refers to a specific automated process or software agent session primarily understood for its specialization in writing chapters. This particular agent session was active and notably engaged in message exchanges, totaling 20 messages, and also received input via Telegram. Its activities and state were comprehensively captured and recorded as part of a session snapshot. The name "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" serves as the unique identifier or name associated with this specific agent session within these session snapshots, representing the session within the captured data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a96711df30e423083e5615749406cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320e464065b3308d7db948d1e827156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd04a98c88cb9a6e7d71b7f3ad2c996</data>
