<node id="Copy-Editor">
  <data key="d0">Copy-Editor</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Copy-Editor is a specialized agent and a specific role within the professional writing team. It constitutes one of the six distinct agent roles within the 6-Agent Professional Writing Team. In this capacity, the Copy-Editor's primary responsibility is to execute copy-editing tasks, with a particular focus on polishing prose and conducting style reviews.

This role requires meticulous attention to grammar and consistency, ensuring a high standard of precision in written work. To achieve this, the Copy-Editor applies a combination of copywriting and academic-writing-refiner skills. Furthermore, the Copy-Editor is characterized by its use of the Sonnet model as an operational tool to facilitate its tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;A Copy-Editor is a role within the professional writing team.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6555e17adfd0ca119138f8d1204083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-224d09e9eee7d60776394ab22d3cfd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cfc6c6d57918fbe9483abfa3d8a7110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9720ea6318619cc6647cfa0f2e2e7e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46acd3e509aa2a1265a39d2c0a5e6f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7100679e3937becf6384cc43b1a9d6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c054e84c33d3f105219dae9aad1c8a93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-598695207e8db76e95382bd769294fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
