<node id="Opus">
  <data key="d0">Opus</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Opus is an advanced artificial intelligence (AI) model, primarily engineered for complex thinking processes, computationally intensive tasks, and operations requiring significant intellectual effort. It represents a family or lineage of AI models, with specific versions identified as Claude Opus 4-6 and Opus 4-5. Currently, the alias "Opus" refers to Claude Opus 4. Its high level of intelligence positions it as both a product and a benchmark for comparison within the AI landscape, notably with models such as Claude Sonnet 4.6.

Within various professional frameworks, Opus plays a crucial supporting role for specialized agents across diverse teams. In writing teams, it is specifically allocated to handle the intellectual demands and thinking processes of agents like Book-Architect, Research-Lead, Dev-Editor, Publisher, and Fact-Checker. Similarly, within coding teams, Opus is configured for specialized functions such as orchestrator, code-review, and DB-specialist, and is generally utilized by agents comprising the Coding Agent Team.

Opus's capabilities also extend significantly to translation, where it is employed by the Translation Team for various tasks. This includes utilization by agents such as the Thai Translator Agent, Translation-Architect, Thai-Linguist, Cultural-Adapter, Style-Polisher, Quality-Reviewer, and Back-Translator Agent. Furthermore, Opus is leveraged by agents in the Academic Paper Team and the Course Preparation Team, encompassing roles like Course Architect, Curriculum Designer, Book Compiler, and Course Reviewer. It has also been referenced as the model or environment used to generate courses, including "DevOps with VibeCoding."&lt;SEP&gt;A series of AI models, of which Claude Opus 4-6 and Opus 4-5 are specific versions.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is an AI model allocated for thinking within the writing team setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is an entity configured for the roles of orchestrator, code-review, and db-specialist within the coding team.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6555e17adfd0ca119138f8d1204083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff7e841b0e01ffce5ef55c819c75a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-224d09e9eee7d60776394ab22d3cfd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa3eb63b70351ba692b01c713f5ea165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66f668d2ecb13c77d9f77b2ed9d1054c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60b689f3d71dd57c707b347058466c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6287da837abc320ea063bf0536adfe6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f9e405f1bc12388544826efbc16a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405f90d13ba7901a59987c342b6158aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46acd3e509aa2a1265a39d2c0a5e6f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-734ec6fc710d1be198572ead525f9006&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7100679e3937becf6384cc43b1a9d6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b8b8b210560c10d99d3e258c99b2f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572bc319ace0969403b23edbb05f1603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f12cbfe862ebe1e62f29a7e11b350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f92681cbc13202ffab87956e20912b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
