</node>
<node id="Arscontexta">
  <data key="d0">Arscontexta</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Arscontexta is identified as an entity, system, concept, or organization that served as a foundational source and primary inspiration for the development and implementation of the `session_remember.py` script and its related command structure and implementations. It is specifically credited with originating or featuring a distinct `/remember` command, which directly influenced the design and functionality of `session_remember.py`.

Further details indicate that Arscontexta is recognized as a Claude Code plugin. This plugin is specifically designed to facilitate the creation of "second brain systems," utilizing its integrated `/remember` command for this purpose. Consequently, Arscontexta functions as both the conceptual and practical origin point for the `/remember` command, subsequently inspiring the `session_remember.py` tool and its related implementations.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity or system that provided inspiration for the `session_remember.py` implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity or source associated with the "/remember command" which served as an inspiration for "Session_remember.py".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6fcf70267592172f417dccb380b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada2e9500cf083516501a8b590959545&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f30a8d91993f68af9395b1e286ae615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d38a9ea2781994983d82c56aaf21d90c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-335f0ac2fd05e0ccf226886667aaeff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204b0227c0c120113918139adb369e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ef545088384ee9d14b145ae009a44f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f197e592637ef1737a9a8857200343b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-046286456f91967c40b31d2460266cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f517a063be4077d8f0cc42d57aeb7330&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-888fac03c77f9f66eb0e9e6ab9278488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08d8874cbbc7009d283a1206fbf14c31</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
