<node id="Batch Process">
  <data key="d0">Batch Process</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A Batch Process is defined as an automated operation, method, or routine characterized by its recurring, scheduled, or grouped execution of tasks and data processing operations. These processes operate periodically and at specific times, often indicated by timestamps and logs, or in recurring intervals, to perform various system activities, updates, and snapshots. It also refers to a type of data processing or log entry that occurs as part of a batch.

The key responsibilities of a Batch Process include executing the `/remember` command and regularly auto-generating and updating the Knowledge Graph Index. It is also responsible for retrieving and processing data from various sources, facilitating the updating of information from diverse sources such as Memory and Obsidian. An illustrative instance of a Batch Process was noted to have occurred on 2026-02-23 at 18:03.&lt;SEP&gt;A recurring automated process that performs tasks such as executing the /remember command and updating the Knowledge Graph Index.&lt;SEP&gt;A regularly scheduled operation that processes or collects data from various sources at specific times.&lt;SEP&gt;A recurring automated process responsible for updating information from various sources like Memory and Obsidian.&lt;SEP&gt;A periodic, scheduled operation that retrieves and processes data from various sources at specified times.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6fcf70267592172f417dccb380b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada2e9500cf083516501a8b590959545&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae97dcf9e925fab8d0b67acde501abdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320e464065b3308d7db948d1e827156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc1acb7742fd80221f70cc930bc3f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1804599fe5a3988c5fa6a0d70774afe</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
