</node>
<node id="Quick Reference">
  <data key="d0">Quick Reference</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Quick Reference refers to a specialized document type predominantly used within the Obsidian application. This entity serves as a central repository designed to contain critical information, including essential IDs, important links, and key facts. Additionally, a Quick Reference document may feature sections that provide a concise overview of available commands.

A primary characteristic of a Quick Reference document is its design for automatic loading at the start of every Obsidian session, which ensures immediate and consistent accessibility for the user. It is typically manifested as a markdown document, often bearing the title "Obsidian: Quick-Reference.md." An observed instance of such a document was noted to have been updated on 2026-02-17.&lt;SEP&gt;The title of the "Obsidian: Quick-Reference.md" document, containing critical IDs, links, and facts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177684e236b3aa2b6deb2be4c371a77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae13fa55ad806299a2566ee6c8b4e8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-375d1246c2a13185ef31ee0b286cc66d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bb69ddf92ab1babcdff33347dda2cd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910996</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Telegram ID">
  <data key="d0">Telegram ID</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Telegram ID is a unique numerical identifier utilized on the Telegram platform. This identifier serves as a distinct marker primarily used for facilitating communication within the platform's ecosystem. Notably, a Telegram ID is consistently associated with Anirach Mingkhwan on the Telegram platform.&lt;SEP&gt;A Telegram ID is a unique numerical identifier associated with Anirach Mingkhwan on the Telegram platform.&lt;SEP&gt;An identifier used on the Telegram platform.</data>
