  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta is identified as the corrected base URL for the Google Embedding Provider. This URL serves as the fundamental access point or `baseUrl` for interacting with the services offered by the Google Embedding Provider.&lt;SEP&gt;The corrected base URL for the Google Embedding Provider.&lt;SEP&gt;The corrected `baseUrl` for the Google Embedding Provider.</data>
