  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Compaction Summary is a person entity whose role and organization are currently unknown, and who was first documented on 2026-02-17 within a knowledge graph system.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity identified as a person within a knowledge graph, whose role and organization are currently unknown according to its profile.&lt;SEP&gt;A person with an unknown role and organization, whose information is found within the Knowledge Graph and is associated with session notes.&lt;SEP&gt;A document or set of notes created for compaction purposes, including recorded interaction details.&lt;SEP&gt;A markdown document (`Compaction-Summary.md`) found within a specified path, serving as the source for the action item.</data>
