<node id="Role">
  <data key="d0">Role</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A designated function or position of a person, specified as "Unknown" for Compaction Summary in its profile.&lt;SEP&gt;A field indicating a role, which is currently unknown.&lt;SEP&gt;Role is a field associated with "My Workspace" that is listed as unknown.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific function or position attributed to a person, identified as "Unknown" in this context.</data>
