<node id="Summary Compaction">
  <data key="d0">Summary Compaction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of consolidating key state information into a summary, as explicitly mentioned in the session notes.&lt;SEP&gt;Summary Compaction is a process where key state is captured.&lt;SEP&gt;The process by which key state is captured in a summary, occurring after sessions where no new work beyond context loading took place.&lt;SEP&gt;A process by which key state was captured in a session.&lt;SEP&gt;A process used to capture the key state or important information from the session.&lt;SEP&gt;The process or technique used to condense and capture the key state from the session.&lt;SEP&gt;A method by which key state information is captured.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54584911fe0f3952d96167d568620e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf138f605cebd36b4d1e832a3e1e39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740c826e0488c9c7d4bb49a2bc4b77a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564d8cbe6d4c74180f4e5a59066a30ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f172151cb83a3d9c8d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d5a8a323bc9df3696d4d06bbc6d8f6</data>
