  <data key="d0">Version 7 Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Version 7 Paper is a revision of a paper where differentiability, compute feasibility, and Knowledge Graph snapshot dates were fixed.&lt;SEP&gt;Version 7 Paper is a specific version of a research paper.</data>
