  <data key="d0">Version 8 Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Version 8 Paper is a revision of a paper that addressed all 9 reviewer concerns and achieved an estimated score of 8.5/10.&lt;SEP&gt;Version 8 Paper is a specific version of a research paper.</data>
