  <data key="d2">UI-UX-P is a specific skill related to Frontend Design.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific skill under Frontend Design that was installed via ClawHub CLI.&lt;SEP&gt;UI-UX-P is a skill or category of skills, specifically related to Frontend Design.&lt;SEP&gt;UI-UX-P is a specific skill listed under Frontend Design.</data>
