<node id="Bookshelf App Project">
  <data key="d0">Bookshelf App Project</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bookshelf App Project is a software development initiative focused on creating a bookshelf application. This project is physically located at the directory `/home/clawdbot/Projects/bookshelf`, which is situated within Clawdbot's home directory.

For its development, the project utilizes a specific technology stack that includes Next.js 14, shadcn/ui, Prisma 5, and SQLite. Its current status is "Setup Complete," indicating that the initial setup has been successfully completed. The project has defined database schema models, and its database has been comprehensively seeded with sample books, making it ready for immediate use or further development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
