<node id="Next.js 14">
  <data key="d0">Next.js 14</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Next.js 14 is a specific version of the Next.js framework, primarily identified as a versatile web framework, a JavaScript framework, and a React framework. It is frequently utilized for the frontend development of various projects, serving as a key technology component within diverse application stacks. This version of the framework is employed to build and deploy multiple applications, notably integrating the App Router as part of its technical capabilities.

Next.js 14 is prominently featured in the technology stack for several projects. These include the Bookshelf App Project, the Personal Books Management System, and the AI Research Dashboard. Additionally, it is a crucial technology component in the building of the ChartSense AI MVP.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific version of the Next.js framework used in the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2626ac3c4b4db2e1bb9274c8b58fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd7088becf52bb8a5c2ed784265260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22b397f0555571eb32ef1aaf94d5749&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b0e643ebc37d6e483ed820982ca193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a565252329bd2232fc1e37e01833463d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d411b7c268eefaf6545f390f13955282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6fa5185c9089469b0345bd617969a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd423fd12ecb6cccdd6c05c4eee67a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdd7a8ac37441f958ecd1d004dda478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e9ea9f9ef3e6e49b68f230ad0b56ef</data>
