<node id="Shadcn/UI">
  <data key="d0">Shadcn/UI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Shadcn/UI is recognized as a versatile UI component library or framework, serving as both a technology component and a tool for user interface development. It is primarily utilized by the UX/UI Designer Agent, forming a key part of their expertise in user interface design and being embraced for its contribution to clean design.

This UI component library is implemented in various specific projects and systems. It functions as a component within the technology stack of the Bookshelf App Project and is also employed in the Personal Books Management System. Furthermore, Shadcn/UI is used in the construction of the AI Research Dashboard. The application of Shadcn/UI is often associated with a skill set that includes both Shadcn/UI itself and Tailwind patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool or framework used by the UX/UI Designer Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool or framework used by the UX/UI Designer Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool or framework used by the UX/UI Designer Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool or framework used by the UX/UI Designer Agent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d395d729f7f4af176337bfefc3a79dd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c9f0047cf0851b406258ad13a0ecf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22b397f0555571eb32ef1aaf94d5749&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb41aa2ca304e58f55fd006f67adb483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d310a4043708aa267f31226740ed083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b037432a7b9144971fd46cf952d906de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22dff12fa45dfc4789663451e530bd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4a759f0caa83cf9e50057d50a49419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d411b7c268eefaf6545f390f13955282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b</data>
