<node id="Prisma 5">
  <data key="d0">Prisma 5</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Prisma 5 is a specific version of the Prisma Object-Relational Mapper (ORM) and database toolkit. It is a key technology component primarily utilized for database interaction within the technology stack of the Bookshelf App Project, enabling the application to effectively manage and interact with its underlying database.

This particular version was chosen as the preferred option for the project, specifically selected over Prisma 7, indicating a deliberate decision in its adoption. Prisma 5's use is also associated with providing a simpler setup for database management within the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific version of the Prisma ORM used in the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific version of the Prisma ORM used in the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific version of the Prisma ORM used in the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c58b42bcfbdc99ab572d190b27de5882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910265</data>
