</node>
<node id="SQLite">
  <data key="d0">SQLite</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SQLite is a widely utilized database technology and system, distinguished as a lightweight, serverless, and file-based relational database management system (RDBMS). It is implemented as a C-language library, functioning as a small, fast, self-contained, high-reliability, and full-featured SQL database engine. Its design prioritizes efficiency and ease of use, making it a core technology component across various projects and frequently chosen for local development.

SQLite's versatility is demonstrated by its integration into diverse technological environments. It serves as a fundamental database system and a key part of the technology stack for projects such as the Bookshelf App Project and the Personal Books Management System. Additionally, it was employed for development purposes in the AI Research Dashboard project.

Beyond these specific applications, SQLite's adaptability extends to its role in integration efforts and its utilization within memory systems for data storage and management. The system is also actively pursuing compatibility with the Prisma schema, further underscoring its relevance in modern development practices.&lt;SEP&gt;A database system used in the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;A database system used in the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2626ac3c4b4db2e1bb9274c8b58fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cfb904110c88a597561e8879c2ca0b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd7088becf52bb8a5c2ed784265260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22b397f0555571eb32ef1aaf94d5749&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b0e643ebc37d6e483ed820982ca193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a565252329bd2232fc1e37e01833463d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f070dc633489f685a59e40392fc9154a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3798f4a234fcc46c4df14537567aed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db2cbf7fe0012c6db40e7c54c9c9cbca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-387451f490b8bbdc96813bcc96b62b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d411b7c268eefaf6545f390f13955282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6fa5185c9089469b0345bd617969a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a77499fd86767b7b2628b024b4cadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f681751f508fd167c31bbe1d202056b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910266</data>
