<node id="Database Schema">
  <data key="d0">Database Schema</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Database Schema serves as the structural definition and design of the database specifically created for the Bookshelf App Project. It outlines the overall organization and framework of the data within this application.

This schema comprehensively details various data models crucial for the Bookshelf App. These include, but are not limited to, the Book model, the Author model, and the Genre model. Beyond just defining these individual components, the Database Schema also specifies and defines the relationships that exist between these models, ensuring a cohesive and interconnected database structure.&lt;SEP&gt;The structured definition for the Bookshelf App Project's database, including models for Book, Author, and Genre.&lt;SEP&gt;The structure defining models like Book, Author, and Genre for the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The structure defining models like Book, Author, and Genre for the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The structure defining models like Book, Author, and Genre for the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The structure defining models like Book, Author, and Genre for the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910269</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Book Model">
  <data key="d0">Book Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Book Model is a specific data model implemented within the database schema for the Bookshelf App Project. It functions as a database schema model, specifically designed to represent books and their associated relations within the project's data structure.

This model is an integral part of the overall database setup for the Bookshelf App Project. It serves as a defined entity model within the project's database schema, capturing the essential structure for managing book-related data.&lt;SEP&gt;A model defined within the database schema for the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772910269</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Author Model">
  <data key="d0">Author Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Author Model is a data model, also referred to as a database model, specifically defined within the Database Schema for the Bookshelf App Project. It is an integral component of this overall database schema.

The primary purpose of the Author Model is to represent authors within the database schema setup for the project. This model incorporates relations and serves as a specific entity model designed to manage author data efficiently within the Bookshelf App.&lt;SEP&gt;A model defined within the database schema for the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
