<node id="Genre Model">
  <data key="d0">Genre Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Genre Model is a core component and specific entity model defined within the database schema of the Bookshelf App Project. It functions as a dedicated data model tasked with representing and managing genre information for the application.

This model is an integral part of the overall database setup, incorporated into the Bookshelf App to establish the necessary structure and relations for accurately handling genres. Its primary purpose within the Bookshelf App Project is to ensure the comprehensive and organized storage of all genre-related data.&lt;SEP&gt;A model defined within the database schema for the Bookshelf App Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b066b3b635168888a671932f0d4aa9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71616aeafc61b899b58cf170dee71ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7f38dc891390630b7d242b504ad3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa45fc280386a72b3dcb6042866c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe07ef6b9827112c8ed827b7ae0cbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27eb544ea04492b03b59296d1e3b207f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563e9b5c607a87d47046fea356d51100&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a000ee9fe32af97bf41c1cb4481251e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d</data>
