<node id="2026-02-23">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-23</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The date 2026-02-23 is identified as a significant timestamp associated with a variety of key activities, operational decisions, and project initiations. On this specific date, interactions were recorded concerning the Obsidian People File, particularly regarding "Skills-Installed," alongside a batch process and a memory entry noted at 12:51 BKK. It also marks the creation date for the Sandbox Docker entry and subsequent related interactions.

Numerous important operational decisions were documented on 2026-02-23. These include the implementation of `session_remember.py`, the directive to "Always Spawn Sub-Agents For Tasks &gt;30 Seconds," and the policy that the system should "Always reply in English unless told otherwise."

Furthermore, 2026-02-23 is linked to the initiation and development of various projects. It signifies the creation date for both the "Translation Team" project and the "Writing Team" project, and is connected to general document updates. Updates and progress for the "HA Database Work" project were also recorded on this date. Overall, 2026-02-23 is consistently associated with the creation or context of multiple action items, including specifically the "Rebuild Week 6 Sub-Agent action item."&lt;SEP&gt;The specific date associated with the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific date documented in the Agent Work Log.&lt;SEP&gt;The date when the document was last updated.</data>
