<node id="2026-02-17">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-17</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The date 2026-02-17 represents a significant timestamp within a knowledge management system, serving as a pivotal marker for numerous creation events, extensive recorded interactions and updates, and key decisions. This date is consistently associated with the creation or recording of various action items and their source memories, specifically including the NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search action item and its source memory, as well as Action Item V11 and its source. It is considered the likely creation or tracking date for these and other action items, and also marks the date for the Paper Journey Report Re-attempt.

On 2026-02-17, a comprehensive range of knowledge graph entries, entities, profiles, and documents were established. These creations encompass "Skills Installed" (both as a person entry and its knowledge graph entry), "New Ar," "Cron Fix," "Memory Maintenance," "All Reviewers," "New Skills," "Skills Installation Document," "Large Language," "My Workspace," "Causal Insight," "Strategic Thinking" (person's knowledge graph entry), "Topic Index," "Agent Team," "Teams Fully," "Aubrai Longevity," "Atomic Habits," "Steve Jobs," "Docker Compose," "Translation Team," "Extraction Pipeline," "Design Decisions," "Graph Retrieval," "Personal Books," "Translation Complete," "Team Workflows," and "Fullstack Development." Additional entries include the markdown file for "Used Aubrai," the "In Progress" log, "Key Relationships," "Working Copy," "Page Reduction," "Fixed Type," "Men Nobel," "Daily Notes" (person entity), "Make Thai" (knowledge graph entry), "Plus Project," "Encrypted Fields," "System Overview," "Session Key," "Analysis Needs," and "Chart Completeness." Several projects were also initiated on this date: RAG Second Brain (AIiH 2026), NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search, Academic Workflow V2, Workshop DOCX Generator, Knowledge Graph Auto-Extraction Pipeline, "iPhone Obsidian Sync," "gog CLI," and Obsidian Vault Overhaul.

Beyond new creations, 2026-02-17 functioned as a timestamp for extensive recorded interactions and updates, particularly within Obsidian. This involved interaction logs for "Daily/2026-02-01.md," "Daily/2026-02-15.md," and "Daily/2026-01-26.md," along with interactions related to "Memory Maintenance," "Large Language," daily notes linked to "My Workspace," "Causal Insight," and topic tracking for "Topic Index." Interactions with the "Agent Team," "Teams Fully," "Aubrai Longevity," "Docker Compose," and the "Translation Team" were also recorded. Updates were timestamped for "Quick Reference" (including 'Quick-Reference.md'), "RAG Second Brain (AIiH 2026)," the "VPIPE Database Query Guide" (for the System Overview entity), and the "ChartSense AI MVP" document. Project updates were logged for NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search, Workshop DOCX Generator (initial status), "Three Old Men: Nobel Edition," VPIPE Database (including configuration details), "gog CLI," "Enhanced Agent Soul Format," KMUTNB Project, and Obsidian Vault Overhaul. An update for the agent configuration was completed, and various memory timestamps, "Memory Entry" updates, a TypeScript error decision, multiple session notes, and interactions related to "Men Nobel" and Nobel Edition were recorded.

Furthermore, 2026-02-17 marks the specific date for key decisions, such as modifications to the Prisma schema and the determination regarding OpenClaw Web UI access. This date also notably coincides with the release of Claude Sonnet 4.6.&lt;SEP&gt;The creation date of the `Daily Notes` person entity.&lt;SEP&gt;The creation date of the `Daily Notes` person entity.&lt;SEP&gt;The creation date of the `Daily Notes` person entity.</data>
