<node id="Authorization Code Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Authorization Code Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Authorization Code Exchange is a specific and crucial step within the setup process for Google Calendar integration. This process fundamentally involves the use of Google OAuth credentials. During the Authorization Code Exchange, authorization codes are exchanged to obtain the necessary authorization, a process that can also lead to the generation of authorization URLs required for the integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A step in the Google Calendar integration setup process, involving the use of Google OAuth credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;Authorization Code Exchange is a specific step in the setup process for Google Calendar integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific step within the Google Calendar integration setup process, involving the use of Google OAuth credentials to generate authorization.&lt;SEP&gt;A step in the Google Calendar integration process involving the generation of an authorization URL using Google OAuth credentials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-70c5932aa815cd6eef3ea2972206ea5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113056c9501e9b2d79be577e20d93410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aac26b6f017550e6b8be634bc44e292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e7e57ff161e4beebd9512df721459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625b5a08676aa70ebee9d5d5c5803fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b09e05a7e31f0c9576ad10f1a2885e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e55ed8097afa7059c8bb422a3149921a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932186885558d1449f2179e933b5649a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bdd05384cd19411b8d7358f5ff4a53e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
