  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Google Calendar Integration">
  <data key="d0">Google Calendar Integration</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Calendar Integration refers to a successful setup process or system feature designed to enable functionality and interaction with Google Calendar. This integration was consistently reported as successfully completed or set up for Anirach, appearing multiple times as the recipient of this setup.

The implementation of Google Calendar Integration facilitates interaction with the calendar service, typically requiring an authorization process to establish the necessary connectivity. Some successful setups involved a guided, step-by-step chat to ensure proper configuration. In one documented instance, the integration for Anirach was specifically set up by Daily Memory.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Calendar Integration is a process successfully set up for Anirach through a step-by-step chat.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Calendar Integration is a project that was successfully completed for Anirach through a step-by-step chat process.&lt;SEP&gt;A successful setup of Google Calendar functionality for Anirach.&lt;SEP&gt;A project focused on setting up the integration of Google Calendar, successfully completed.&lt;SEP&gt;The successful setup process of connecting Google Calendar for Anirach, completed on January 28, 2026.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-70c5932aa815cd6eef3ea2972206ea5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113056c9501e9b2d79be577e20d93410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aac26b6f017550e6b8be634bc44e292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e7e57ff161e4beebd9512df721459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b09e05a7e31f0c9576ad10f1a2885e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e55ed8097afa7059c8bb422a3149921a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d526320401eafeca2cd894cd415353dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932186885558d1449f2179e933b5649a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81dc2baf0c4cbe3330034151f181683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bdd05384cd19411b8d7358f5ff4a53e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
