<node id="ChartSense AI MVP">
  <data key="d0">ChartSense AI MVP</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product (MVP) planned for Thai hospitals.&lt;SEP&gt;A full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product intended for Thai hospitals.&lt;SEP&gt;A full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product (MVP) proposed for implementation in Thai hospitals.&lt;SEP&gt;ChartSense AI MVP is a full-stack clinical decision support Minimal Viable Product built for Thai hospitals. It is the first module of MedPlatform AI.&lt;SEP&gt;A project focused on building a full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product for Thai hospitals, created on 2026-02-18 and tagged with 'knowledge-graph'.&lt;SEP&gt;ChartSense AI MVP is the subject for which code review and iteration are needed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Minimum Viable Product for the ChartSense AI project, built by a coding sub-agent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-209a10793a38ab9ffb1236b426b5f37a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88e992b721430779160720a86027f0b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09f974a7e07b869b8c3e753624d8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5417077f85913ac654cb9438d364edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0dbd2623c1412584ac614bdc4cdc4f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e9ea9f9ef3e6e49b68f230ad0b56ef</data>
