<node id="Thai Hospitals">
  <data key="d0">Thai Hospitals</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Thai Hospitals are healthcare institutions located in Thailand that are consistently identified as the primary target group, intended beneficiaries, target users, and target recipients for the ChartSense AI project. They represent the target organizations for this initiative.

Specifically, Thai Hospitals are the main focus and intended users for the ChartSense AI Minimum Viable Product (MVP). This MVP is described as a clinical decision support MVP, often referred to as a full-stack clinical decision support MVP, indicating that these hospitals are the recipients of this particular clinical decision support system. More broadly, Thai Hospitals serve as the target for both ChartSense AI and other Healthcare AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The target organizations in Thailand for which the Clinical Decision Support MVP is being developed.&lt;SEP&gt;The target recipients for the full-stack clinical decision support MVP.&lt;SEP&gt;Thai Hospitals are the target users or beneficiaries of the ChartSense AI project.&lt;SEP&gt;Hospitals located in Thailand that are the target beneficiaries for the clinical decision support system developed by the ChartSense AI MVP project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-209a10793a38ab9ffb1236b426b5f37a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88e992b721430779160720a86027f0b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e70d63a61fe7a75ad278b4906fa6902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b18094093f4014f080a85150727b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09f974a7e07b869b8c3e753624d8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3dd06c1a00444deb7203ca5c811e8f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484d26d16f8d22b0da30066e9b461f34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59f16b1e1e1f9a1732b774399d2bd439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c61305010d941a0cbc5e2beb2a1457a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c2cf118771e37b1701f3d28209a3b1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbc27820764894775d4457c170c4c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5417077f85913ac654cb9438d364edf</data>
