<node id="KnowledgeGraph">
  <data key="d0">KnowledgeGraph</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The KnowledgeGraph is a comprehensive conceptual system, structure, method, framework, data structure, project, or repository, fundamentally designed for organizing, representing, storing, and actively utilizing information and knowledge. It operates as a structured, consistently managed, implemented, and indexed collection of information within the Obsidian environment, where it functions as both a system and a project. It is also identified as a key component or concept of the RAG Second Brain project, serving as a structured database where extracted knowledge is stored and updated.

Its primary purpose is to store documentation and details across diverse categories, providing essential context for various entries and topics, and acting as an overarching organizational structure. The KnowledgeGraph serves as the source or context for documents, decisions, and action items, and is the overarching system where the Decisions Index and its entries are located.

The information organized within the KnowledgeGraph explicitly includes categories such as people, projects, topics, documents, decisions, discussion topics, action items, and events. Specific entities and entries it encompasses include the AI topic, the Skills Integration project, 'Session Major', the 'Research Dashboard' (identified as a person), the 'AI Research Dashboard' (identified as a project), 'Not Started', 'With Experiments', 'RAG Second Brain Paper', and the defined "Design System" entity. It also holds data on individuals like 'Add Thai', and provides structure for topics such as clinical decision support and files related to "Fixed Type".

The organizational approach of the KnowledgeGraph utilizes file paths, source paths, and tags, exemplified by those for 'Molecular Networks', to reference various information. It is consistently associated with action items and decisions through tagging, and is frequently identified as the source and tag for such items. Furthermore, it serves as a tag or category for various projects, including the "Opus Model Fix" project, the PPlus Project Management Testing project, and the Claude Sonnet 4.6 project, providing context for their file locations and indicating their domain. This comprehensive and context-rich structure supports its diverse collection of knowledge.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ffee7e99a39b11f6d9d6277ba5594d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af547d3e45d8ad51a44b6437545d4bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2626ac3c4b4db2e1bb9274c8b58fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576fa1ed41557cc09379e9532cd8fc48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57ca52f28d5bc68f21ab7c9caf670243&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd7088becf52bb8a5c2ed784265260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbbf68c07d5785152cb568cb44c097d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7347a0c6ac17d9cb58ce4f8eb857eb12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771986aa17685fe6999e419c1c67ae69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f4a294ac24bcb979aea9c7e4c009069&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76861888b327c0c03774d2fd66bfaab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6e31e647978359fa53f0dd27331186&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1abf1dd7476e5eb1c0db2bb8d8add16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed27af01b8224522c0df0deaa303c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-554d48815662523a4566bd006ddfa93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ead8544b47924f162b545eeb22ee7cde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec31c467d15fe3c5a28ca03d1304cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba786cd22db86d2c9ebb524a6edc0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6be54c929385dd071c3a049be5445ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bfa5f27fd3e3a037eabf52850861f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a75b2ce01f9e8a4a2e070eacf7cb181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f208e1d05e729c9f051bb57826ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114148647602381f69f112362757b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-724cda2fbcd761a77f25ca1db8e8f1b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ebfa2f242a019d7d9b895301fab41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d26eb346378dcde8c223fffaf61172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d14155767fde5f62677e73a2911e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402751e915ac66eace343513a646b9aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f9c532c1ef2142c9cb9c2c5b2791c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d23e3547ea2f41db3dc5cffdc7388d1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d506075ad34c2f4ce76fc5810a0edb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b67ffc11722246fc37b75f112235ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cae40cb3e01f7f44617fe6efce540e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5ee91f5b0653fb208892bb9c89c90a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97302f6791a6d0506598c8441994ff20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d72af6b995c588bb7a33620adf0464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739341af4859db771cb8a894d0064928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a7afa2a34a0bfea635aa35eb49a984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405f90d13ba7901a5