<node id="Academic Research Workflow Automation System">
  <data key="d0">Academic Research Workflow Automation System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Academic Research Workflow Automation System is a complete and successfully implemented system designed to automate various tasks and processes within academic research. This system was specifically set up for Anirach.

Its core functionalities include daily monitoring of ArXiv for new publications, conducting relevance analysis on the monitored content, and generating weekly reports in DOCX format. Furthermore, the system features integration with Google, enhancing its capabilities in supporting the academic research workflow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a52871670ef07a5a1ba116162391d222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8983e2b4c186fcc645136f51f241d354&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec31c467d15fe3c5a28ca03d1304cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa16d640114a6b282a0112d48e402e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484af61c17248dd97c9673e37b363c48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73ac488745d210b519b8306ed123348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b8c58cedfa24794136151188ad15e5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772608419</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daily ArXiv Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Daily ArXiv Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily ArXiv Monitoring is an automated system component that serves as an integral part of the Academic Research Workflow Automation System. Its primary function involves the automated, daily scanning of ArXiv to identify new content.

This component is specifically designed to focus its scanning activities on a set of predefined or specified ArXiv categories. These targeted categories include, but are not limited to, cs.AI, cs.LG, cs.CL, cs.CV, cs.NE, cs.HC, and stat.ML.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily ArXiv Monitoring is an automated process for scanning specific ArXiv categories, serving as a component of the Academic Research Workflow Automation System.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily ArXiv Monitoring is a system component for automated scanning of specified ArXiv categories.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily ArXiv Monitoring is an automated scanning component of the academic research workflow automation system, designed to monitor specific ArXiv categories.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific feature of the academic research automation system for daily monitoring of ArXiv.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the academic research automation system responsible for automated scanning of specified ArXiv categories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a52871670ef07a5a1ba116162391d222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8983e2b4c186fcc645136f51f241d354&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec31c467d15fe3c5a28ca03d1304cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8633d83c79a5da228b3867f7281be838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5213a762ce016e71e34ba175a039776c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa16d640114a6b282a0112d48e402e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484af61c17248dd97c9673e37b363c48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73ac488745d210b519b8306ed123348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be32808c942011a178df2564dffe6d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b8c58cedfa24794136151188ad15e5</data>
