  <data key="d0">Google</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google is an organization that serves as an entity, service, or system with which the Academic Research Workflow Automation System is integrated. It is consistently listed within various organizations indexes, including a general Organizations Index. More specifically, Google is referenced as an entry within the Knowledge Graph's organizations index and the 'Organizations' index of the Obsidian knowledge graph.&lt;SEP&gt;Google is an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization listed in the Organizations index.</data>
