<node id="Longevity Research">
  <data key="d0">Longevity Research</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Longevity Research is a new and specific area of scientific inquiry, a distinct research domain and field of study dedicated to life extension and aging studies. This active research interest focuses on understanding the complex processes and mechanisms of aging, with the primary goal of developing strategies and interventions to extend healthy human lifespan.

Considered a recent addition to academic and scientific landscapes, Longevity Research is sometimes explicitly incorporated into broader research topic updates. It can be viewed as a specific research area within the broader field of Longevity Healthcare Research. This scientific study actively tracks developments in key related fields, including senolytics, caloric restriction mimetics, and NAD+ precursors.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific research area focused on life extension and aging studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97fe0dddb24f17a6ff26b65970479fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40fa075485b63447273b59dcdd10fadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a1a85c141b50ecd59f3a228d81569a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76861888b327c0c03774d2fd66bfaab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76ef76bfb529eb0424bbe3db7d86acc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6403ad3df78ad1415d5338e0674cf444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5762a88e509b59d9d8b593ccc501736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb209bf42350b9e170471b4f0b4d8f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a2b27b656d4020fb0b84a1e76aa64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5204e58e96ccc3f2974e3d4a25f97fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff940504f8d9447b54a694d9aa350b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a903be8a6a1e664f8430b600a9d758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34046874b056af12d4a0f9e5fe55895f</data>
