<node id="Life Extension And Aging Studies">
  <data key="d0">Life Extension And Aging Studies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Life Extension And Aging Studies is a specialized field of study that focuses on the concepts of extending life and thoroughly understanding the complex processes of aging. This area is consistently described as a specific sub-area, a crucial focus area, or even the defining characteristic within the broader domain of Longevity Research.

It encompasses various specific studies and research initiatives dedicated to increasing lifespan and unraveling the biological mechanisms behind aging. As a new research area, "Life Extension And Aging Studies" serves as a central pillar of longevity research, categorizing and defining the efforts to enhance human longevity and improve healthspan.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Extension And Aging Studies is a sub-topic within longevity research.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific topics falling under the domain of Longevity Research.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific focus and content of Longevity Research.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific studies and research areas encompassed within longevity research.</data>
