<node id="OpenClaw Migration">
  <data key="d0">OpenClaw Migration</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The OpenClaw Migration is consistently described as a major and successful event, characterized as a process or transition of a system. This migration specifically involved moving the system from Clawdbot v2026.1.24-3 to OpenClaw v2026.1.30. While most accounts specify these exact version numbers, some descriptions refer to the source and target systems more broadly as Clawdbot and OpenClaw, respectively.

One description indicates that the OpenClaw Migration occurred on 2026-02-01. Regarding the performer of this migration, there is variation across descriptions, with the responsibility attributed to Cron Fix, New Skills, and Covered Grim in different accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;The OpenClaw Migration is a major event that involved successfully migrating software from Clawdbot to OpenClaw.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f03d87d29d168bf712ab2a573dc369b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214eb95bbeefec9c60503afe48c2e638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d20e1a818b86a3a5146ae93eab559dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0494f9964c512c3bd5182e3d233fba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8958041a8e38ef2d5adde44b86d37b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1a879a09130cca84364cf74d7544cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691dc72e802a20ddfbc11e2793cf4e4</data>
