<node id="Clawdbot">
  <data key="d0">Clawdbot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Clawdbot primarily refers to a software product or system that holds a significant place in a rebranding history. It served as an original or earlier brand name for a software system that was subsequently rebranded to Moltbot, and eventually to OpenClaw. This software system, specifically identified by version v2026.1.24-3, was the source for both the OpenClaw Migration and the OpenClaw Setup, functioning as an original agent infrastructure from which the migration to OpenClaw was decided and occurred. It is recognized as the previous name of the `openclaw` software package and the related system from which the OpenClaw project was updated.

Beyond its software identity, Clawdbot is also associated with a user or system account. This account is linked to the project's home directory, located at `/home/clawdbot`, which stores AIiH 2026 templates. This indicates Clawdbot's role in managing system templates or related data, and it is implied to be the user or owner of this home directory. This entity or system context is associated with various file paths and directories, such as `/home/clawdbot/clawd`, and is additionally linked to an Obsidian Vault.

Concurrently, "Clawdbot" is also identified as a distinct entity referring to a person. This individual's daily progress and interactions are being tracked, particularly within the context of a DevOps course.&lt;SEP&gt;A user or system persona associated with the home directory `/home/clawdbot/`.&lt;SEP&gt;Clawdbot is an older name for the software system, from which it was rebranded.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f03d87d29d168bf712ab2a573dc369b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214eb95bbeefec9c60503afe48c2e638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d20e1a818b86a3a5146ae93eab559dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eb7ca5cebf42843dcb95415b20a2d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0494f9964c512c3bd5182e3d233fba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8958041a8e38ef2d5adde44b86d37b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1a879a09130cca84364cf74d7544cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6bf94f806b19bcd3c3ef94a2f41033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691dc72e802a20ddfbc11e2793cf4e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baaf507a401ba4db4b25918ac4bcf203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c210fbf27b64754ccea3143cf2159603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7e517a45d00cee8aed76a975af9bd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771a2e8e4cd46c72a573a9ec2caf7c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000e5cbc3c5b62de4af4981edce03d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
