  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moltbot">
  <data key="d0">Moltbot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Moltbot is a software product and brand name that served as an intermediate identity within the rebranding history of a particular software system. This system was initially known as Clawdbot and ultimately evolved into OpenClaw.

Moltbot succeeded Clawdbot as a previous name for the software, forming part of a transitional phase that was reportedly initiated due to factors such as trademark issues and the necessity for security hardening. It represents the name used after Clawdbot and before the final adoption of OpenClaw, making it a key component in the software's naming evolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Moltbot is a previous name for the software, mentioned as part of its rebranding history.&lt;SEP&gt;Moltbot is an intermediate name in the rebranding history of the software system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f03d87d29d168bf712ab2a573dc369b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214eb95bbeefec9c60503afe48c2e638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d20e1a818b86a3a5146ae93eab559dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0494f9964c512c3bd5182e3d233fba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8958041a8e38ef2d5adde44b86d37b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1a879a09130cca84364cf74d7544cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691dc72e802a20ddfbc11e2793cf4e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772610028</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
