<node id="Memory Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Memory Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">"Memory Maintenance" refers to two distinct concepts identified within the knowledge graph: a person entity and a recurring activity.

As a person entity, Memory Maintenance is classified within an Obsidian Knowledge Graph. The individual's specific role and organizational affiliation are currently unknown. The record for this person entity was created on February 17, 2026, and their daily interactions are tracked within the Obsidian daily notes. This person is also noted to be responsible for performing weekly memory maintenance activities.

Concurrently, "Memory Maintenance" describes a weekly activity or event that takes place at 3 AM. This process primarily involves the review and update of memory files, specifically including the update of `MEMORY.md`. Historical records indicate instances of this activity occurring on February 15, 2026, and February 17, 2026. One description notes this activity is performed by "Weekly Memory".&lt;SEP&gt;Memory Maintenance is a weekly process involving the review and updating of memory files and the MEMORY.md document.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory Maintenance is a weekly scheduled activity performed at 3 AM for reviewing and updating memory files.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of scanning memory files, extracting lessons, and updating the MEMORY.md file.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c758a8c08dcaf507d7e3c18d75d2cefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f9f63c5b94225c308595bfb9786f642&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-356a7e2f722bc7cd4054e7e8e11265a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84cf29bb492f5df9040017ff94a75e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a6acf4ff121bf38f43ff721b71a701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac86759c81403a13eab4bdb09f79eadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-521f31ad3498d511d1daef16699339a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22dff12fa45dfc4789663451e530bd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cd9e790bea697b6917062a98648fd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-235bc07c09f26fdcb46115a35a1fb596</data>
