<node id="Personal Books Management System">
  <data key="d0">Personal Books Management System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployed project built using Next.js 14, shadcn/ui, Tailwind, Prisma, and SQLite, featuring a dashboard, books list, add/edit forms, and book detail with reading progress.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployed software project built using Next.js 14, shadcn/ui, Tailwind, Prisma, and SQLite, featuring a dashboard and book management functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Personal Books Management System is a deployed project built with a Next.js 14, shadcn/ui, Tailwind, Prisma, and SQLite stack, featuring dashboard, books list, and forms.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployed software project built with Next.js 14, shadcn/ui, Tailwind, Prisma, and SQLite. It features a dashboard, books list, add/edit forms, book detail with reading progress, server actions for CRUD, and 5 seeded sample books.&lt;SEP&gt;A complete application built and deployed, featuring a dashboard, book lists, forms, and detail views.</data>
