<node id="KnowledgeGraph/_index.md">
  <data key="d0">KnowledgeGraph/_index.md</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">"KnowledgeGraph/_index.md" is a specific, auto-generated Markdown file integral to the Obsidian knowledge graph system, typically located within its `KnowledgeGraph` directory. This file serves a foundational role primarily as an index type, consistently functioning as the definitive source for the "Knowledge Graph Index" content. Its specific file path within Obsidian underscores its importance as the origin point and a core reference for the broader knowledge graph.

Beyond its central indexing function, "KnowledgeGraph/_index.md" is also utilized as an internal source for critical operational information within the Obsidian environment. It provides context for decisions, serves as a reference point for status updates, and acts as an internal source for action item metadata. Furthermore, the file captures specific events and data points relevant to the knowledge graph's operational history, exemplified by records such as an interaction on 2026-02-17 at 18:02, and contains information related to batch processes. It is identified as the source file path for the Knowledge Graph Index document.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific markdown file within Obsidian, identified as the source for the Knowledge Graph Index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2df7e45fa50bcc56ec15623582e80a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae97dcf9e925fab8d0b67acde501abdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-687c7ffaca7f439954f9a043c1fd03e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3681d76e566b4d7959ebff2e17fcfb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ef6afccf813cd51132383190fec7d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b72c9581d600c3f20a8bdb9ee8741deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dfa826c7c52d66bfc6ad79969fe0987&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a448df3934c0032a1a381293f8854d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-521f51cb7088ea1256e4e2e3d6ab655d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4766a53f3a7b874f1a7885e6cdb3b9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb061fa6be422bbf34b9117831dfcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdc26ddbfd5a67ff793d2535ecee5ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc</data>
