<node id="Obsidian: KnowledgeGraph/_index.md">
  <data key="d0">Obsidian: KnowledgeGraph/_index.md</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">"Obsidian: KnowledgeGraph/_index.md" designates a specific Markdown file within the Obsidian platform, operating as a crucial and authoritative component of an Obsidian Knowledge Graph system. This file is specifically located within the `KnowledgeGraph` directory and functions as an 'index' type, primarily used to store knowledge graph metadata.

Its fundamental role is to serve as the designated, primary, and authoritative source from which the Knowledge Graph Index data is generated, auto-generated, and updated. The content of "Obsidian: KnowledgeGraph/_index.md" offers an essential overview of various categories, recent activity, and categorized data documented within the Knowledge Graph, effectively serving as the "Knowledge Graph Index."

Beyond its central indexing function, this file also acts as a primary data source for specific batch events and offers specific context for decisions. It further functions as a source document or file path for action items, indicating where additional information can be located. The file incorporates vital metadata, such as update timestamps and descriptive tags, thereby solidifying its position as a comprehensive and central reference point for the Knowledge Graph.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad0e1255b938172ca134381d029ccfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d4b2ec7ee0c088af57b411041ae5e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320e464065b3308d7db948d1e827156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f197e592637ef1737a9a8857200343b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3798f4a234fcc46c4df14537567aed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2948e4d867e4934b354be8aaec232e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32b91efbe6e5718dfa15ab0b00ab7fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd46500b014c2c543df74acf13acc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a068b3c6e1458bfc283574e66abf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e97f01a6c76ac6d4715d960b78e484f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d36a38c7bfb8ffb8ea83f341e5f76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a7df3853cff31dc6e6b38e8ad17a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c0edda5725534254122307b7c8815a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054fad68bfc06d233635a4bc62f06276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721</data>
