<node id="Quick Status Legend">
  <data key="d0">Quick Status Legend</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Quick Status Legend is a system that defines the status symbols (Active / In Progress, Completed, Paused / On Hold, Planned / Not Started) used to track topics within the Topic Index.&lt;SEP&gt;The Quick Status Legend provides symbols and descriptions for the status of discussion topics within the tracking system.&lt;SEP&gt;A key within the Topic Index used to categorize the status of discussion topics.</data>
