<node id="PPLUS Workspace">
  <data key="d0">PPLUS Workspace</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PPLUS Workspace is a specific and distinct environment, utilized for two primary functions.

Firstly, PPLUS Workspace is designated for the Mobile App Development Project. In this context, it serves for both the overall conduction of the project and specifically for its testing phases. It has been explicitly noted as an environment different from a previously used workspace.

Secondly, PPLUS Workspace is employed for project management testing. More specifically, it is used for PPlus Project Management Testing, including its second testing session, referred to as "Test Session 2." This workspace is also distinguished as being separate from an environment known as "My Workspace."&lt;SEP&gt;A specific workspace used for PPlus Project Management Testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific workspace used for PPlus Project Management Testing.</data>
