  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The VPIPE Database Query Guide is a comprehensive reference document that provides essential details and instructions for connecting to and querying the VPIPE Database. This guide specifically includes connection details, various commands, and a dedicated connection command to facilitate user interaction with the database.

It is physically located within Obsidian, and its specific file path is "Agents/Shared/VPIPE-Database-Guide.md". The VPIPE Database Query Guide was created on 2026-02-17.&lt;SEP&gt;The VPIPE Database Query Guide is a reference document providing instructions and connection details for the VPIPE Database, created on 2026-02-17.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference document providing instructions and details for querying the VPIPE database, found at `Agents/Shared/VPIPE-Database-Guide.md`.&lt;SEP&gt;A document providing guidance on querying the VPIPE database.</data>
