<node id="Knowledge Graph Tag">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Graph Tag</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Knowledge Graph Tag is a classification tag or keyword, primarily utilized to categorize content and entities as related to the concept of a knowledge graph. Its fundamental purpose is to establish an explicit association between various information components and the broader domain of knowledge graphs, thereby facilitating effective organization and retrieval of relevant data. This tag often appears as the specific string `knowledge-graph` and is frequently employed for classification within metadata.

The tag is applied across a diverse array of items and contexts. It is consistently used to categorize the "Knowledge Graph Index" document, indicating its content pertains to knowledge graphs and its subject matter. Specific instances also include its use on the "Decryption Key" entry and the "Demoted Theorems" entity, where it links them to knowledge graph concepts. Furthermore, the Knowledge Graph Tag is associated with the "README Rewrites" project, indicating its relevance. It is also consistently used to categorize action items and markdown files, signifying their direct relation to knowledge graphs, and is employed for categorization within the Obsidian Knowledge Graph.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6c0f12f725a7b639074653a878c82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbbf68c07d5785152cb568cb44c097d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e964fa90440f30528a4e3fa28953961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617117720e00673331b8823b4df194ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9fbd9d09e998a860e6092f95f3ca40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c563a98a2ca750fd7d1430a6e4c3655&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a20ed755fb3bc7c92c4bce8794b5381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba82b9a69370aab03745d339c225f5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9402536e9419b42ab050ff6b9aa8ad11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89d2648e975a4036194dd794a0bdc8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3ae3c1ef1d49f30b2e0d1d79ff7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b3068faf3337e750644c8d7643fc411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcb40ac7623a8d0795573d187ca42a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb061fa6be422bbf34b9117831dfcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7793c1816ef50dc976008de6c6e8601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c0edda5725534254122307b7c8815a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0393a6415c78258060096629d199fd2</data>
