<node id="Week 4 Handout DOCX">
  <data key="d0">Week 4 Handout DOCX</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Week 4 Handout DOCX is a course material provided in document format. This handout, delivered specifically for the fourth week of the DevOps VibeCoding Course, is presented in DOCX format. It was built and delivered to cover essential topics, primarily focusing on Docker and Containerization, as part of the course curriculum.&lt;SEP&gt;The Week 4 handout is a DOCX document for the DevOps VibeCoding Course, covering Docker and Containerization.&lt;SEP&gt;A document built and delivered for Week 4 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.&lt;SEP&gt;A handout document in DOCX format, built and delivered for Week 4 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.&lt;SEP&gt;Week 4 Handout DOCX is a document file that was built and delivered, covering Docker &amp; Containerization.&lt;SEP&gt;A course material artifact in DOCX format, built and delivered for Week 4 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d864945e20e92885dc29c45e69563ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f</data>
