<node id="Week 5 PPTX + Handout">
  <data key="d0">Week 5 PPTX + Handout</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Week 5 PPTX + Handout represents comprehensive course materials developed for the fifth week of the DevOps VibeCoding Course. These materials consist of a presentation, provided in PPTX format, and an accompanying handout.

The primary focus of this presentation and handout combination is Kubernetes. The presentation component specifically comprises 42 slides, detailing the week's subject matter. These resources were both built and delivered for the course, with distribution to students occurring via Drive and Telegram.&lt;SEP&gt;A presentation in PPTX format and accompanying handout, built for Week 5 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course, consisting of 42 slides.&lt;SEP&gt;Week 5 PPTX + Handout refers to presentation slides (42 slides) and accompanying handout materials for Week 5, built inline and delivered, covering Kubernetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Course material artifacts, including a presentation (PPTX) and a handout, built for Week 5 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d864945e20e92885dc29c45e69563ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f</data>
