<node id="Kubernetes">
  <data key="d0">Kubernetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Kubernetes is a technology concept primarily known as an open-source system for automating the deployment, scaling, and management of containerized applications. It functions as a robust solution for container orchestration, streamlining the operation of application containers across clusters of hosts.

Within the curriculum of the DevOps VibeCoding Course, Kubernetes is included as a significant technical and instructional topic related to containerization and container orchestration. It is specifically covered in Week 5 of the course, with detailed information presented in both the Week 5 PPTX (PowerPoint presentation) and the accompanying Week 5 Handout.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36c79333e70770b079d3c8c754308f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d864945e20e92885dc29c45e69563ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ced3e03077dc272a4034f7f14b2b7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b5576904ddba71ef0e4ad0f9e1b507</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
