<node id="Curbob">
  <data key="d0">Curbob</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Curbob is an entity prominently recognized as the creator, developer, and maintainer of the LobsterBoard software project. This entity is primarily associated with the LobsterBoard software repository hosted on GitHub. Curbob's involvement with the project is comprehensive, encompassing its initial creation, ongoing development, and continued maintenance.

The association with GitHub is specifically tied to the repository named `Curbob/LobsterBoard`. While descriptions refer to Curbob as either an "individual or entity," its core identity is consistently defined by its crucial role in the development and management of the LobsterBoard software within the GitHub platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4</data>
