<node id="Server">
  <data key="d0">Server</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A server, within the described context, refers to the computing machine, system, environment, hardware, or virtual machine where the LobsterBoard software, specifically the LobsterBoard Dashboard, was installed and configured. This entity serves as the host, providing the necessary computing hardware for the application. Its primary function is to make the LobsterBoard application readily accessible to users, often noting its accessibility via an IP address.

Crucially, this specific server environment is characterized by the current unavailability of PostgreSQL. While it functions as the dedicated system for LobsterBoard's installation and accessibility, it does not support PostgreSQL database functionalities within its current configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;The hardware where LobsterBoard was installed.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing machine where the new Obsidian vault was created.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing device on which the LobsterBoard dashboard software is installed.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing device on which the LobsterBoard dashboard software is installed.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing device on which the LobsterBoard dashboard software is installed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3798f4a234fcc46c4df14537567aed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db2cbf7fe0012c6db40e7c54c9c9cbca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2137ff35cca3b6a1f530734272b671a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4e01656ce29019cf97a36acd572183b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-885a7b5adc99161ceaae984f236f1fa8</data>
