  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The specific IP address and port through which the LobsterBoard dashboard is accessible.&lt;SEP&gt;This is the IP address and port where the LobsterBoard dashboard is accessible.&lt;SEP&gt;72.62.251.68:8080 is the specific IP address and port through which the LobsterBoard dashboard can be accessed on the network.&lt;SEP&gt;This is the IP address and port providing access to the LobsterBoard dashboard.&lt;SEP&gt;The IP address and port at which the LobsterBoard installation is accessible.</data>
