<node id="Atlanta">
  <data key="d0">Atlanta</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Atlanta is a city that served as the initial or original location setting for a weather widget. This configuration was specifically within the LobsterBoard, sometimes referred to as the LobsterBoard Dashboard. The city was initially designated for the weather widget's location before it was subsequently changed to a different location, with one description specifying the new setting as Bangkok. Atlanta was noted as the initial, and sometimes described as incorrect, location setting for this widget before its modification.&lt;SEP&gt;A city, initially designated for the weather widget's location in LobsterBoard.&lt;SEP&gt;A city, initially designated for the weather widget's location in LobsterBoard.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2137ff35cca3b6a1f530734272b671a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e8ba17b55951bc715f7656c42eea53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4</data>
