<node id="Bangkok">
  <data key="d0">Bangkok</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Bangkok is a significant city located in Thailand, identified by its airport code BKK, and serves as a precise temporal reference point at UTC+7. It is referenced across various technical, temporal, and literary contexts.

In technical and digital interfaces, Bangkok is crucial for various system configurations and scheduling. It functions as the designated, updated, corrected, and current location setting within the LobsterBoard weather widget and clock on the LobsterBoard Dashboard, having replaced Atlanta as the primary city displayed after a necessary fix. Furthermore, Bangkok specifies the timezone for the scheduled execution times of daily cron jobs, the weekly check, and the heartbeat check. The city is also a key marker for timestamps, such as the initial model update failure for `Anthropic/Claude-Opus-4-6`, which occurred around 05:52 Bangkok time, and the recording of a session snapshot at 09:31.

Beyond its technical applications, Bangkok holds importance as a cultural and literary setting. It is the city where the Thai Version Storyline is set and prominently features as the backdrop for the novel 'Three Old Men: The Last Conversation', with a specific tea house within the city providing a key setting for its narrative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd74135092e0a76db2ea1ed4d25f626&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee8abd51a4604f1cb2cd2d460b6adae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3bd213694bc9e9a86ea3a0c974c0d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b67e741d6b17ecc9e76597ce3ad0bc1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e907075cce78e0ea06d5e60daafa4c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cfc6c6d57918fbe9483abfa3d8a7110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b7dfdcc2716241ee671013bd06e74c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5313b97390b7bf1e98a9c795a7852d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1804eb6932c404a91cf48d839d40b2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7b71e9d299fac7d9999308dad4630e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef91a8cef67df17a12077efacfa69b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2137ff35cca3b6a1f530734272b671a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e8ba17b55951bc715f7656c42eea53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e967df27452deff8d725b325aa563ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b394110aeea60586b9d87bbb1349ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280669fa49c70eb7ad44fa8711ecb2d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a7df3853cff31dc6e6b38e8ad17a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19428f58c5416a435b7731bfeb99f8b6</data>
