<node id="2026-02-16">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-16</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The date 2026-02-16 is identified as a significant milestone within a knowledge management framework, characterized by extensive activities across project management, document maintenance, and decision-making. It holds particular recognition in connection with "Arthur's Daily Notes," detailing events such as LobsterBoard installation and configuration, the creation of the Anirach knowledge graph entry, and an update to the Daily Notes Index. This date was also referenced as "Memory" within pipeline update entries.

On 2026-02-16, numerous projects were either initiated or updated. Projects created on this date include the Mobile App Development Project, "Breyer Capital Healthcare Principles," "Personal Books Management System," "Obsidian Sync Setup," "Arthur Test Project," "Executive Strategic Development Class project," "Thai Translator Agent project," Vibe Coding project, "Course Preparation" project, "Healthcare AI" project, the AI Clinical Data Extraction project, the Helpdesk Project Analysis, the "AI News Briefing" project, the "Enhanced Agent Soul Format" project, the RAG Second Brain Paper project, the "Course Preparation Team," the KMUTNB Project, the Biomedical AI project, the Agent Teams Configuration project, and the "Chronology Analysis" project. Additionally, "Three Old Men: Nobel Edition" was both created and updated, while the AI Clinical Data Extraction project, the VPIPE Database project, the KMUTNB Project, and the Agent Teams Configuration project also received updates.

Beyond project work, 2026-02-16 saw substantial updates and creations across various documents and topics. Key creations included "RAG Second Brain Paper V15" and the content "ชายชราสามคน: บทสนทนาครั้งสุดท้าย." Significant updates were applied to the broader "RAG Second Brain Paper" topic, the GPT topic, the Documents Index file, the MOC-Teaching document, the "KnowledgeGraph/Topics/Docker.md" document, "Home.md," the Translation topic, the ChartSense AI MVP Document, and the "Three Old Men Translation Decision."

Crucially, 2026-02-16 was a pivotal date for the making and documentation of several important decisions. These included the determination to fix TypeScript errors, the decision regarding SQLite for local development, the "Decision: Demo User Bypass," the decision concerning fixed weather widget settings, the "Decision: Connected to VPIPE CRM Database," and the specific decision regarding Prisma 5 and Prisma 7. Furthermore, this date is consistently associated with the creation, recording, or identification of various action items, including "Design System Architecture," "Improve GitHub Repo Alongside Paper Iterations," "Create UI Wireframes," and "Translate Other Works," serving as a record of critical operational actions and a timestamp for document updates.&lt;SEP&gt;2026-02-16 is the date associated with the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific date associated with the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;A date associated with Arthur's Daily Notes, Anirach's creation, and the update of the Daily Notes Index.&lt;SEP&gt;A date associated with Arthur's Daily Notes, Anirach's creation, and the update of the Daily Notes Index.&lt;SEP&gt;A date associated with Arthur's Daily Notes, Anirach's creation, and the update of the Daily Notes Index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dfb21adb069bd3559c2ef99603a326a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3b2f4e021038bacf3a3889b14e3971&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b30d980c7b6b9067948c92840d8d7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1741ecd860eca78e1c4e201ce55a458f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237500f812903b7307cdca224b791a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d310a4043708aa267f31226740ed083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f719cbd2b4a06b6e395856df09e63b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b0e643ebc37d6e483ed820982ca193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36fcfa3f0abcaf5629e5ecad38f0cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c371260389e0782fbfb49af2d151de86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7140b8f3f101761721f48a25fbbb7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-724cda2fbcd761a77f25ca1db8e8f1b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09f974a7e07b869b8c3e753624d8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f070dc633489f685a59e40392fc9154a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38e9b054f469e1e12699cc361780a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f32a78c6c67519031ad6fce621286984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-129a0b3907ad214eec67638fd6da975d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19dd0bede6e30ba44b3f5793a1e6a99e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ba71d5d5bc8db56c16d1e6b194a9f03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24071aee2bddaf2afa5c424befbddc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd694b68ea3a4ab2d245b9c6f6051a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8810b0cc19fdc55c82c76db548698a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d9ccc86e1d1bcb6c363824ca5a9e09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629b9fa27105df26f3b80c9433fa8e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b349303f05cdb1ee379fe54f8df72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c58b42bcfbdc99ab572d190b27de5882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82737226bf4c5bc8eb7724d162c70efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6350d26186fa2215e4c64148f011ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b50b5967db824f18c025ce5c6296b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c76d26675f6169a1424697817b540a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f9e405f1bc12388544826efbc16a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad8f051101e5ae26929a5b8420de3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b72c9581d600c3f20a8bdb9ee8741deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fd2456967f2bbfb00530eb37e41d972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93ccfd025e00f44d