<node id="Weather Widget">
  <data key="d0">Weather Widget</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Weather Widget is a configurable component of the LobsterBoard dashboard, primarily responsible for displaying weather information.

The Weather Widget recently underwent a fix that necessitated configuration adjustments to its settings. These adjustments included changing its location setting from Atlanta to Bangkok and updating the temperature units from Fahrenheit to Celsius. These re-configurations were carried out by Arthur and Anirach, enabling the widget to display weather information based on the newly specified location and unit preferences within the LobsterBoard environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Weather Widget is a component of the LobsterBoard Dashboard that displays weather information.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the LobsterBoard Dashboard responsible for displaying weather information.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the LobsterBoard Dashboard responsible for displaying weather information.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the LobsterBoard Dashboard responsible for displaying weather information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898034ffdfa1b10060569a60c6e94edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2137ff35cca3b6a1f530734272b671a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e8ba17b55951bc715f7656c42eea53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2434edb652ea448af12b65c60768a71b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffed2e0d5a98ce8d9cb5106e19cdcce4</data>
