<node id="Arthur's Daily Notes">
  <data key="d0">Arthur's Daily Notes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Arthur's Daily Notes is identified as a specific document or a collection of daily notes attributed to Arthur. These notes were created and recorded on February 16, 2026, detailing Arthur's activities for that particular day.

The content of Arthur's Daily Notes primarily comprises records of Arthur's activities, including specific details regarding software installations and configurations, such as the setup and configuration of LobsterBoard. The documentation of these notes is noted to have been done within Obsidian.

Furthermore, Arthur's Daily Notes holds significance as a source of interaction for Anirach. On the same date, February 16, 2026, these notes were referenced and associated with Anirach's interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily notes for February 16, 2026, detailing the installation of LobsterBoard Dashboard and fixes to a weather widget.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur's Daily Notes are records created by Arthur, documenting various activities and observations for specific dates.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific log entry or document title for a given day (e.g., 2026-02-16) detailing Arthur's activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific log entry or document title for a given day (e.g., 2026-02-16) detailing Arthur's activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific log entry or document title for a given day (e.g., 2026-02-16) detailing Arthur's activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific log entry or document title for a given day (e.g., 2026-02-16) detailing Arthur's activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0565d753af602f369378d3c50ea774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84cf29bb492f5df9040017ff94a75e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c004d91e1ff0b7ce769b552a3c56304&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77fb2e17e5b4e8bf73efceb26909e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-558b6d2c1acd0ead39cb816a545fc170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ed29f1c61ff580597801b78ee3bb1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897</data>
