<node id="RAG Second Brain">
  <data key="d0">RAG Second Brain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RAG Second Brain is an active project, system, and concept focused on building a "second brain" system, with a primary objective of Information Fusion. It leverages the principles of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and is closely associated with Knowledge Graphs, ontologies, and Large Language Models (LLMs). The project also explores the Multi-Agent topic.

Implemented through its Python code, RAG Second Brain is hosted on a dedicated GitHub repository accessible at `https://github.com/Anirach/rag-second-brain`, and is identified by the specific project identifier "project:rag-second-brain." The project was created on 2026-02-15, with Arthur and Anirach Mingkhwan actively involved in its development. It is linked to the RAG Second Brain Paper and is often categorized as a piece of content or project file within "Projects," specifically listed within a Knowledge Graph's project index.&lt;SEP&gt;A project focused on information Fusion, integrating concepts such as RAG, knowledge graphs, ontologies, LLMs, second brain methodologies, and multi-agent systems. It is an active project with a GitHub repository available.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept for a second brain that is being implemented as a Python project on GitHub.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG Second Brain is a project developed at King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok.&lt;SEP&gt;A project mentioned in the context of an action item.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9379406cb3b5e65bc032ad0990719d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2abe1f2f6521ebc01ceb8cb4f288930f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9251a5e06851a7123de946ab9c6915a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da16976f6a8b1abecf041605a040a8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9e55d51e430c7a0c6728634dc5eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7446746d38f3bb6968c662eaba2cccf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cc482deceac887b8b2d04ac91ecfc79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afedad46832871dfd419946350d41dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f679fb9f71f29d43c105efd0b6b3ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831c8172db7eb5f9fecab8edd8d05e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68e32a47072bdd6cb72369715da94a2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7271b4cc7ad0485cf04ec5356b60b787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e345acbc1d8bee72b09c294d06f77b5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97302f6791a6d0506598c8441994ff20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb398dea78019ec3ace40e37db2d7103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e426aeb3f853f4e4a70717b09a111a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28873878f8dcbd5abb8ed630f432e8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba754fb7a934f88d986d68a77c5aedf4</data>
