<node id="Three Old Men">
  <data key="d0">Three Old Men</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Three Old Men is a completed literary fiction project, developed with contributions from Anirach Mingkhwan and Arthur. This literary work was created on February 15, 2026, and originated from King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. It is associated with the Writing Team and has been integrated into Obsidian.

The project is linked to a unique identifier (ID) and a dedicated GitHub repository. Within the knowledge graph, Three Old Men is identified as a content piece tagged as a knowledge-graph project and is listed within the Knowledge Graph's project index. It is also currently the subject of an action item.

A significant aspect of Three Old Men involves its ongoing translation efforts. The project is actively undergoing translation as part of a distinct initiative known as the "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" project. A specific translation decision entry pertaining to this work was recorded on February 5, 2026, and its status has since been updated in relation to its Thai translation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6201337fe894c42a726729fd7b3d568a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d310a4043708aa267f31226740ed083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a75b2ce01f9e8a4a2e070eacf7cb181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b63ef11108bfd7b93e73218ffdf3065&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cae40cb3e01f7f44617fe6efce540e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5511d906f079895d9f4230f3c92969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a65285fdf36b982f20efb250e9ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a32f91839d8208337ff585ca49f4f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28873878f8dcbd5abb8ed630f432e8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e27a41e07f2a1a24017c7da0aad718b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d</data>
