  <data key="d2">Bootstrap is a statistical method used to determine statistical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Bootstrap is a statistical method used to determine the statistical significance of the research results.&lt;SEP&gt;Bootstrap is a statistical method used to determine statistical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;A statistical method used for calculating the statistical significance of results, as applied to the RAG Second Brain Paper v15.&lt;SEP&gt;Bootstrap is a statistical method used to determine the statistical significance of results in the RAG Second Brain Paper v15.&lt;SEP&gt;A statistical resampling method employed to establish "Statistical Significance".&lt;SEP&gt;Bootstrap is a statistical method used to determine the statistical significance of the results.</data>
