<node id="King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok">
  <data key="d0">King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok, also known by its abbreviation KMUTNB, is an academic institution situated in Thailand. This organization serves as a center for various activities, notably those related to education technology. Anirach Mingkhwan is affiliated with KMUTNB, where they hold a position as a lecturer.

The university has been a focal point for the development of several distinct projects. These initiatives include the Bookshelf project, the Claude-Skills project, and the Bookshelf App project. Furthermore, King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok is recognized as the organization where the ChartSense AI project, the LobsterBoard project, the NCD-CIE project, the "Three Old Men" project, and the Helpdesk Booking project were developed.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization where the RAG Second Brain project is developed.&lt;SEP&gt;King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok is the organization where the Obsidian Vault project was developed.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization listed in the Organizations index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e3f7a26a4c8d639a7927de46537f385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-000f6eab7dd163e0d37ed085d1b46d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80158534569e9914c5429dc29da51f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71c418372142e16d1946cb65109ced22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4d74588847aeaab263c27d6a5d7245f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbc27820764894775d4457c170c4c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db30366d6e531336292702250ac47e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3791cd53d775e2d05817486d53cad15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a32f91839d8208337ff585ca49f4f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe5b88dbaa3c65be9680127260514b5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb398dea78019ec3ace40e37db2d7103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90bdd16f25c3e0e209e779bed9fc615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c599f91be9d0271b2f173bcfb4111a87</data>
