<node id="NCD-CIE">
  <data key="d0">NCD-CIE</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NCD-CIE, an acronym for NCD Causal Insight Engine, is an active project operating within the domain of Non-communicable Diseases (NCD) and healthcare. It primarily functions as a causal knowledge graph platform, specifically designed for NCD risk assessment and intervention planning.

The project is intrinsically linked to the broader topics of Causal Inference and Knowledge Graphs, and its scope also extends to concepts related to ICD-10. A key output of NCD-CIE is a proposed causal knowledge graph platform, which is detailed in an associated paper.

Anirach Mingkhwan is actively involved in this project, which has a target milestone set for AIiH 2026. NCD-CIE maintains an associated GitHub repository and is identified by the internal ID "project:ncd-cie", often located under the directory `Projects/NCD-CIE`.&lt;SEP&gt;NCD-CIE is a project developed at King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization or entity for which a curated list of open datasets is being prepared.&lt;SEP&gt;NCD-CIE is a project to which the AIiH 2026 conference was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;A system described as a Causal Knowledge Graph Platform for NCD Risk Assessment and Intervention Planning, whose GitHub repository is associated with Anirach.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-838a7372037dd9d7583be5b6dfb14047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17156a5b505902e14a9d022cbd0a55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5e2bec605977d0f2561acafe070fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d7f7fc55efb03b701051a7d5d3d091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e38114474628b06365321589495c1c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4de2b52f89007f66ee562bf3b97c331a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6098a34f35ce55a2d1898f3895c0373f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831c8172db7eb5f9fecab8edd8d05e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c3ff39a4343014a1e3432784260076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a88ad3f110d0bfd0650cd825ab1436f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32855dc2dff1a004e9b91107378406a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6716ce6b3848cb2033e87e55c6f4c37a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-186fc3dc78629c4e754c44f180def340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3791cd53d775e2d05817486d53cad15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28873878f8dcbd5abb8ed630f432e8af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8980911843c949e318dafd147dd349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6476f93afca3bf94d0f25d8156e76b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3</data>
