<node id="Skills">
  <data key="d0">Skills</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skills are defined as a comprehensive set of capabilities, functionalities, abilities, competencies, or features. These entities represent general or functional capabilities that are designed to be added or installed within a system.

The primary method for acquiring and integrating these skills is through ClawHub, with several descriptions specifically indicating their installation via the ClawHub CLI. Examples of such functional capabilities explicitly mentioned include "Frontend Design" and "ui-ux-p."&lt;SEP&gt;Functional capabilities, such as "Frontend Design" and "ui-ux-p", that can be added via ClawHub CLI.</data>
