  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Interaction 2026-02-17 04:03 represents a timestamped and documented interaction event that occurred on February 17, 2026, at 04:03 AM. This specific interaction was recorded within Obsidian.

The event encompassed a variety of activities and subjects. It is described as an interaction by Workflow Automation concerning Daily Mem's daily note. Furthermore, it involved both the Research Dashboard and the AI Research Dashboard, specifically referencing an AI Research Dashboard project document. The interaction also related to the file "Daily/2026-02-10.md" and generally involved daily notes and the subject of Team Guides. Additionally, it specifically referenced อนิราช มิ่งขวัญ's file. The event also linked the Helpdesk Project and the Helpdesk Project Analysis, and detailed a pre-compaction summary for Session Notes.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific timestamp marking an interaction recorded in the "Progress Timeline," which references the "RAG Second Brain Paper" in "Obsidian."</data>
