<node id="RAG Second Brain Paper v15">
  <data key="d0">RAG Second Brain Paper v15</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">RAG Second Brain Paper v15 is a specific version of a research paper titled "RAG Second Brain Paper." This document details various research findings and presents its final results, with a particular focus on "Learned Gating."

The paper includes a comprehensive set of performance metrics to support its conclusions, such as Sigmoid R@10, Softmax R@10, and the RRF Baseline. The research findings and final results presented in RAG Second Brain Paper v15 were also discussed in Arthur's Daily Log.&lt;SEP&gt;A paper documenting a project, characterized by its final results and page reduction details.&lt;SEP&gt;Version 15 of the RAG Second Brain Paper, which includes final results for learned gating, such as Sigmoid R@10, Softmax R@10, and RRF Baseline, demonstrating statistical significance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a4b9540765c9116547992f4b4a476e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d113e8b1edad4ebb129a2a094a883e18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31d3997afc563a8575185bcc2410347a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5a2a5ee9379f99260bf82e77d61e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02fed1956b021d157c9aefe4e22c23a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ea6d7871cd452fe1d5c6536cbd0937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dd1bf46bef690dc3e5e67e19c9b119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b72c9581d600c3f20a8bdb9ee8741deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff7e5c1e27b82737e07d089640954be</data>
