  <data key="d2">The entity 2026-03-02 represents the specific date of March 2, 2026. This date is significantly associated with multiple distinct operational events and data points within a defined system context.

Primarily, 2026-03-02 is linked to various action items. It serves as the general date of association for action items, and more specifically, it marks the creation or identification of Action-Item 150. Additionally, this date is associated with Action Item 148.

