  <data key="d2">Telegram User ID 7579913696 is a unique, numeric identifier assigned to a user or chat on Telegram. This identifier specifically indicates the source of the last message received within a session.

It is particularly noted for identifying the Telegram user who sent the last message in various contexts, including general sessions, documented sessions, and specifically agent sessions. For instance, Telegram User ID 7579913696 is the identifier for the sender of the last message directed to the "Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main" session. Furthermore, in one specific instance, this user ID was the source from which the last message received was the command "/restart".&lt;SEP&gt;A Telegram user identifier from which the last message "/restart" was received.&lt;SEP&gt;A unique identifier for a user or chat on Telegram.</data>
