<node id="Academic Team">
  <data key="d0">Academic Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Academic Team is a designated group specializing in a range of academic work and tasks. It is responsible for memory maintenance, the creation of academic papers, and is specifically credited with the creation and development of the "RAG Second Brain Paper." Their core activities also involve following convention for handling paper folders, paper PDFs, paper TeX files, and conducting literature reviews, reflecting a broad focus on academic content, materials, research, and paper implementation. This team functions as a key group defined by and utilizing specific academic skills.

Operating within a broader project framework, the Academic Team is identified as one of five specific teams of agents. Structurally, it is composed of 8 agents and is supported by a dedicated professional guide.

All of the Academic Team's endeavors and progress are systematically documented in a work log, for which they maintain responsibility. This includes a specific work log entry created on 2026-02-16. The work log also notes that the team reported no active sessions on February 21st, 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;A team with 6 agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Team is one of the five agent teams, consisting of 6 agents for academic-related tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the agent teams that received new agents (`Data-Analyst Agent`, `Ethics-Reviewer Agent`) during the Major Agent Team Upgrade.&lt;SEP&gt;The Academic Team is an agent team consisting of 6 agents: paper-architect, literature-lead, methodology-expert, technical-writer, peer-reviewer, and format-editor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e570c762971c4d1a558761ca3b304a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1263f6dcbc96b0cd91f9ce4b885f6881&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68dcdd91e7e172558c552fe66f01dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a82915c47a962ddfab0be73260997c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22dff12fa45dfc4789663451e530bd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea490a0648c8c782e0d8e397d64cfa9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e50f018ab794854428e9bfc66b36eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6779ed9a888f3660270bba997f58bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2753f45f158b0a6204d83e9fa7880a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e446842d3412fd960e83e17b830cf824&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30fb95316699e7d9d094af00be9a7c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-570c1687de41e99a692ad24992a2accd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b7611801b56d161d9e4809cd690f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f18c72310dfe68bd9a70bc2f54ec35b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b394110aeea60586b9d87bbb1349ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572bc319ace0969403b23edbb05f1603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a2f4932683deada51cf0bb651a5811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
