<node id="Paper Architect">
  <data key="d0">Paper Architect</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual responsible for creating revisions of academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual or role within the Academic Team responsible for creating revisions of papers.&lt;SEP&gt;A role or individual tasked with creating revisions of academic papers within the Academic Team's context.&lt;SEP&gt;A person identified as "Paper Architect" who created a v23 revision of the RAG Second Brain paper, addressing reviewer concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;The Paper Architect is a role or agent within the Academic Team responsible for creating and revising academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;A person responsible for creating revisions of a paper.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual responsible for creating and revising the RAG Second Brain paper, applying reviewer fixes, and trimming content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e570c762971c4d1a558761ca3b304a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1263f6dcbc96b0cd91f9ce4b885f6881&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68dcdd91e7e172558c552fe66f01dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a82915c47a962ddfab0be73260997c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22dff12fa45dfc4789663451e530bd72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea490a0648c8c782e0d8e397d64cfa9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e446842d3412fd960e83e17b830cf824</data>
