<node id="Dense Vector Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Dense Vector Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dense Vector Retrieval is a specific method of information retrieval that serves as a key component or technique. It is consistently described as being integrated into the Multi-Source RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) framework.

This Multi-Source RAG framework, which incorporates Dense Vector Retrieval, was proposed in the "RAG Second Brain Paper." The method's integration is fundamental to the framework's operation, facilitating the retrieval of information through dense vector representations.&lt;SEP&gt;A method integrated into the Multi-Source RAG Framework for information retrieval, also referred to as "Dense" in the paper's results.&lt;SEP&gt;Dense Vector Retrieval is a method of information retrieval integrated into the multi-source RAG framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A retrieval technique integrated into the Multi-Source RAG Framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Dense Vector Retrieval is an algorithm for retrieving information using vector embeddings, including details on the embedding model and similarity metric.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-505a6de49a4e71323e53e984bc770e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbbf68c07d5785152cb568cb44c097d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7500ba1991c8bf7c275040fb5d136c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6e31e647978359fa53f0dd27331186&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-319918c1dd29c15f300842daf00bc7e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d8f0cc2dda28211617dff6e3558df7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8cf8fc2d96758ea18301e0ea37632a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041d128ced8892285239ffadbdd877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8268912354c6ad40989f1deca0c0990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565cbd3991fde971e7c72b941083b823&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd423fd12ecb6cccdd6c05c4eee67a81</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772607911</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
