<node id="PPMI">
  <data key="d0">PPMI</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PPMI (Positive Pointwise Mutual Information) is a concept associated with co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;PPMI is a specific technique or concept mentioned as part of co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;An acronym for a co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval method.&lt;SEP&gt;Pointwise Mutual Information, a specific metric used in co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;PPMI stands for Pointwise Mutual Information, a specific co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval method.&lt;SEP&gt;PPMI (Positive Pointwise Mutual Information) is a technique used, often combined with BM25.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-505a6de49a4e71323e53e984bc770e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7500ba1991c8bf7c275040fb5d136c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8cf8fc2d96758ea18301e0ea37632a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041d128ced8892285239ffadbdd877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565cbd3991fde971e7c72b941083b823&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd423fd12ecb6cccdd6c05c4eee67a81</data>
