<node id="RAG Framework">
  <data key="d0">RAG Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The RAG framework is a multi-source retrieval augmented generation system proposed by the RAG Second Brain Paper.&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-source framework proposed in the 'RAG Second Brain Paper' that integrates dense vector retrieval and co-occurrence-based statistical retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;An external knowledge store used within Clinical Decision Support systems, combining textbook knowledge and clinical knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;An external knowledge store that combines ontological (textbook) and clinical knowledge.</data>
