  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Research Dashboard is a project built and deployed using Next.js 14, TypeScript, Prisma, and SQLite, and its status is "Deployed &amp; Live".&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Research Dashboard is a project that is deployed and live, built using Next.js 14, TypeScript, Prisma, and SQLite.&lt;SEP&gt;A project that is deployed and live, created on 2026-02-16, and tagged as a project and knowledge graph.&lt;SEP&gt;A related web application for tracking AI research.&lt;SEP&gt;A web application designed for tracking AI research papers, managing reading lists, and organizing research notes.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Research Dashboard is an application that was built and deployed, using various modern web technologies.</data>
