  <data key="d2">TypeScript is a programming language that serves a crucial role across several project components. It is extensively utilized in the development, building, and overall tech stack for the AI Research Dashboard.

Beyond its application in the AI Research Dashboard, TypeScript is also identified as a key technology included in the deliverables for Build Mode. Additionally, it is referenced as a technology relevant for badges within the project. These collective uses highlight TypeScript's importance as a core programming language across various facets of the endeavor.</data>
