<node id="IEEE">
  <data key="d0">IEEE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">IEEE is an organization that is consistently listed within various indexing structures of a knowledge graph. Specifically, it appears as an entry in the "Organizations Index," which is also referred to as the "Organizations index," the "Organizations' index," and the "knowledge graph's organizations index." In some contexts, it is noted as being part of the Obsidian knowledge graph's "Organizations" index. This indicates its established presence and categorization as an organization within these data management systems.&lt;SEP&gt;IEEE is an organization and publisher of technical literature, serving as a target journal for academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;A resource or database used by the Literature-Search skill.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific top-tier journal or publisher that sets publication standards.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization and a source for academic search.</data>
