<node id="Daily Memory - January 28, 2026">
  <data key="d0">Daily Memory - January 28, 2026</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily Memory - January 28, 2026 refers to a specific record entry, note, or daily log created on January 28, 2026. This entry primarily documents the successful completion and setup of the Google Calendar integration.

Documented within Obsidian, this daily memory serves as a structured note detailing the successful Google Calendar integration. It also functions more broadly as a daily log, outlining completed tasks and key achievements for that specific date. One instance specifies this successful integration was for Anirach.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-113056c9501e9b2d79be577e20d93410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aac26b6f017550e6b8be634bc44e292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e7e57ff161e4beebd9512df721459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625b5a08676aa70ebee9d5d5c5803fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b09e05a7e31f0c9576ad10f1a2885e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e55ed8097afa7059c8bb422a3149921a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d526320401eafeca2cd894cd415353dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bdd05384cd19411b8d7358f5ff4a53e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772610139</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Google Calendar">
  <data key="d0">Google Calendar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Calendar is a comprehensive digital calendaring service and a software application primarily designed for scheduling and event management. This service has been successfully integrated as part of a setup process, specifically for Anirach, making it the subject of an integration project. The integration was facilitated through the Google Calendar Integration system. It is consistently described as a service and a software application offering scheduling and event management capabilities.

Within the context of the knowledge graph from which these descriptions originate, Google Calendar was additionally identified as an entity classified as a person, despite its primary functional role as a service and application. Its successful setup for Anirach encompassed this integration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-113056c9501e9b2d79be577e20d93410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aac26b6f017550e6b8be634bc44e292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e7e57ff161e4beebd9512df721459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0bb009da2afea369e4c821ce1e24395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625b5a08676aa70ebee9d5d5c5803fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d526320401eafeca2cd894cd415353dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81dc2baf0c4cbe3330034151f181683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bdd05384cd19411b8d7358f5ff4a53e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
