<node id="GitHub Repo">
  <data key="d0">GitHub Repo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity known as GitHub Repo refers to a specific digital software repository hosted on GitHub that serves multiple functions and is the subject of several active initiatives.

This repository is primarily described as a Python implementation of a RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) second brain project. It was created on 2026-02-16 and subsequently completed on 2026-02-17. Additionally, this repository was established as part of a broader OpenSource Preparation effort.

Currently, the GitHub Repo is slated for improvement, being the subject of an explicit improvement action item. It has also been designated as the destination repository for the addition of a Thai version, fulfilling a specific action item. Beyond these development goals, it is also utilized for syncing an Obsidian Vault.&lt;SEP&gt;A repository created on GitHub.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f35a0c6a0244897333e1e1091f4a3eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114148647602381f69f112362757b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da16976f6a8b1abecf041605a040a8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c630bb67beebd417245a9d2e9e12de8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e426aeb3f853f4e4a70717b09a111a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86bece34723c92d0ad633d3747bd740&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01337653955a29c2966c83b253b6124&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bcb3228932af853f6622d813c13636d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572bc319ace0969403b23edbb05f1603</data>
