</node>
<node id="Anti-AI-Slop Design Principles">
  <data key="d0">Anti-AI-Slop Design Principles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-AI-Slop Design Principles represent a core set of specific guiding principles that the UX/UI Designer Agent consistently adheres to and follows. These principles embody the fundamental design philosophy employed by the agent, serving to guide its overall design approach and ensuring the quality of its creative output. They function as the essential rules and guidelines for the UX/UI Designer Agent's design methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of design principles followed by the UX/UI Designer Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Principles that guide the UX/UI Designer Agent's design approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Principles that guide the UX/UI Designer Agent's design approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Principles that guide the UX/UI Designer Agent's design approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Principles that guide the UX/UI Designer Agent's design approach.</data>
