<node id="Design Systems">
  <data key="d0">Design Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Design Systems are a fundamental concept and a comprehensive framework that encapsulates a set of guidelines, reusable components, and various tools. They define an essential activity, area of work, or task for which the UX/UI Designer Agent is typically spawned, created, or configured to contribute.

The primary purpose of Design Systems is to establish and maintain consistent design standards across products and platforms. They empower the UX/UI Designer Agent to create cohesive user experiences and interfaces by providing the necessary structure and resources for uniform design implementation.</data>
