  <data key="d2">Daily/2026-02-12.md is a specific daily note document or file within the Obsidian system, dated February 12, 2026. This file serves as a comprehensive record and source for various daily activities, including recorded interactions, accomplishments, and project updates.

Within Daily/2026-02-12.md, major documentation day activities and key accomplishments are specifically documented. It further records interactions pertinent to 'Team Guides' and an individual named อนิราช มิ่งขวัญ. Updates related to projects such as 'Book Cover Designs' and the "Chronology Analysis (Project)" were logged within and referenced from this daily note file. The document is consistently referenced in interactions and is recognized as a component within a broader KnowledgeGraph system.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific markdown document within Obsidian, containing daily notes and updates related to the project.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific daily note file within the Obsidian system where project updates are documented.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific daily note file within Obsidian that references updates for the Coding Manual V3.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific daily note markdown file, likely managed within Obsidian, referenced in updates for the "Chronology Analysis" project.&lt;SEP&gt;The source file for the daily report.</data>
