<node id="Executive Strategic Development Class">
  <data key="d0">Executive Strategic Development Class</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Executive Strategic Development Class is a class, program, or project primarily focused on the strategic development of executives. It aims to educate executives on various key themes pertinent to their roles and growth.

A specific white paper is being developed, prepared, or was requested in association with this class. This white paper is centered on executive literature reading, specifically exploring the reasons why executives should engage with literature. The initiative associated with the Executive Strategic Development Class is also tagged as a knowledge graph project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Executive Strategic Development Class is the context for which a white paper on the benefits of reading literature was created.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a738f505c3e1573b43b49a1c3bf45d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f4a294ac24bcb979aea9c7e4c009069&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e7376b179bb3cf32f99af5e5d3df02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ed18955a872afc13c0739e6ec6ac846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71ec31fbd99db8806c63089df83e650e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e309a0c53373d6abff7e232db41ed2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b13a6c3c792e198ba068b2ce861bdb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c76d26675f6169a1424697817b540a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b833576f6ded00efd508619d87e78d6</data>
