<node id="Vibe Coding With Antigravity">
  <data key="d0">Vibe Coding With Antigravity</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Vibe Coding With Antigravity is a course categorized under "Courses &amp; Education," designed to teach an AI-assisted software development workflow. Its curriculum specifically includes key components such as PRD generation and frontend development.

While initially described as a planned course project and, at one point, as being under development, Vibe Coding With Antigravity is currently an active course. It officially started on 2026-02-09 and was last updated on 2026-02-10. The course materials are complete, though OpenSource preparation is noted as pending. The course is also tagged with "knowledge-graph."</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2189670463c8a51757c474d3cfabb455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9c462842e032fe02bd3a26f0182a79d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1741ecd860eca78e1c4e201ce55a458f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d52207fa065044e301f9e39da68c057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf6ed82ad1c79555c641c9a0bfb228f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d63e037554049f0f653ae6fd00b41f8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204b0227c0c120113918139adb369e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c48e9d5ad18db20533f0ce8ce25701b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7606b85915bb233dbea5e7f567432c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13370da4542e0ab270fbb1a19946441a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c630bb67beebd417245a9d2e9e12de8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baaf507a401ba4db4b25918ac4bcf203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1df2657476da13603cf7d7f35ed503e1</data>
