</node>
<node id="PRD Generation">
  <data key="d0">PRD Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PRD Generation is a process and specific method integral to the AI-assisted software development workflow. This approach primarily involves leveraging artificial intelligence (AI) to write and generate requirements for software projects. It is frequently identified as a distinct step within this modern development paradigm. Furthermore, PRD Generation is specifically taught as a method within the 'Vibe Coding with Antigravity' course.&lt;SEP&gt;A method within the AI-assisted software development workflow focused on writing requirements with AI.&lt;SEP&gt;PRD Generation is the first step in the AI-assisted software development workflow, involving writing requirements with AI.&lt;SEP&gt;PRD Generation is a phase in the AI-assisted software development workflow that involves writing requirements with AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2189670463c8a51757c474d3cfabb455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c63f25617c9296922c676c76aabc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d52207fa065044e301f9e39da68c057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d63e037554049f0f653ae6fd00b41f8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204b0227c0c120113918139adb369e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c48e9d5ad18db20533f0ce8ce25701b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7606b85915bb233dbea5e7f567432c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc5e85ef9c048380daae758b9313250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13370da4542e0ab270fbb1a19946441a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c630bb67beebd417245a9d2e9e12de8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772597634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI-Assisted Software Development Workflow">
  <data key="d0">AI-Assisted Software Development Workflow</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI-Assisted Software Development Workflow is a comprehensive method and process designed for software development that significantly leverages artificial intelligence. This workflow is specifically taught as part of the "Vibe Coding with Antigravity" course.

The workflow integrates AI assistance into various stages of software development. Key steps and tasks within this AI-assisted process include requirements writing, the generation of Product Requirements Documents (PRDs), and frontend development, all utilizing artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;AI-Assisted Software Development Workflow is a complete process taught in a course, encompassing steps like PRD generation and frontend development.&lt;SEP&gt;AI-Assisted Software Development Workflow is a complete workflow taught in the Vibe Coding With Antigravity course, encompassing requirements generation, frontend mockup, version control, IDE setup, backend coding, integration, and deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2189670463c8a51757c474d3cfabb455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50c63f25617c9296922c676c76aabc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d52207fa065044e301f9e39da68c057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d63e037554049f0f653ae6fd00b41f8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c48e9d5ad18db20533f0ce8ce25701b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7606b85915bb233dbea5e7f567432c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc5e85ef9c048380daae758b9313250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13370da4542e0ab270fbb1a19946441a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c630bb67beebd417245a9d2e9e12de8</data>
