  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Professional Writing Team is a 6-agent team created as a major accomplishment, consisting of various specialized roles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Professional Writing Team is comprised of 6 agent roles: book-architect, research-lead, chapter-writer, dev-editor, copy-editor, and publisher.&lt;SEP&gt;A 6-agent professional writing team was created as part of the writing team setup.&lt;SEP&gt;A 6-agent team created for professional writing tasks.</data>
