<node id="Opus Sub-Agents">
  <data key="d0">Opus Sub-Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Opus Sub-Agents are 28 components of the Claude Opus system that were updated from opus-4-5 to opus-4-6.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of 28 software agents that were updated from opus-4-5 to opus-4-6.&lt;SEP&gt;28 software agents that were updated from Opus-4-5 to Claude Opus 4-6.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus Sub-Agents are 28 agents that were updated from Opus 4-5 to Claude Opus 4-6.&lt;SEP&gt;Twenty-eight sub-agents that were updated from `opus-4-5` to `Anthropic/Claude-Opus-4-6`.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus Sub-Agents are 28 software agents that were updated by Anirach from Opus-4-5 to Anthropic/Claude-Opus-4-6.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of 28 sub-agents that were updated from opus-4-5 to opus-4-6.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bfd74135092e0a76db2ea1ed4d25f626&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee8abd51a4604f1cb2cd2d460b6adae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cfc6c6d57918fbe9483abfa3d8a7110&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5313b97390b7bf1e98a9c795a7852d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5a092f15c5c85000d18f0e0d6fd80a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3</data>
