<node id="Three Old Men - Thai Translation">
  <data key="d0">Three Old Men - Thai Translation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Three Old Men - Thai Translation is a literary translation project dedicated to rendering the novel "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation" from English into Thai. This project is currently in a paused status and is categorized under "Research &amp; Papers."

The source novel, "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation," is notably recognized as the first novel to have been written with the assistance of artificial intelligence. Although the translation project is paused, both the English and Thai content for the work are complete, with finalization pending. The last recorded update for this project was on 2026-02-05.&lt;SEP&gt;Three Old Men - Thai Translation is a related project providing the Thai version of the novel.&lt;SEP&gt;A project documentation detailing the Thai translation of the literary work "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation", including its status, team, approach, and related files.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e2a5f7ec66752e21d47da4c856ee6a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b61ade4889db4f6a01bf96731f64a7c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047f208e1d05e729c9f051bb57826ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416882a69b295573c1f83bc323abb20e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ac42e4b444b2aa35a9817c58b1eaadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baaf507a401ba4db4b25918ac4bcf203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7e10d09f982e9b7d5bb3d226d90b24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba508f45949882ad8abe499c098ae8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772607636</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Literary Translation Project">
  <data key="d0">Literary Translation Project</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Literary Translation Project is a general type of endeavor involving the translation of literary works.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of project focused on translating literary works, exemplified by the "Three Old Men - Thai Translation".&lt;SEP&gt;A Literary Translation Project is a type of project focused on translating literary works.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of project focused on translating literary works.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e2a5f7ec66752e21d47da4c856ee6a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97f8be37f69e81ad95d2fb10719e0fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b61ade4889db4f6a01bf96731f64a7c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ac42e4b444b2aa35a9817c58b1eaadb</data>
