<node id="NCD">
  <data key="d0">NCD</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">NCD, which stands for Non-Communicable Disease, is a key topic or concept, frequently referenced as a medical concept. It is intrinsically related to the NCD-CIE project. The NCD-CIE project, with which NCD is associated, employs Causal Inference as its core methodology.

Within a Knowledge Graph, NCD is specifically identified by the ID "topic:ncd". It is categorized as a "topic" and has an associated date of "2026-02-22".&lt;SEP&gt;Non-Communicable Diseases, a concept appearing in document titles related to risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to Non-Communicable Diseases, a focus area for the NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search project.&lt;SEP&gt;NCD is a topic related to the NCD-CIE project.</data>
