  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Research Lead is a specific and designated agent role within the professional writing team. This position is an integral part of a 6-agent professional writing team. The primary responsibility of the Research Lead is to lead research efforts, frequently focusing on specific topics, for the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for leading research.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for leading research.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for leading research.</data>
