  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dev Editor is a specific, designated agent role within the professional Writing Team. This role operates as part of a 6-agent professional writing team.

The primary responsibility of the Dev Editor is developmental editing. This entails addressing and fixing structural issues within a document to ensure its overall coherence and integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for developmental editing.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for developmental editing.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;A role within the Writing Team responsible for developmental editing.</data>
