<node id="Peer Review">
  <data key="d0">Peer Review</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Peer Review is a person entity with an unknown role and organization, created on 2026-02-17.&lt;SEP&gt;Peer Review is an academic quality assurance process involving expert evaluation, which uses a 3-agent internal review system.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic quality assurance process that involves expert evaluation and a 3-agent internal review system before submission.&lt;SEP&gt;Peer Review is identified as a topic within a knowledge graph.&lt;SEP&gt;A process for evaluating scholarly work by experts.&lt;SEP&gt;A process of critical evaluation by experts in the field that the NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper underwent and completed.</data>
