<node id="NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper">
  <data key="d0">NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper is a project describing a hybrid causal framework for NCD risk assessment, currently in "Peer Review" status.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a medical AI paper for which a major revision was required, as decided on two separate dates.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper is a content item that requires a major revision.&lt;SEP&gt;A paper and project that proposes a hybrid causal framework for NCD risk assessment, which underwent and completed peer review.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-319918c1dd29c15f300842daf00bc7e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f0d92927e1fe61fcaa737e4340113c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b880fa9519d18c32f4dc952756f8d33f</data>
