</node>
<node id="3-Agent Internal Review System">
  <data key="d0">3-Agent Internal Review System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 3-Agent Internal Review System is a method used for internal review before submission, consisting of a peer-reviewer, methodology-expert, and technical-writer.&lt;SEP&gt;The 3-Agent Internal Review System is a method used for academic quality assurance before submission, involving specific roles.&lt;SEP&gt;An internal system used for academic quality assurance before submission, consisting of peer-reviewer, methodology-expert, and technical-writer agents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba786cd22db86d2c9ebb524a6edc0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa74887b0b129b04310a16bcbf51ffe</data>
