  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Research Monitor Cron Job is an automated task that monitors arXiv daily for relevant papers.&lt;SEP&gt;A scheduled automated task used to daily monitor arXiv for relevant scientific papers.</data>
