<node id="Peer-Reviewer">
  <data key="d0">Peer-Reviewer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Peer-Reviewer is an agent and role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;A Peer-Reviewer is a role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;The Peer-Reviewer conducts internal reviews, critical analysis, and fact-checking of academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for internal review, structural analysis, and quality scoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The peer-reviewer is an agent responsible for conducting quality reviews of the draft paper.&lt;SEP&gt;Peer-Reviewer is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Peer-Reviewer is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Opus model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba786cd22db86d2c9ebb524a6edc0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42dbcaaa04c776c9a79e4a0a86e4077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772609965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Methodology-Expert">
  <data key="d0">Methodology-Expert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Methodology-Expert is an agent and role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;A Methodology-Expert is a role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;The Methodology-Expert focuses on research methods, experimental design, and statistical rigor for academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for method selection, experiment design, and method validation.&lt;SEP&gt;The methodology-expert is an agent responsible for designing experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Methodology-Expert is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Methodology-Expert is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Opus model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba786cd22db86d2c9ebb524a6edc0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42dbcaaa04c776c9a79e4a0a86e4077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772609964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Technical-Writer">
  <data key="d0">Technical-Writer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Technical-Writer is an agent and role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;A Technical-Writer is a role within the 3-Agent Internal Review System.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical-Writer is responsible for drafting sections of academic papers with academic prose and technical accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for paper drafting, prose polish, and style consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;The technical-writer is an agent responsible for writing sections of the paper and drafting the full document.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical-Writer is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Technical-Writer is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Sonnet model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5ba34a6f8c2242b3ad5223bb88b8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dba786cd22db86d2c9ebb524a6edc0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42dbcaaa04c776c9a79e4a0a86e4077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
