<node id="Hybrid Causal Framework">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Causal Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Hybrid Causal Framework is described in the NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper for NCD risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;A method proposed in the NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper designed for Non-Communicable Disease (NCD) risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hybrid Causal Framework is a type of framework used for NCD risk assessment.</data>
