  <data key="d0">Academic Quality Assurance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Academic Quality Assurance is the purpose of the Peer Review Process, achieved through expert evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Quality Assurance is the process of ensuring high standards in academic work, often through expert evaluation.</data>
