<node id="2026-02-16 Update">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-16 Update</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity "2026-02-16 Update" refers to a collection of distinct update events that were comprehensively logged on February 16, 2026, at precisely 23:01. These updates span various projects, files, and systems, with each entry recorded at this specific timestamp.

Among the recorded events, one update pertained to a daily note within Obsidian, and its status was noted as "fixed". Another significant update was associated with the RAG v16 project, where its status was specifically described as "Waiting on Anirach's Colab run". Additionally, an update was logged concerning the 'Daily/2026-01-29-Longevity-Update.md' file, which was in the context of Digital Health.

Further updates occurring at this identical time included an entry detailing the status of the AI Research Dashboard, and another related to the 'KnowledgeGraph/MOC-Teaching.md' file. An update was also documented in an Obsidian daily note, explicitly stating the project's status as "complete". Lastly, a status update was logged for the Obsidian Sync Setup, completing the set of events attributed to the "2026-02-16 Update" timestamp.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fbaa045ec3b789b5deec7c3d70a22a45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a6aef4e8c6f0ba43ff648416ff93362&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62dab2ee902265d6ad95a40794f1fa92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd93670b2a512d5ab952e1569d924f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d411b7c268eefaf6545f390f13955282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31c18aa7d1cfcb501caaac74699be0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181b4f905977b5bffcec8667be7beb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-839e80aabacba95b7bc9a15f89071f88</data>
