  <data key="d0">Prasert</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Prasert is a character identified as a skeptical engineer, featured specifically within the Thai Version Storyline of "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation."

This character is described as being between 78 and 79 years old, and notable for having experienced a period of three years of solitude. All interactions undertaken by Prasert are systematically logged and tracked by a dedicated system known as Memory Log.&lt;SEP&gt;A skeptical engineer whose interactions are logged by Memory Log.&lt;SEP&gt;A person identified as a "skeptical engineer."&lt;SEP&gt;Prasert is a skeptical engineer.</data>
