<node id="Week 6 Sub-Agent">
  <data key="d0">Week 6 Sub-Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Week 6 Sub-Agent is an automated entity, process, software tool, or component specifically designed to build and produce the Week 6 PPTX materials. Its primary objective was to generate the necessary Week 6 PPTX file, particularly for the DevOps VibeCoding Course. However, the Week 6 Sub-Agent failed to complete its assigned task, resulting in its inability to successfully produce the intended Week 6 materials.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent that failed during Week 6.&lt;SEP&gt;A sub-agent responsible for building Week 6 course materials, which failed to complete its task.&lt;SEP&gt;Week 6 Sub-Agent is an entity or process associated with the creation or delivery of Week 6 materials that failed.&lt;SEP&gt;An automated process or tool that failed to build the PPTX for Week 6 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.&lt;SEP&gt;An automated process or component responsible for building Week 6 PPTX, which failed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e63502fbab0047799de5d96c7c2c14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcffafc2471db66eeb67f5125adb0c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d864945e20e92885dc29c45e69563ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
