<node id="Week 6 PPTX">
  <data key="d0">Week 6 PPTX</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Week 6 PPTX is a presentation file, or document, formatted in PPTX. It is specifically designated as presentation material for Week 6 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course.

A defining characteristic of the Week 6 PPTX is its association with a production failure. A sub-agent, often identified as the Week 6 sub-agent, was unable to successfully build, process, or produce this presentation document as intended.&lt;SEP&gt;A presentation artifact in PPTX format intended for Week 6 of the DevOps VibeCoding Course, which the Week 6 Sub-Agent failed to create.&lt;SEP&gt;A presentation material for the DevOps VibeCoding Course that failed to build and needs rebuilding.&lt;SEP&gt;A PowerPoint presentation planned for Week 6, covering CI/CD Pipelines &amp; GitHub Actions, which initially failed to generate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ac41e7b815750ef350fea7e51f97d9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb74e204c7dd87e73929acfc78b00ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4743c2841f2faaf7615a38d9da9db003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2ab36e78bbd6d8f02ab07f4895810d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31453d51b89be1f10297f8b6189b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9697e2fcc47861d37b8694c27fdf6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7556d2839375abe7d7aeb2a5d26c89d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d864945e20e92885dc29c45e69563ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ced6f1879fff73f39fb228a7a586f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d713004e53905bc9678b48a899d29a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772607994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2026-02-22 Early Morning Session">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-22 Early Morning Session</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
