<node id="Proactive Heartbeats">
  <data key="d0">Proactive Heartbeats</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Proactive Heartbeats is an implemented method or specific performance improvement designed to enhance overall performance. This approach involves the regular updating of a checklist, which is documented within the `HEARTBEAT.md` file.

The process of maintaining and updating this checklist in `HEARTBEAT.md` is a core component of how Proactive Heartbeats functions to achieve its objective of improving performance. This method represents a tangible effort to identify and implement performance enhancements.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats is a performance improvement implemented, involving an updated checklist in HEARTBEAT.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are a performance improvement involving an updated checklist in HEARTBEAT.md.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement involving regular updates to a `HEARTBEAT.md` checklist.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement involving regular updates to a `HEARTBEAT.md` checklist.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement involving regular updates to a `HEARTBEAT.md` checklist.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982e44c530f25ae52d6250214d23aabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de7f3eda1a3ae8f971f3f1612e1fb9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c64a6a2928521dc9353558ea2c8300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-585ec9012778369490285b396b88b9bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772824627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Faster Sub-Agent Spawning">
  <data key="d0">Faster Sub-Agent Spawning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Faster Sub-Agent Spawning refers to a specific method implemented to improve performance within a system. This performance enhancement is directly related to increasing the speed of agent creation or the spawning of sub-agents. It is achieved by adding a particular rule, known as the "spawn fast" rule, to the `AGENTS.md` document. This improvement was identified and subsequently added as a rule to `AGENTS.md` to enhance system efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a performance improvement implemented, involving a new rule in AGENTS.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a performance improvement implemented by adding a "spawn fast" rule to AGENTS.md.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement implemented by adding a rule to `AGENTS.md`.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement implemented by adding a rule to `AGENTS.md`.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific performance improvement implemented by adding a rule to `AGENTS.md`.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982e44c530f25ae52d6250214d23aabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de7f3eda1a3ae8f971f3f1612e1fb9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c64a6a2928521dc9353558ea2c8300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-585ec9012778369490285b396b88b9bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772824628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HEARTBEAT.md">
  <data key="d0">HEARTBEAT.md</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">HEARTBEAT.md is a markdown document, or file, that serves as a resource for proactive heartbeats. It contains an actual checklist specifically designed for this purpose. This document has been updated to include this comprehensive checklist and related details, forming an integral part of initiatives referred to as the "Proactive Heartbeats improvement" or the "Proactive Heartbeats method."&lt;SEP&gt;HEARTBEAT.md is a document that was updated with an actual checklist as part of a performance improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;HEARTBEAT.md is a file updated with a checklist for proactive heartbeats and is subject to self-protection rules, requiring confirmation before deletion.&lt;SEP&gt;A document containing a checklist for proactive heartbeats.&lt;SEP&gt;A document containing a checklist for proactive heartbeats.&lt;SEP&gt;A document containing a checklist for proactive heartbeats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982e44c530f25ae52d6250214d23aabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de7f3eda1a3ae8f971f3f1612e1fb9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c64a6a2928521dc9353558ea2c8300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-585ec9012778369490285b396b88b9bd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772824627</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AGENTS.md">
  <data key="d0">AGENTS.md</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">AGENTS.md is a markdown document that functions as a repository for various rules. A key update to this file involved the addition of the "spawn fast" rule, which was introduced to govern and accelerate the process of sub-agent spawning. This specific rule is an integral part of broader efforts referred to as either the "Faster Sub-Agent Spawning improvement" or the "Faster Sub-Agent Spawning method," aiming to enhance the overall efficiency and speed of sub-agent deployment as a performance improvement.

Beyond its role in sub-agent spawning, AGENTS.md also contains rules for immediate write-down. The document is subject to self-protection rules, which require confirmation before it can be deleted. Additionally, AGENTS.md serves as a comprehensive resource that describes and details all four working modes within the orchestrator.&lt;SEP&gt;A document containing rules, including one for faster sub-agent spawning.&lt;SEP&gt;AGENTS.md is a document that describes all 4 working modes in the orchestrator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982e44c530f25ae52d6250214d23aabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de7f3eda1a3ae8f971f3f1612e1fb9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c64a6a2928521dc9353558ea2c8300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60b689f3d71dd57c707b347058466c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-585ec9012778369490285b396b88b9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f12cbfe862ebe1e62f29a7e11b350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f92681cbc13202ffab87956e20912b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
