<node id="Translation">
  <data key="d0">Translation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Translation is fundamentally the process of converting text from one language to another, a process frequently highlighted for its creative and literary aspects.

In a more specific context, Translation represents an active topic and a defined process primarily focused on literary and technical conversion between English and Thai. This particular application emphasizes cultural adaptation to effectively resonate with Thai readers and is managed by or involves an 8-agent Translation Team.

Within a knowledge graph, "Translation" is identified as a topic, with a specific date recorded as 2026-02-22. It also serves as a descriptive tag associated with the project known as "Three Old Men - Thai Translation."&lt;SEP&gt;A topic related to the "Three Old Men" project.&lt;SEP&gt;A target audience for skills beneficial for translation tasks.</data>
