<node id="Arthur Test Project">
  <data key="d0">Arthur Test Project</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Arthur Test Project is a distinct entity within a knowledge graph, functioning as both a project and a dedicated document. This project was initiated and created on 2026-02-16 and is specifically associated with "Arthur Test." It is actively tracked and updated within the knowledge graph environment.

As a project, Arthur Test Project includes various status updates and interactions, with records of these updates noted on 2026-02-16 and 2026-02-17. The updates for this project are linked to daily notes, providing a continuous feed of information, though its specific current status is described as unknown in some contexts.

In its capacity as a document, "Arthur Test Project" holds this exact title and is formally listed within the knowledge graph's index. This project document also incorporates metadata and serves as a central repository for all associated updates and information, making it a comprehensive record of the project's progress and details.&lt;SEP&gt;A project created during an earlier test session using the Project Management template.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-554d48815662523a4566bd006ddfa93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6be54c929385dd071c3a049be5445ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b15276d23770f4a21efd88bf43ad30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c371260389e0782fbfb49af2d151de86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c82b0e2fda7221eed2ac68c51fb536bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32855dc2dff1a004e9b91107378406a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c5a70979621ecba9f2af3a411200b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad8f051101e5ae26929a5b8420de3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a12dd228152046a90cac0ca6d30ef4fd</data>
