  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An academic paper focused on Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) that is the subject of a decision regarding its transparent framing.&lt;SEP&gt;A paper whose framing was decided upon to be transparent about its performance relative to ML baselines and its contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG Paper is a related project or document concerning RAG approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;The RAG Paper is a research document focused on Retrieval Augmented Generation, framed as an honest proof-of-concept with contributions in generalization and zero hallucination.&lt;SEP&gt;A general topic of papers for which the AttentionRetriever paper is relevant.</data>
