<node id="Obsidian Knowledge Graph Index File">
  <data key="d0">Obsidian Knowledge Graph Index File</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Obsidian Knowledge Graph Index File is an auto-generated markdown index file specifically located at the path `Obsidian: KnowledgeGraph/_index.md`. This file serves as the central and physical source for the Knowledge Graph Index within an Obsidian vault.

Its primary functions include providing a comprehensive overview of the knowledge graph and recording recent activity. It is also noted as the source for specific action items within the Obsidian environment, reinforcing its role as a key organizational and reference point.</data>
