<node id="Project">
  <data key="d0">Project</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Project is defined as a general concept, conceptual tag, or classification type employed for categorizing a wide array of initiatives, planned undertakings, endeavors, or tasks. It functions as a general classification tag to associate specific work, documents, or decisions, thereby identifying them by their nature as a defined undertaking or a particular type of initiative. Essentially, a Project represents a planned piece of work or an undertaking that possesses specific goals, deliverables, a clear objective, and is characterized by a defined scope. It serves as an organized undertaking or a general category of work, and can be utilized as a category in file paths or as a type and tag for various activities, such as Course Preparation.

This conceptual tag is broadly applied across diverse contexts and domains. For instance, it classifies specific documents and decisions including the "RAG Second Brain Paper V15," the "Chartsense AI MVP Decision," the "ChartSense AI MVP Document," the "RAG Second Brain Paper," the "NCD-CIE Medical AI Paper," and the "NCD-CIE 3-Reviewer Consensus." Development efforts and undertakings such as "ChartSense AI," "OpenClaw Web UI," "HA Database," the "PPTX Slide Generation Workflow," the "HA De-Identification Tool," "AI News Briefing," "iPhone Obsidian Sync," "gog CLI," the "Enhanced Agent Soul Format," "Agent Teams Configuration," and "session_remember.py" are likewise categorized as Projects.

Further examples encompass educational and strategic initiatives including the "DevOps VibeCoding Course," "Ncd-Health-Plus," the "Executive Strategic Development Class," and the "KMUTNB Project." Other endeavors classified as Projects include the "Thai Translator Agent," the "Arthur Test Project," the "ClawdBot Enterprise Deployment Report," "Academic Workflow V2," the "Three Old Men: Nobel Edition," "Helpdesk Project Analysis," "ชายชราสามคน: บทสนทนาครั้งสุดท้าย" (Three Old Men: The Last Conversation), "Personalized Medicine," the "Personal Books Management System," "MKG-RAG," and "Claude Sonnet 4.6." The classification also extends to specific teams and pipelines like the "Translation Team," the "Writing Team," the "Coding Team Expansion," and the "Knowledge Graph Auto-Extraction Pipeline." Additionally, "Project" is a classification type associated with events such as the NCD-CIE Novelty Summit and broader categories like Digital Health, collectively signifying their status as distinct, organized initiatives, undertakings, or endeavors.&lt;SEP&gt;A Project is the overarching initiative or work effort for which this template is used, encompassing various attributes, requirements, and progress tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;A category tag indicating that the work log pertains to a project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4f719cbd2b4a06b6e395856df09e63b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e70d63a61fe7a75ad278b4906fa6902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3bbc6161991a60ef58482f8460ddc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09f974a7e07b869b8c3e753624d8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751be46e20df3b37bd63fa973c59464d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d687ae0c2e320f41a3ed208b744ed0c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31aecfbd1806722cba1f2d32380d2ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-115813a810d0017b7b8bfde9c5b23920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b50b5967db824f18c025ce5c6296b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0cfe9319855f7ec81ec53e34735e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dddf26577cf1847d5e2acfbdd7b4edd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-710089e3df854a623565c6a250d728dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7b71e9d299fac7d9999308dad4630e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fafefef8ba1cba2f61021819f9581d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c76d26675f6169a1424697817b540a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-103ed3e7cebc29d642c02a52e578fae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bc8e55ab6bb5dc12bf6c9f1a5115a34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62dab2ee902265d6ad95a40794f1fa92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f9e405f1bc12388544826efbc16a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7ad8f051101e5ae26929a5b8420de3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a5b9736ebbe3190b02500066610a61e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b72c9581d600c3f20a8bdb9ee8741deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd93670b2a512d5ab952e1569d924f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4a9ece2166802c35be3d604504235f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93ccfd025e00f44df40ec59c3891a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5103630df0803c1e3cbbaa4e79376dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc3e32fc1224192d75f088e0be90fbe8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0222fb766a0b59147ce2fda3127509ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d891b1128ef17de43a346930c71fcedb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab8b08a3f31a591e78612630a4834ca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697c17c9e9d1440d003278e6c0653517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbbcfe0be216f8fb001987c2a5a2045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91115be8530dd16532054e7897b85685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47c1836e8fb75118ee138b571e8e54a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8268912354c6ad40989f1deca0c0990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-770d59e9c9d5c05b79be0cf96cc99ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b880fa9519d18c32f4dc952756f8d33f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64dc54b19fb5051482649c5f6891eac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855a7b9b754afa277b859bf595ac59c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36924dea015893e3d1e0904b5b96fa4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12bf851bd2b7d8bab