<node id="Sales">
  <data key="d0">Sales</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sales, in this context, refers to a categorical tag, concept, or business domain primarily associated with the VPIPE Database Query Guide. This tag indicates the content's relevance to sales and its potential business context.

It functions as a domain or concept within the 'VPIPE Database Query Guide', and is also implicitly linked to the broader VPIPE Database itself. The association of "Sales" with these resources signifies that their content is related to sales activities, processes, or data, providing a clear indication of their subject matter.</data>
