<node id="Session Snapshot (Msg #20)">
  <data key="d0">Session Snapshot (Msg #20)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A Session Snapshot (Msg #20) is a comprehensive record or data snapshot taken of a specific agent session. This particular snapshot was recorded at 09:31 BKK. It indicates an active session in which 20 messages had been exchanged, with the entity name specifically referencing the twentieth message.

The snapshot provides detailed information about the session, including its unique session ID, identified as "agent:chapter-writer:main". It also captures the source of the last message, which originated from Telegram ID 7579913696. Further details provided by the Session Snapshot include the total message count, the auto-snapshot status, and a "/restart" snippet, offering a complete overview of the session's state at the time the record was created.&lt;SEP&gt;A record of a session taken at 09:31 BKK, indicating an active session with 20 messages exchanged and a last message from Telegram ID 7579913696.</data>
