<node id="Memory: 2026-02-17">
  <data key="d0">Memory: 2026-02-17</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Memory: 2026-02-17 is defined as a data artifact representing recorded information or a specific state from February 17, 2026. This entity functions as a memory entry, capturing a particular historical record, and is described as a recorded interaction event from that date, encompassing both session notes and project updates. It serves as a specific memory reference or recollection from that date.

This artifact is consistently identified as the original, explicit, specified, or recorded source from which various action items originated and details were extracted. It provides the original source and contextual basis for details regarding the NCD-CIE validation reframing decision, and offers essential context for a decision made on February 18, 2026.

More precisely, Memory: 2026-02-17 is recognized as the specific source of information for several action items, including the NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search action item, Action Item V11, and the iPhone Obsidian Sync action item. It is also referenced as a specific source for the Paper Journey Report Re-attempt. This solidifies its critical role as a foundational record and the originating source for subsequent tasks and decisions.</data>
