  <data key="d2">Memory: 2026-02-16 denotes a dated record or a specific memory log entry originating from February 16, 2026. This entry is associated with Source Knowledge and specifically documents Anirach's interactions from that day.

This entity serves as a critical source of information and context. It is explicitly identified as the source for several action items and provides foundational context for various decisions and action items related to activities that transpired on February 16, 2026. Furthermore, Memory: 2026-02-16 is the specified source of information and context for a particular decision and its corresponding decision document, functioning as an identified past record furnishing vital source material.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory: 2026-02-16 is the recorded source context for the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory: 2026-02-16 is identified as the source for the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory: 2026-02-16 is recorded as the source from which the action item originated.&lt;SEP&gt;The source of the action item, indicating when it was identified or recalled.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory: 2026-02-16 is the source event or record from which the action item originated.</data>
