<node id="Decision: Always Reply In English Unless Told Otherwise">
  <data key="d0">Decision: Always Reply In English Unless Told Otherwise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Decision: Always Reply In English Unless Told Otherwise is a specific decision made on 2026-02-19, owned by Anirach, concerning the language for replies.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision: Always Reply In English Unless Told Otherwise is a formal rule or guideline established on 2026-02-16, requiring replies to be in English unless explicitly stated otherwise.&lt;SEP&gt;This decision outlines a policy to always reply in English unless instructed otherwise.&lt;SEP&gt;A decision stipulating that replies should always be in English unless otherwise specified.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a formal resolution regarding the language for replies.&lt;SEP&gt;A decision made on 2026-02-23, stating that replies should always be in English unless specified otherwise.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f32a78c6c67519031ad6fce621286984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b1ed4435cc328b1be3bffd3a91c29cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b4723f41f5edc729e05c5c22681dbdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7477e5f2d7062d4766fa6bd25cc3e557&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b151a186aa1ee81891174399f6c9c6a2</data>
