  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sonnet 4 is a previous version of a model from which 15 sub-agents were upgraded to Claude Sonnet 4.6.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet 4 is an older version of the Claude Sonnet AI model, from which 15 sub-agents were upgraded.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9</data>
