<node id="Sub-Agents">
  <data key="d0">Sub-Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Sub-Agents are a collective of 15 specialized software components or autonomous processes designed to function as secondary or ancillary agents within a broader workflow. These entities are intended to be spawned for specific work tasks, particularly those identified by a governing decision as exceeding a duration of 30 seconds.

These Sub-Agents operate within a restricted sandbox environment. Their permissions are limited, preventing them from installing packages, accessing Node.js, or directly pushing to platforms like GitHub. The group of 15 specialized modules includes functions such as chapter-writer, copy-editor, engagement-analyst, technical-writer, format-editor, document-formatter, and translation-manager. Notably, these Sub-Agents underwent an upgrade, transitioning from Sonnet 4 to Claude Sonnet 4.6. Although engineered for various tasks and intended to be spawned as needed, it was observed that none were active on a specific day.&lt;SEP&gt;Agents operating within the Docker Sandbox that were initially unable to write to the `/workspace` directory.&lt;SEP&gt;Software components or automated systems identified as unreliable for generating PPTX slides.&lt;SEP&gt;Agents that operate within a sandbox environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Entities or groups that are checked or communicated with during the heartbeat check.&lt;SEP&gt;Sub-agents are entities whose status or activity is monitored or checked by heartbeat systems or during heartbeat checks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f9a385ebc3487ab67289add07185a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11cd70d3ce054395fe64464e8fc8861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ba71d5d5bc8db56c16d1e6b194a9f03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15c956d1b8aee7ee1ab799cb4d8b6fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f8a20b859668d076e2131327e584f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa5f3a0dec5b20e14cc7cc2015e60c99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d937855d6741d631206fe2166f581ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ced3e03077dc272a4034f7f14b2b7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19428f58c5416a435b7731bfeb99f8b6</data>
