<node id="2026-02-19">
  <data key="d0">2026-02-19</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">2026-02-19 is a significant date associated with a multitude of decisions, project creations, updates, and action item initiations across various initiatives. On this particular date, two formal decisions were recorded: the "Decision: Always Reply In English Unless Told Otherwise" was formalized, and a strategic decision was made to build a full-stack clinical decision support Minimum Viable Product (MVP) specifically tailored for Thai hospitals.

The date 2026-02-19 is also linked to several project creations and updates. It marks the creation date for the Coding Team Expansion project, which also saw its first update recorded on this day. Additionally, the README Style Guide and Claude Sonnet 4.6 were created on 2026-02-19. Project updates on this date include developments concerning OpenClaw and an update on the status of the NCD-CIE-LLM Paper. This date is frequently referenced within 'Memory' update entries, particularly in the memory section of updates for the Ncd-Health-Plus project and as "Memory" within the updates of the Ncd-Care-Plus project.

Furthermore, 2026-02-19 is the date associated with the creation or identification of action items, specifically mentioning the "Facebook post help" action item. The date generally serves as a logging point for various project updates and memory references within different systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4e9e850cc678da23e40adf85f868cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484d26d16f8d22b0da30066e9b461f34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fa311d78b9573958fb29c2bb7c51579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7477e5f2d7062d4766fa6bd25cc3e557&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31aecfbd1806722cba1f2d32380d2ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-710089e3df854a623565c6a250d728dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fafefef8ba1cba2f61021819f9581d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44c1a123087cc409036740695d3c1d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb12a2a60e0e0e5a63663c8327983299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-770d59e9c9d5c05b79be0cf96cc99ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8268912354c6ad40989f1deca0c0990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36924dea015893e3d1e0904b5b96fa4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-405f90d13ba7901a59987c342b6158aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dae925b6e333f6ad49e74fff691b321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d564a5ed28e9c1eb24fe2df9cb126307</data>
