<node id="SSH Tunnel">
  <data key="d0">SSH Tunnel</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An SSH Tunnel is a secure network tunneling method and a secure connection method. It is being considered as a potential solution or alternative for enabling remote access in various contexts. Specifically, the SSH Tunnel is a method considered for providing remote access to the OpenClaw Web UI and the OpenClaw Gateway. Additionally, it serves as a secure connection method utilized for the Browser Relay setup, specifically on port 18793.</data>
