<node id="Claude Code">
  <data key="d0">Claude Code</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Claude Code is the subject of this document, associated with knowledge graph activities and a specific action item for authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform or framework for which plugins are developed, and Arscontexta is an example of such a plugin.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific code base for which authentication needs to be set up.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude Code is an execution engine used by all agents for native file operations, shell command execution, Git operations, and multi-file awareness.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude Code is the execution engine for the Coding Agent Team, providing native file operations, shell command execution, and Git integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A coding agent that requires authentication setup.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific coding agent mentioned in lessons learned.</data>
