<node id="Status">
  <data key="d0">Status</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Status is an attribute or field that describes the current condition, state, or progress of various items. It serves as a categorization of the present operational state, providing an immediate understanding of a subject's current situation.

Most frequently, Status refers to the current state of an action item. In this context, it is defined as an attribute or field within an action item's metadata, indicating its current operational condition, state, or progress. For example, the status of an action item regarding the NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search is explicitly noted as "open." Similarly, for 'Rebuild Week 6 Sub-Agent (PPTX)', its operational state or current progress is also indicated as "open."

Beyond action items, Status can also categorize the state or condition of a discussion topic, often guided by a Quick Status Legend, or indicate the current condition of an update. Across all these applications, Status consistently functions as a descriptor of current condition, state, or progress.&lt;SEP&gt;Status is an attribute that describes the current state of an action item.&lt;SEP&gt;The current state of the action item, explicitly stated as "open".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-962e74b4b393dbecf071ab90944f09d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91115be8530dd16532054e7897b85685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2489793eb7c67ea21c3019cde05e38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c133512663877544ce76399dec1202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7b17ffee9e2718e84789be096f8eb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-805fa7e9a6e788653ad117ed0227d7c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f172151cb83a3d9c8d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df99b484480e6f1c06f107219c0b867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3ae3c1ef1d49f30b2e0d1d79ff7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7321e5c6840eded3646dcf9905cfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a49ce3e3a6ea95d15d086aa1c70e6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ea5e131e305f309112c1dee0c52336&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa07884e0daa95f3076c3b00518f2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5671eadde7740e9fc926166d6ce4d660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d78c13443367a6638fb67e23cf0558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49a2a856b8bd05700b4f33eb914dd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0675b88b9f4cf07a0e2ae3b73847404d</data>
