  <data key="d0">Code Examples</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Code Examples is a person whose information is documented in a knowledge graph, though their specific role and organization are unknown.&lt;SEP&gt;Code Examples are a deliverable of the course, including PRD templates, React components, and an Express API.&lt;SEP&gt;Illustrative programming examples, listed as a deliverable.&lt;SEP&gt;Code Examples are functional programming snippets provided as part of course materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Practical code samples provided as a component of the Vibe Coding Antigravity course, currently in progress.</data>
