<node id="Bangkok Time">
  <data key="d0">Bangkok Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bangkok Time is a specific timezone referenced for the time (05:52) when the Anthropic/Claude-Opus-4-6 model initially failed.&lt;SEP&gt;The timezone used for logging activities in the agent work log.&lt;SEP&gt;The specified time zone used for scheduling automated tasks within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Bangkok Time refers to the Asia/Bangkok timezone used for scheduling the Daily AI News Cron Job.&lt;SEP&gt;The time zone used for scheduling the daily cron jobs.&lt;SEP&gt;Bangkok Time refers to the UTC+7 time zone, which Arthur learned to always use when communicating with Anirach about times.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific time zone standard used to define the daily schedule of 8:00 AM and 10:00 PM.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5a092f15c5c85000d18f0e0d6fd80a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4652814dbdde910f7f2eb9c027d57b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62b8c58cedfa24794136151188ad15e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b833576f6ded00efd508619d87e78d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61736ce38c27461a2b10ba4645d7dc0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb159995fe0aaa27664948d87f740cda</data>
