<node id="Batch Processing">
  <data key="d0">Batch Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Batch Processing describes a method of processing data or tasks in groups. It is characterized as an automated or scheduled operation, executed at specific, recurring intervals. This process is designed to handle data and perform updates, often by processing information from various data sources. Furthermore, Batch Processing activities frequently generate timestamped records of operations or data collection, reflecting their scheduled and sequential execution over time.</data>
