<node id="Remember Command">
  <data key="d0">Remember Command</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Remember Command, specifically identified as `/remember`, is a command feature primarily used for capturing session learnings and decisions. This command originated within Arscontexta, where it served as a foundational inspiration. Its influence is notable as it directly inspired the implementation of the `session_remember.py` script, which functions as a tool for similar purposes.</data>
