<node id="Document">
  <data key="d0">Document</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Document, as an entity, represents a classification type or category used to define the fundamental nature of content, information, or an entry. This classification serves to identify the kind of material being referenced or analyzed, often derived from its type and tags metadata. It functions as a classification or tag indicating that an item is a document, or as a written or recorded piece of information.

As a general classification, "Document" is utilized for various content items. For instance, it is used to categorize the Builder's Console Log, the Academic Paper Team Guide V4 Docx, and the NCD Causal Insight Engine, as specified within their metadata. In certain contexts, the classification itself is explicitly "Document," affirming its role in defining the content's type.

Furthermore, "Document" can be a classification indicating that the entity "View" is a document, or it can serve as the source for details about specific programs, such as the Levi's Red Tab Program. It can also identify a content item associated with the ICoSSE Committee and dated 2026-02-22, explicitly stating its type.&lt;SEP&gt;A piece of content that outlines the 'AI Accelerator (Skool)'.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d48a6f463325de1ca58ba3a5f2b5d92b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a7b6a0bc678ada131dbadd1491d603e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41f4da4aa3333d646df07a062b699212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5f79e2c4ecde24f952b81d2fc7d085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbe214fed00f35b658191754e5c85893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2405cb871d76edfc96a8db186aae5fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-443a93dd603de213fbd670bc62eede2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efa53e3227ab750f4ecdc240c4891ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f9c532c1ef2142c9cb9c2c5b2791c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f4c13b5b12784bac71e30e8354e1796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d23e3547ea2f41db3dc5cffdc7388d1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995a97412985697370ea0d1a3c2cad40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d506075ad34c2f4ce76fc5810a0edb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6791b66bed9647cc3a1ea2ede91c7055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32c777c0b31946abab079798f7505e3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2697983eea52b76a28755dc61426b4c</data>
