<node id="Sonnet">
  <data key="d0">Sonnet</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Sonnet is an AI model with a broad range of applications, primarily serving to support various specialized agents across multiple operational teams. Within the writing team, Sonnet is utilized by agents such as the Chapter-Writer and Copy-Editor. It also provides support to the PR-Agent, Testing agent, and Docs agents for their respective functions.

Furthermore, Sonnet plays a significant role in documentation and formatting tasks, assisting the Document Formatter with layout and design duties. It also aids the Technical-Writer and Format-Editor in drafting and formatting content. Its utility extends to the Translation Memory Agent. For the Coding Agent Team, Sonnet is assigned to the remaining roles within the team's configuration, indicating its broad application among several agents in that team, including the Engagement-Analyst.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is a model used by several agents within the Course Preparation Team, including Content Writer, Slide Designer, Assessment Creator, Video Script Writer, and Accessibility Checker.&lt;SEP&gt;A model used by Content Writer, Slide Designer, and Assessment Creator agents.&lt;SEP&gt;A fallback model.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI agent configured to perform the remaining roles within the coding team.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity configured to handle the remaining roles within the coding team.&lt;SEP&gt;Sonnet is an entity configured for the 'rest' role within the coding team.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c60b689f3d71dd57c707b347058466c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46acd3e509aa2a1265a39d2c0a5e6f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-734ec6fc710d1be198572ead525f9006&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7100679e3937becf6384cc43b1a9d6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b8b8b210560c10d99d3e258c99b2f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572bc319ace0969403b23edbb05f1603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f12cbfe862ebe1e62f29a7e11b350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f92681cbc13202ffab87956e20912b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
