  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Local Development refers to the context for which the decision about SQLite was made.&lt;SEP&gt;Local Development refers to the process of developing software on a local machine.&lt;SEP&gt;The environment where SQLite is intended to be used.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f070dc633489f685a59e40392fc9154a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3798f4a234fcc46c4df14537567aed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db2cbf7fe0012c6db40e7c54c9c9cbca</data>
