<node id="Decision">
  <data key="d0">Decision</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Decision is primarily understood as a classification type, tag, or general concept used to categorize documented content. It indicates that the associated document or item formally represents a choice, resolution, or judgment, thereby signifying its nature as a record of a resolved determination. This classification is often specified by a 'type: decision' field, attributed to a document to highlight its content as a formal decision, and can serve as a categorical tag for the main entity or primary subject of the document.

Documents categorized under "Decision" therefore contain formal choices, resolutions, or conclusions, often made on a specific date and, in some cases, with designated owners. Specific examples of content falling under this classification include a formal choice or judgment made on February 22, 2026, to increase the compaction buffer, or a formal choice made on February 16, 2026, regarding the implementation of delays for skill installs due to ClawHub's rate limits.

Further instances of a Decision encompass a record of adding Longevity Healthcare to a topic within a knowledge graph (made on 2026-02-16), a formal conclusion made on February 22, 2026, to use PPTX format for slide generation confirming Anirach's preference, and a document whose primary subject is the readiness of Paper V23.1 for resubmission. Other examples include a specific event or conclusion made on 2026-02-16 concerning Web UI chat access, with Anirach as an owner; a formal conclusion or resolution regarding DOCX generation; a formal choice specifically concerning the implementation of `session_remember.py`; and a formal determination made on a specific date concerning the "https://unused" string.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f070dc633489f685a59e40392fc9154a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2658044b457f38d12539ae6d9a492ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f32a78c6c67519031ad6fce621286984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44fa7abcb5c47ec72ccd283b94f8970c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3dd06c1a00444deb7203ca5c811e8f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-484d26d16f8d22b0da30066e9b461f34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b1ed4435cc328b1be3bffd3a91c29cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf917e9d32da670c5b288b96f6ec512f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8810b0cc19fdc55c82c76db548698a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00b881fac5d94f295a6236193fad4f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c58b7644953ef75c0975b2aed17b0672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fa311d78b9573958fb29c2bb7c51579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7477e5f2d7062d4766fa6bd25cc3e557&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f8a20b859668d076e2131327e584f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd7296cd3ce9b62a29d990df906014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2512a1902cdc7b135fa04c725a1649d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b349303f05cdb1ee379fe54f8df72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82737226bf4c5bc8eb7724d162c70efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f01a379b88411f3fea98cada6df79f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3ae39579d8b764c6c813b3be381abe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-888fac03c77f9f66eb0e9e6ab9278488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef352d8981ee43c91b847086def4477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e44677d3b7901dfac79e002aeb0d11a5</data>
