<node id="Owner">
  <data key="d0">Owner</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Owner refers to a concept, role, or attribute that designates the individual or group responsible for a specific action item or decision. This role represents the person or entity accountable for completing a particular task and serves as the assigned party for a given action item. In various contexts, "Owner" is identified as a dedicated field within the metadata of an action item, specifically designed to specify the responsible party.

A notable and consistently mentioned characteristic is that the "Owner" is frequently unspecified or unknown. This status is often explicitly recorded as "Unknown" or "unspecified" within the relevant text or metadata field, indicating that the responsible individual or entity has not yet been determined or assigned for the action item. For instance, the "Owner" for 'Rebuild Week 6 Sub-Agent (PPTX)' has been listed as 'Unknown', and the Owner attribute for Action Item 148 is also stated as 'Unknown'. It is also described as a property indicating the responsible party for Action Item 163.&lt;SEP&gt;A designated role associated with the action item, currently listed as "Unknown".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c873675c6edca93a36f5e9b64698f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a6d2b4dfba56c59d6031c54f98c4bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-454306d201a2fb212f19fe3fa3ddc91f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c133512663877544ce76399dec1202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84e6af8cdccd5c431277b91f96313d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-805fa7e9a6e788653ad117ed0227d7c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f172151cb83a3d9c8d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b43a3439827794bb39b11073f5d7b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df99b484480e6f1c06f107219c0b867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b544c58cf3c9dbaf0980f204b1739d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3ae3c1ef1d49f30b2e0d1d79ff7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7321e5c6840eded3646dcf9905cfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871d601ea0724a2ba77ac39328982ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42b7afbefee15f7ec80afb1bf6ff4c56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a49ce3e3a6ea95d15d086aa1c70e6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ea5e131e305f309112c1dee0c52336&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aa07884e0daa95f3076c3b00518f2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5671eadde7740e9fc926166d6ce4d660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d78c13443367a6638fb67e23cf0558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-744afc749372124945957d4a0fa3660b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1d23c22473007c4333aa91e8f8d366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1de4efc5e7b6ce50de1426a4a46cee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0675b88b9f4cf07a0e2ae3b73847404d</data>
