  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">This is an update logged on February 17, 2026, at 04:00, which includes topics of life extension and aging studies.&lt;SEP&gt;An update event for the RAG v16 project, recorded at 04:00 on 2026-02-17, with the status "Waiting on Anirach's Colab run".&lt;SEP&gt;An update event recorded at 04:00 on 2026-02-17, referencing the 'Daily/2026-01-29-Longevity-Update.md' file regarding Digital Health and reiterating technology-enabled healthcare solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;An update entry from 2026-02-17 at 04:00 detailing the technologies used in building and deploying the AI Research Dashboard.&lt;SEP&gt;An update event recorded on February 17, 2026, at 04:00, related to the KnowledgeGraph/MOC-Teaching.md file.&lt;SEP&gt;An update event on 2026-02-17 at 04:00, recorded in an Obsidian daily note, detailing the upload of professional DOCX guides to Google Drive.&lt;SEP&gt;A status update logged on February 17, 2026, marking the completion of the Git-based sync setup.</data>
