<node id="Main Agent">
  <data key="d0">Main Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Main Agent is defined as a specific computing agent, system, software component, or designated role that operates as a central and primary entity across multiple operational contexts. It serves as the explicit target for the "Obsidian Vault Overhaul" project, where its presence is essential for the successful execution of the overhaul, and it performs direct tasks such as merging and overhauling. Furthermore, the Main Agent is consistently identified as the subject of the "Paper Journey Report" and is the primary agent designated for the re-attempt of this report.

Beyond these specific projects, the Main Agent is endowed with a diverse set of critical responsibilities. It functions as a primary software component or automated system, recognized as the most reliable approach for PPTX generation. It possesses the capability to manage file operations outside the sandboxes of sub-agents, indicating a foundational role in system architecture and control. The Main Agent is also responsible for maintaining and updating skills, suggesting a capacity for knowledge management or ongoing development, and is tasked with complex reasoning, particularly within cost optimization settings.

From a technical and configuration perspective, the Main Agent is the primary entity for which the `AllowAgents` list in the `Gateway Config` was updated, highlighting its importance in access control and system permissions. As a system component, its memory status has been observed to show 11 files indexed and 21 chunks, providing specific insight into its operational state or data processing characteristics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b5845743b8c8578a99f24b4c508347e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a6d2b4dfba56c59d6031c54f98c4bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4eedc9d0b3db71ede8291e98f060f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfca51e677015e2359e2c533733b33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df52400e03ce1f46b305d9451bac799b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de47617ba23e1c5187fa506f9810eb4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e634d3674ac9bd7ea4fe3c1e46c06e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0063aebd96d2b29d64f7a455c2ad8475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cea9d91f2ca3cf48f1682c604afbf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ced3e03077dc272a4034f7f14b2b7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff7de3ecdbdeec06151e805c84a460f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a2f4932683deada51cf0bb651a5811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d361334741e195fd3cc01498c5d61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-280669fa49c70eb7ad44fa8711ecb2d2</data>
