<node id="Open Status">
  <data key="d0">Open Status</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Open Status is a designation that describes the current state or operational status of an action item. It consistently indicates that an item is active, operational, and has not yet reached completion or resolution. This status signifies an ongoing activity that is in progress, requires attention, and is pending resolution, explicitly marking an item as 'open' to denote it is unresolved or currently active, awaiting further action or completion.

This status applies broadly to various types of action items, confirming their active state and the requirement for ongoing attention until their ultimate completion. It represents a specific value within a status system, indicating that an item is active, unresolved, and pending fulfillment.

Examples of action items designated with an Open Status include "Install Codex CLI," "Complete Vault Overhaul Backlinking," "Create UI Wireframes," "Obsidian Vault Overhaul," and "Facebook Post Help." Additionally, numerous numerically identified items such as Action Item 133, Item 138, Action Item 109, Action Item 126, Action Item 142, Action Item 113, Action Item 153, Action Item 121, Action Item 132, Action-Item 152, Action-Item 135, Action-Item 150, Action Item 151, Action Item 125, Action Item 148, Item 156, Action Item 158, and Action Item 163 are also described as having an Open Status, signifying their active and unresolved state requiring attention.&lt;SEP&gt;The current status of the action item, indicating it is active and not yet completed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8fe34a4cc58de2283c7d1bd0c4a8601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f7905621f5bc1f742d393b17f19249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191ee41271401232e9471f34a4c06719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b562d82caa30ba88bd5052e59263b9db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cca05ad3f3996f4bae901f9a8acc4bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac51671082e2e50bfc5526f58ef427c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15dc479711b2758d90de9c222f00589d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74557fd16efa9a82777f3a28c0a487b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7894f489c85dbb132a2803b749a02ca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b987c1d79a4b6abba04e756e6a4cb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78ed7df389d60c81c051e05c8f353cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4eedc9d0b3db71ede8291e98f060f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2bfbe87d5ce5fcc4ebe045a23d0c8bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03acda338173ae2441ba9aa9f0a604ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a20ed755fb3bc7c92c4bce8794b5381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-508c3fea94b0b2ebcb092f835d151aa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d4a03820cfb4e612754c64db8aa7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f9c416cabc71161b7cb94568b677f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a7d70bcf4d9abe91d1e8857f535f195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ab6e36e2e8bcc5f6a0716553ebc4adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d669f067966e810fdc009c290d162e09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de0c831f333fdaf3139f9bbd6896f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9150e1c5b964d39f6b1ca9d870a76ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8e4d0178b52c0e697766fc14d96088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-117a01998ed6bd453ae3b3bd5c075ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c81a1607b189e4dccda6f296a585133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84e6af8cdccd5c431277b91f96313d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba754fb7a934f88d986d68a77c5aedf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-614be20b6b5d9a223ad1f1221a3397aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5edcfa052169facf4607d180a7541573&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367b61ad4d0cfbd9f210ee8fa52bdb2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dae925b6e333f6ad49e74fff691b321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-959cc787ebf7ba849ceed8fc31031862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bdeda52180347e871c154fa8a5e6f40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c4c3af39228dfc818ea14fb6d2b998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afbb63caec068a5e2167da9e1305a74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564d8cbe6d4c74180f4e5a59066a30ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82000a369de64695ee9e77404f921414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32564ea5df1261b524cbfe5099042e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9402536e9419b42ab050ff6b9aa8ad11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f1721