<node id="Deadline">
  <data key="d0">Deadline</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity **Deadline** is defined as a specified time or date by which a particular task, action item, or action must be completed. It functions as a target completion date, indicating precisely when an associated action or task is due, and represents the expected or required completion date for an action item. This concept serves as an attribute, a metadata field, a property, or a parameter intrinsically linked to an action item, establishing its required completion date or time. It is frequently referenced within document metadata, highlighting its crucial role in project and task management by setting expected completion times and limits.

While a Deadline establishes a required completion date, it is consistently noted for numerous specified action items as being currently unspecified, unset, unassigned, or empty. This indicates that a definitive completion date has yet to be designated or assigned for these particular tasks, meaning their scheduled completion time remains undetermined or currently empty.

Examples of action items for which the Deadline is currently unspecified include Action Item 113, Action Item 119, Action Item 123, Action Item 133, Item 138, Action Item 150, Action Item 152, Action Item 153, Action Item 148, the NCD-CIE Open Dataset Search, and the "Complete Vault Overhaul Backlinking" action item. Furthermore, a Deadline is also identified as a field associated with Item 156 and a property of Action Item 163, indicating a target completion date.&lt;SEP&gt;A metadata field for the due date of an action item, which is currently unspecified in the provided text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8fe34a4cc58de2283c7d1bd0c4a8601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a6d2b4dfba56c59d6031c54f98c4bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad9fb1e5163e6414596ae7be5069a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b562d82caa30ba88bd5052e59263b9db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cca05ad3f3996f4bae901f9a8acc4bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2489793eb7c67ea21c3019cde05e38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b532fc0a0b97056a26a986eb3b68e8db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac51671082e2e50bfc5526f58ef427c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74557fd16efa9a82777f3a28c0a487b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef9b92487c0eb97be37bbcd945c00f5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78ed7df389d60c81c051e05c8f353cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fddb2cc14c43a22c2bff400f2e91900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a20ed755fb3bc7c92c4bce8794b5381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c133512663877544ce76399dec1202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f9c416cabc71161b7cb94568b677f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8e4d0178b52c0e697766fc14d96088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c81a1607b189e4dccda6f296a585133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84e6af8cdccd5c431277b91f96313d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba754fb7a934f88d986d68a77c5aedf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7b17ffee9e2718e84789be096f8eb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5edcfa052169facf4607d180a7541573&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367b61ad4d0cfbd9f210ee8fa52bdb2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-553970a05990c86011314bb088dd2739&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afbb63caec068a5e2167da9e1305a74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564d8cbe6d4c74180f4e5a59066a30ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32564ea5df1261b524cbfe5099042e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f172151cb83a3d9c8d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dd82473e60ee409e79c432ae7e88f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b43a3439827794bb39b11073f5d7b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89d2648e975a4036194dd794a0bdc8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17260ee92d5f2ab447bb3a042a50f2a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a9acf162e5acb3eb87ad704b48c1e86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14eec4ba21399e018e3f0aacefcb6f3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df99b484480e6f1c06f107219c0b867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b544c58cf3c9dbaf0980f204b1739d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e25ce8b34a0336b469e6f8e4f36694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613e97c0cb32aa0139261992837483ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1442862b96b3d5c9f6c0a383b69f83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb523eb64da5cc78b32fcd2b4b4df26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a667a400dc093dec5aeac02a341e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed97bca06c7f4723d