<node id="Status Open">
  <data key="d0">Status Open</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Status Open refers to a current state or status that indicates an item, task, or, more specifically, an action item is active and has not yet been completed. This designation signifies that the item is operational and currently in progress.

It further implies that the action item remains unresolved and is awaiting further action or final completion. Essentially, "Status Open" marks an item as active and requiring attention until it reaches a completed state.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1a6d2b4dfba56c59d6031c54f98c4bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6eb4f09fefa949d587a5e642781696d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-547df427edfa0cf69235c98193d66896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba82b9a69370aab03745d339c225f5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4e01656ce29019cf97a36acd572183b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89d2648e975a4036194dd794a0bdc8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871d601ea0724a2ba77ac39328982ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551cd7a3c3a18c71567a82d1cab9e0c5</data>
