<node id="Action Item Document">
  <data key="d0">Action Item Document</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Action Item Document is a primary document that details a specific task or required change. It serves as the source and comprehensive description for an action item, containing its full details and associated metadata.

This document is consistently a Markdown file (`.md`) and is specifically located within the `KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/` directory. Its unique file path and name are used to identify the document that contains the action item's content and metadata.

Examples of specific Action Item Documents include `KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-17-Push-V3-experiment-code--results-to-GitHub.md`, `KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-22-Increase-compaction-buffer-in-config.md`, and `KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-16-Iterate-paper-until-score--8-using-paperreviewai.md`. These documents describe various tasks, such as pushing experiment code and results, increasing a compaction buffer in a configuration, or iterating on a paper. Other documented action items might include tasks like 'Upload all PDFs + .tex to Google Drive' or those pertaining to a 'v8 update'.&lt;SEP&gt;The markdown document that stores the details of the action item regarding the knowledge graph extraction script timeout.&lt;SEP&gt;A document providing details for an action item, including its metadata and a summary of a related work session.&lt;SEP&gt;The file located at "KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-23-real-name.md" that serves as the primary document for the action item.&lt;SEP&gt;A document identified as an action item, with the source path `KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-18-NL-parserexplainer-quantitative-evaluation-needs-actual-LLM-API-calls--clinician.md`.&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Item Document is the markdown file where the action item details are recorded, located at KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-23-Hospital_001-Hospital_002-NAT-style-mapping.md.&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Item Document is the file named "KnowledgeGraph/Action-Items/2026-02-17-Address-OpenClaw-Web-UI-access-Tailscale-or-SSH-tunnel.md" from which the information about the action item originates.</data>
