<node id="Open">
  <data key="d0">Open</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">"Open" is a designated status or data value primarily used to describe the current state of an action item. This status consistently signifies that an action item is active, unresolved, and not yet completed. It indicates an ongoing and unfulfilled nature, meaning the item requires further work before it can be considered finished and has not yet reached a resolution.

The "Open" status confirms that an action item is currently in progress and awaiting completion. This designation can be applied to various specific action items, such as "Action Item V11," "Improve GitHub Repo Alongside Paper Iterations," "Action Item 129," "Action Item 122," the task to "optimize the extraction script or increase the timeout," "Resubmit Paper v23.1 to CMT," "Help With Facebook Post," and "Action Item 161," consistently denoting their active and unfinished state.&lt;SEP&gt;A status indicating that an action item is active and awaiting completion.</data>
