<node id="Orchestrator">
  <data key="d0">Orchestrator</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Orchestrator is an agent role that operates within the Coding Team or Coding Agent Team, often taking on responsibilities akin to a Tech Lead. This agent is assigned to or utilizes the Opus model and is noted to have four specific working modes, which are further described in the `AGENTS.md` documentation.

The core responsibilities of the Orchestrator include project planning, overall coordination, and the development and management of complex features and architecture. This role is instrumental in managing and coordinating various technical tasks and skills across the development pipeline. Its expertise spans critical areas such as backend patterns, API development, performance profiling, and AI automation workflows.

Additionally, the Orchestrator is responsible for conducting performance analysis, addressing and resolving backend issues, and ensuring the smooth coordination of the entire development pipeline. The role also extends to tasks related to infrastructure and data integration, positioning the Orchestrator as a central component in maintaining a cohesive technical environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bb69ddf92ab1babcdff33347dda2cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a77499fd86767b7b2628b024b4cadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6144f7eea8f9ff2209417a52185401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772911204</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Code-Review">
  <data key="d0">Code-Review</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Code-Review agent is a Senior Engineer using the Opus model, responsible for reviews and security audits.&lt;SEP&gt;The Code-Review agent is responsible for quality audits and security within the Coding Agent Team.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for Bug Analysis, Code Quality, Security, and code review in the Development Pipeline.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent role focused on reviewing code for quality, security, and multi-model verification.&lt;SEP&gt;The Code-Review agent is an agent in the Coding Team that uses the Opus model.&lt;SEP&gt;Code-Review is a role within the coding team, assigned to Opus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bb69ddf92ab1babcdff33347dda2cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a77499fd86767b7b2628b024b4cadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772911201</data>
