</node>
<node id="PR-Agent">
  <data key="d0">PR-Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The PR-Agent is a DevOps agent using the Sonnet model, responsible for Git operations, PRs, and merges.&lt;SEP&gt;The PR-Agent is an agent within the Coding Agent Team responsible for Git and Pull Request workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;PR-Agent is an agent role within the Coding Team.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d5c4c8de43b11d9e06621d8f9f7a46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebea4e6d0303f5cfa3e72df0eb20ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d</data>
