<node id="Testing">
  <data key="d0">Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Testing agent is a QA Engineer using the Sonnet model, responsible for tests and coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Testing agent is responsible for test strategy and coverage within the Coding Agent Team.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for Test Coverage Analysis, adding coverage, and ensuring test quality.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent role focused on ensuring software quality through various testing methodologies like E2E testing and load testing.&lt;SEP&gt;An instructional topic for Weeks 6-15.</data>
