<node id="Paper-Architect">
  <data key="d0">Paper-Architect</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Paper-Architect acts as the Principal Investigator, responsible for research design, coordination, and quality control within the Academic Paper Team.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for tasks like pre-submission ArXiv checks and research planning.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper-architect is an agent responsible for orchestrating the full paper production process and creating the research plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Paper-Architect is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool used to spawn the initial draft (v1) of the NCD-CIE Paper.&lt;SEP&gt;The Paper-Architect is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Opus model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42dbcaaa04c776c9a79e4a0a86e4077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eedf5e93d60ec2ab2ee6bc42ed024f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
