  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Literature-Lead specializes in systematic review, gap analysis, and citation mining for academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for various literature-related tasks, including systematic reviews, broad paper searches, citation analysis, and background research.&lt;SEP&gt;The literature-lead is an agent responsible for conducting systematic literature reviews and validating citations.&lt;SEP&gt;Literature-Lead is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Literature-Lead is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Opus model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7540722cdec2c35b0cf85a5979b43057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4963b2d8ec653ae9e2dcd186e35e2f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42dbcaaa04c776c9a79e4a0a86e4077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
