  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Format-Editor ensures journal compliance, correct citation formatting, and adherence to style guides for academic papers.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for PDF compilation and format compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The format-editor is an agent responsible for ensuring the paper adheres to journal formatting specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Format-Editor is an agent role within the Academic Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Format-Editor is an agent in the Academic Team that uses the Sonnet model.</data>
