  <data key="d2">An agent within the Writing Agent Team responsible for claim verification and accuracy, characterized as suspicious and thorough.&lt;SEP&gt;A verification engine and skeptic who trusts nothing until confirmed, characterized by being suspicious and thorough. Their philosophy states that one false fact destroys credibility and accuracy is non-negotiable.&lt;SEP&gt;Fact-Checker is an agent role that verifies claims using content-quality-auditor and literature-search skills.&lt;SEP&gt;Fact-Checker is a new agent role added to the Writing Team.</data>
