<node id="Video Script Writer">
  <data key="d0">Video Script Writer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An agent who develops scripts for video lectures and generates corresponding subtitles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Video Script Writer is an agent acting as the video content creator, focused on video, who writes scripts that engage viewers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Video Script Writer is a video content creator, responsible for writing engaging scripts that are conversational and designed for auditory consumption, focusing on intimate communication rather than lectures.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent who creates scripts for video content within courses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1181d963a880af4fc1ead60c67244dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09234e6228d29bf9ae99e525dd6ebee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-331205c13dd064d845add8405c985ef4</data>
