<node id="Lab Designer">
  <data key="d0">Lab Designer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An agent responsible for creating interactive lab experiences and designing their user interface.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lab Designer is an agent focused on interactive labs and hands-on experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lab Designer is a hands-on learning specialist who creates interactive experiences that build skills through practice, designing labs where learning becomes real.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent specialized in designing interactive laboratory exercises.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1181d963a880af4fc1ead60c67244dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09234e6228d29bf9ae99e525dd6ebee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-331205c13dd064d845add8405c985ef4</data>
