  <data key="d0">Accessibility Checker</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An agent tasked with auditing and scoring the quality of course content.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accessibility Checker is an agent focused on accessibility and A11y compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accessibility Checker is an accessibility advocate whose role is to ensure all course materials are usable and accessible for all learners, operating on the philosophy that accessible design benefits everyone.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent responsible for performing accessibility checks on course materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1181d963a880af4fc1ead60c67244dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09234e6228d29bf9ae99e525dd6ebee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0262ced9e14cc732b2e81815f101cb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-331205c13dd064d845add8405c985ef4</data>
