<node id="HA Thailand Standards v6 (2026-2030)">
  <data key="d0">HA Thailand Standards v6 (2026-2030)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The sixth version of healthcare standards for Thailand, effective from 2026 to 2030, covering various aspects of hospital and healthcare services.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare standards for Thailand, covering the period 2026-2030, with 4 parts and new inclusions.&lt;SEP&gt;HA Thailand Standards v6 (2026-2030) is a document stored as a PDF and full text, outlining standards with four main parts: I-OrgMgmt, II-KeySystems, III-PatientCare, and IV-Results, including new sections on Digital Care, InfoSec/PDPA, sustainability, and critical care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-132c6fc6e294620b0ff5157fe1165b60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f92681cbc13202ffab87956e20912b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-333094d57c54def874daab5cee50712c</data>
