<node id="Smart HAI Dashboard Project">
  <data key="d0">Smart HAI Dashboard Project</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Smart HAI Dashboard Project is an initiative specifically focused on the development, creation, and implementation of smart Human-AI Interaction (HAI) dashboards. This project centered on generating complex dashboards, with a notable emphasis on creating approximately 30 such dashboards designed for Smart HAI applications. It is also referred to as focusing on High-level AI dashboards.

A key output of the Smart HAI Dashboard Project was the production of the "Complex Dashboards Report (v1)," also known as the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)," which details findings and progress related to these complex dashboard creations. The initiative also involved the broader generation of reports and the mapping of dashboards to data tables across various domains. The project was mentioned in the daily log for 2026-03-06.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a7df3853cff31dc6e6b38e8ad17a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff7e5c1e27b82737e07d089640954be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2353a796b95378bd746791c5f2c7d9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8270574e44b03ea8ed7c1278a937889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2783c6770b9ae6331dd8f5b93766740a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eaa73eb4a62a4890bee8afe45083cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
