</node>
<node id="30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)">
  <data key="d0">30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1) represents the initial or first version of a comprehensive report. This document provides detailed insights into 30 complex dashboards, which are structured across 5 distinct domains and meticulously mapped to 83 Data Warehouse (DW) tables. Generated within the context of the Smart HAI Dashboard Project, the report is specifically identified by the filename `HA_30_Complex_Dashboards.docx`.&lt;SEP&gt;The first version of a report generated for the Smart HAI Dashboard Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The first version of a report generated for the Smart HAI Dashboard Project, detailing 30 complex dashboards.&lt;SEP&gt;The 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1) is the first version of a report generated, detailing dashboards mapped to DW tables.&lt;SEP&gt;The first version of a report documenting 30 complex dashboards, generated by the Smart HAI Dashboard Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The first version of a report generated for the Smart HAI Dashboard Project, detailing 30 dashboards mapped across 5 domains to 83 DW tables.&lt;SEP&gt;The first version of a report detailing 30 dashboards mapped to 83 DW tables across 5 domains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a7df3853cff31dc6e6b38e8ad17a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff7e5c1e27b82737e07d089640954be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2353a796b95378bd746791c5f2c7d9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8270574e44b03ea8ed7c1278a937889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2783c6770b9ae6331dd8f5b93766740a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eaa73eb4a62a4890bee8afe45083cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
