  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">HA_30_Complex_Dashboards.docx is identified as a specific document file. This file serves as the name and representation for the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)."

This entity is a generated Microsoft Word document, characterized by its DOCX format. It specifically embodies the first version of the "30 Complex Dashboards Report," and contains the complete content of this comprehensive report.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific document file for the 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1).&lt;SEP&gt;HA_30_Complex_Dashboards.docx is the specific document file for the 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1).&lt;SEP&gt;The specific DOCX file that serves as the document for the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)".&lt;SEP&gt;The specific document file that contains the 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1).&lt;SEP&gt;A document file representing the first version of the 30 Complex Dashboards Report.</data>
