  <data key="d0">Complex Dashboards</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A person whose knowledge graph entry documents interactions, specifically related to the generation of a report on March 6, 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual whose activities are documented, including generating a dashboard report and creating course materials.</data>
