<node id="Complex Dashboards Report (v1)">
  <data key="d0">Complex Dashboards Report (v1)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The first version of a report generated on March 6, 2026, detailing the mapping of 5 domains and 30 dashboards to 83 DW tables.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772823992</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="5 Domains">
  <data key="d0">5 Domains</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">5 Domains refers to a specific set of five distinct areas, categories, or conceptual subject matters. These domains serve as a structural characteristic, providing a comprehensive scope for the "Complex Dashboards Report (v1)," which is also known as the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)."

Within this report, a total of 30 individual dashboards are mapped across these five conceptual areas. This mapping is central to the report, as it defines its organizational structure and highlights the breadth of topics addressed by the included dashboards. Essentially, 5 Domains represent the key categories or areas across which the content of these 30 dashboards is organized and presented, acting as a quantitative attribute specifying the number of domains covered by the report.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2353a796b95378bd746791c5f2c7d9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8270574e44b03ea8ed7c1278a937889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eaa73eb4a62a4890bee8afe45083cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772911076</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="30 Dashboards">
  <data key="d0">30 Dashboards</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">30 Dashboards refers to a specific collection or quantity of thirty distinct dashboards. These dashboards are characterized as specific interfaces or displays designed to present data.

The existence and details of these 30 Dashboards are consistently outlined, described, referenced, and detailed within a particular report. This report is variously identified as the 'Complex Dashboards Report (v1)' or the '30 Complex Dashboards Report'. A key aspect of these dashboards is their mapping: they are explicitly mapped to Data Warehouse (DW) tables, sometimes specified as 'data warehouse tables'.&lt;SEP&gt;A quantitative attribute specifying the number of dashboards mapped within the 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1).&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of 30 visual data displays that are mapped to Data Warehouse tables across 5 domains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772911072</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="83 DW Tables">
  <data key="d0">83 DW Tables</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">83 DW Tables refers to a specific collection of eighty-three Data Warehouse tables. These tables are notable because dashboards are mapped to them as their underlying data source. Specifically, a set of 30 dashboards are mapped to these 83 Data Warehouse tables. These dashboards are often referenced within reports such as the "Complex Dashboards Report (v1)" or the "30 Complex Dashboards Report," highlighting the tables' role in supporting the data requirements for these particular dashboards.&lt;SEP&gt;The number of Data Warehouse tables to which 30 dashboards are mapped in the report.&lt;SEP&gt;The number of Data Warehouse tables to which the 30 complex dashboards are mapped.&lt;SEP&gt;The number of Data Warehouse tables to which 30 dashboards are mapped.&lt;SEP&gt;83 DW Tables are data warehouse tables to which the dashboards are mapped.&lt;SEP&gt;A quantitative attribute specifying the number of Data Warehouse tables to which dashboards are mapped in the 30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1).&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of 83 Data Warehouse tables to which 30 dashboards are mapped.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2353a796b95378bd746791c5f2c7d9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8270574e44b03ea8ed7c1278a937889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eaa73eb4a62a4890bee8afe45083cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74eca8838949c0c81b6ab843b20765ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772911072</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GDrive">
  <data key="d0">GDrive</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GDrive, also commonly referred to as Google Drive, is a comprehensive cloud storage and document management service provided by Google. It operates as an online and digital platform designed for storing and managing various types of files and documents.

This service is noted for its cloud-based storage and file synchronization capabilities, making it a central repository for project-related content. Specifically, the document `HA_30_Complex_Dashboards.docx` is consistently identified as being stored, located, or hosted on the Google Drive platform, alongside other general project documents and report documents.&lt;SEP&gt;A cloud-based file storage and synchronization service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83ff44d971b52ca476564e78e582061c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ed154824a7605cfecdd0a9c40956db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704b359100affdf9c88d72bae150dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43eab0fa420088ff612a86170aacc6ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38</data>
