  <data key="d0">Knuth "Claude's Cycles"</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The specific topic or title of course materials delivered, related to human-AI collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific topic or title of the course for which materials were delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;The title of a course or educational program.&lt;SEP&gt;Knuth "Claude's Cycles" refers to course materials that were delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific title or theme for the course materials delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;The name of a course or project for which educational materials were developed and delivered.</data>
