<node id="DevOps/VibeCoding Course">
  <data key="d0">DevOps/VibeCoding Course</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The DevOps/VibeCoding Course is an educational program dedicated to the subjects of DevOps and VibeCoding. For this course, specific and comprehensive course materials were conceptualized, prepared, and subsequently delivered to participants.

A significant aspect of the course's content includes materials known as "Knuth 'Claude's Cycles'". These "Knuth 'Claude's Cycles'" course materials, which include a PPTX presentation and a Handout PDF, were specially developed, created, and delivered as integral components of the DevOps/VibeCoding Course. This establishes the DevOps/VibeCoding Course as the primary educational context for which the "Knuth 'Claude's Cycles'" materials were produced.&lt;SEP&gt;A course specializing in DevOps and VibeCoding methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific type of course for which the Knuth "Claude's Cycles" materials were developed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d2219ae3e3b6a7be08c8d123696a8721&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2783c6770b9ae6331dd8f5b93766740a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eaa73eb4a62a4890bee8afe45083cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-694c9f5d0097703ad5caebf14f1e84e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc701838f07233735cb275776b21683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0cae111bc18b0ebaaa6df5d87f76411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8b1deea3137e75a167475d367ac5674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2cdd5ff3d5c08c4f1f51c769710ea9</data>
