<edge source="Anirach" target="Arthur">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Anirach and Arthur describes Anirach's interaction with Arthur, who is an AI assistant. Arthur provides assistance to Anirach and works with Anirach, notably in conjunction with OpenClaw. Anirach has expressed being impressed by Arthur's ability to upgrade its "brain" mid-conversation. Driven by curiosity, Anirach once inquired of Arthur, "Can I reset your soul and memory?" Despite this question, Anirach is content with Arthur remaining in its present state.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI Assistant, provides assistance to Anirach.</data>
  <data key="d9">assistant,assists,collaboration,curiosity,impression,performance,query,satisfaction,status quo,support,usage,works with</data>
