<edge source="Anirach" target="Google Calendar Integration">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Anirach, Google Calendar Integration) describes the establishment of a connection between Anirach and Google Calendar. This integration was successfully set up as a project, enabling synchronization or interaction between the two systems for Anirach.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Calendar integration was set up for Anirach.&lt;SEP&gt;The Google Calendar Integration was successfully set up for Anirach.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Calendar integration was successfully set up for Anirach.</data>
