<edge source="Anirach" target="Topic Index">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Anirach, Topic Index)" describes a functional connection where the "Topic Index" serves as a dedicated system for monitoring discussion topics related to Anirach. This index is comprehensively utilized to track all discussion topics that involve Anirach. Furthermore, Anirach actively uses the Topic Index to manage and engage with all the subjects enumerated within it.</data>
