<edge source="RAG Second Brain Paper" target="AIiH 2026">
  <data key="d7">25.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between AIiH 2026 and the RAG Second Brain Paper describes the status of an academic submission and its intended dissemination. The "RAG Second Brain Paper," specifically identified as version v23.1, has been formally submitted to AIiH 2026.

AIiH 2026 is targeted as the designated venue for this paper. The RAG Second Brain Paper is consequently planned for both presentation and publication at AIiH 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;The RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted to AIiH 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;The RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted to AIiH 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;The RAG Second Brain Paper was submitted to AIiH 2026.</data>
