<edge source="RAG Second Brain Paper" target="Multi-Source RAG Framework">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the "Multi-Source RAG Framework" and the "RAG Second Brain Paper" is defined by the latter proposing and describing the former. The "RAG Second Brain Paper" introduces the "Multi-Source RAG Framework," presenting its concept and detailing its structure or methodology. This indicates that the framework is a key contribution or subject of the specified paper.</data>
