<edge source="OpenClaw" target="Arthur">
  <data key="d7">21.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Arthur, OpenClaw) describes the operational dependency of Arthur on OpenClaw. Arthur is consistently identified as an AI agent that functions by running on or operating using the OpenClaw system, which is also referred to as a platform. This relationship signifies that Arthur's operations are fundamentally reliant on OpenClaw.

In a broader context, the OpenClaw platform is utilized by Anirach, specifically in conjunction with Arthur. Furthermore, Arthur's inaugural day of operation took place on OpenClaw, indicating the platform's foundational role in Arthur's functional history.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, operates on the OpenClaw platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, operates on the OpenClaw platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, the AI agent, operates on the OpenClaw platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, operates on the OpenClaw platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, runs on the OpenClaw platform.</data>
  <data key="d9">begins operation,integration,new system,operates on,operation,operational platform,pairing,platform,platform dependency,powered by,runs on,runs_on,technology,technology stack</data>
