  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">OpenClaw was previously named Clawdbot as part of its rebrand history.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw was updated from and replaced the package previously known as Clawdbot.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw was updated from Clawdbot, and its package name changed from Clawdbot.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw was previously known as Clawdbot as part of its rebranding history.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw was previously known or updated from Clawdbot.</data>
