<edge source="OpenClaw" target="Moltbot">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Moltbot and OpenClaw is defined by a significant rebranding event in the history of a software entity. Moltbot served as the prior name for the software, which was subsequently rebranded and renamed OpenClaw.

This rebranding initiative was driven by the need to address specific trademark issues and to implement security hardening measures. Therefore, OpenClaw is the current iteration of the software that was formerly known as Moltbot, reflecting a deliberate change in its identity as part of its ongoing development and software history.&lt;SEP&gt;Moltbot was rebranded to OpenClaw in the software's history.&lt;SEP&gt;Moltbot was rebranded to OpenClaw.</data>
  <data key="d9">evolution,history,name change,predecessor,previous name,previous version,rebranded to,rebranding,rebranding sequence,software evolution</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f03d87d29d168bf712ab2a573dc369b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-214eb95bbeefec9c60503afe48c2e638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d20e1a818b86a3a5146ae93eab559dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0494f9964c512c3bd5182e3d233fba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8958041a8e38ef2d5adde44b86d37b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be1a879a09130cca84364cf74d7544cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691dc72e802a20ddfbc11e2793cf4e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f87202506d912406b3336864391a105</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772610045</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
