  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Trademark issues influenced the rebranding of software to OpenClaw.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw's rebranding was partly due to trademark issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Trademark issues were a reason for the rebranding history that culminated in OpenClaw.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenClaw's rebrand history mentions trademark issues as a factor.&lt;SEP&gt;Trademark Issues influenced the rebranding of Moltbot to OpenClaw.</data>
