<edge source="Arthur" target="Arthur's Daily Notes">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Arthur, Arthur's Daily Notes) delineates Arthur's comprehensive involvement with a collection of documents known as "Arthur's Daily Notes." Arthur is established as the primary author, creator, and maintainer of these notes, actively generating and recording their content. The core function of "Arthur's Daily Notes" is to systematically document Arthur's daily activities. Crucially, Arthur is not only the originator of these notes but also their central subject, meaning the content within "Arthur's Daily Notes" revolves around Arthur himself.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur is the subject of Arthur's Daily Notes.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur is the subject of Arthur's Daily Notes.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur is the subject of Arthur's Daily Notes.</data>
