<edge source="Arthur" target="Anirach Mingkhwan">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation `(Anirach Mingkhwan, Arthur)` defines a scenario where Arthur provides assistance to Anirach Mingkhwan. This fundamental dynamic highlights Arthur's active role in supporting Anirach Mingkhwan.

Further descriptions consistently clarify the nature of Arthur, identifying this entity as an AI agent or an AI assistant. Therefore, the assistance provided to Anirach Mingkhwan is understood to originate from an artificial intelligence, underscoring the specific type of support involved in this relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, provides assistance to Anirach Mingkhwan.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent, assists Anirach Mingkhwan.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, an AI agent and AI Assistant, assists Anirach Mingkhwan.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur assists Anirach Mingkhwan.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur, the AI agent, provides assistance to Anirach Mingkhwan.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthur assists Anirach Mingkhwan.</data>
