<edge source="Healthcare AI" target="AI Applications In Medical Diagnostics And Treatment">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Healthcare AI, which refers to AI Applications In Medical Diagnostics And Treatment, is a field primarily focused on the application of artificial intelligence technologies within the domains of medical diagnostics and treatment. This area is consistently described as encompassing and being defined by the various uses of AI to support and enhance both the diagnostic processes and the therapeutic interventions in medical settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare AI includes AI Applications in Medical Diagnostics and Treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Applications In Medical Diagnostics And Treatment are topics within Healthcare AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare AI focuses on AI applications in medical diagnostics and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare AI is focused on AI Applications In Medical Diagnostics And Treatment.</data>
