<edge source="Knowledge Graph" target="Knowledge Graph Index">
  <data key="d7">29.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Knowledge Graph Index is a core, auto-generated component that resides within the broader Knowledge Graph system. It serves primarily as an index for the Knowledge Graph, offering a comprehensive overview of its contents and structure.

This component provides detailed information about the Knowledge Graph itself. It plays a crucial role in facilitating the categorization of entities present within the broader Knowledge Graph, thereby enhancing the navigability and overall understanding of the Knowledge Graph's content.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,contains,describes,index,index of,indexes,organization,overview,part of,pertains to,provides overview,provides overview of,summarizes,summary</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0e1255b938172ca134381d029ccfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6624021287f55bbd038a25dfb41ea597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b781e3e1d8f6931cf3aac3e89a4627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d9ec198ae427665d14d305ed714134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f197e592637ef1737a9a8857200343b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa47b70626d922608669a39522b369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d5be9af31c8385a55b4042062e087f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b071a5fec4e97aacc433874a4084760</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772911007</data>
