  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The entity "First Novel, Knowledge Graph" describes "First Novel" as an entity within the broader concept of a Knowledge Graph. It is consistently categorized as an entity that exists within or is encompassed by a Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The "First Novel" is an entity within the broader concept of the Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;First Novel is an entity categorized within a Knowledge Graph.</data>
  <data key="d9">association,categorization,entity in,part of</data>
