<edge source="Knowledge Graph" target="Decision">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between a Decision and a Knowledge Graph indicates that a specific decision or decision document is formally associated with the concept of a Knowledge Graph. This relationship is consistently described as the decision being tagged, categorized, or otherwise linked to a Knowledge Graph.

Specifically, the decision is identified as related to, associated with, or categorized under the "Knowledge Graph" concept. This connection is often manifested through the application of tags such as "knowledge-graph" or by placing the decision document within a designated Knowledge Graph category.</data>
