<edge source="Knowledge Graph" target="Action Item">
  <data key="d7">53.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Action Item, Knowledge Graph)" signifies a direct and clear association where an Action Item is systematically connected to the concept or operational framework of a Knowledge Graph. This relationship establishes that a specific Action Item is classified, categorized, marked, or explicitly associated within the context of a Knowledge Graph system or its domain.

The primary mechanism for this connection is tagging. An Action Item is explicitly tagged as being related to, or belonging to, the Knowledge Graph domain, system, or concept. This implies that Action Items are considered entities that either fall within, are tracked as part of, or are directly pertinent to a Knowledge Graph's scope. The tagging itself can manifest in various forms, such as the explicit phrase "Knowledge Graph" (which may appear with or without single or double quotes), or as a hyphenated form like "knowledge-graph." All these variations uniformly indicate the Action Item's association with the overarching Knowledge Graph concept or category. Furthermore, an Action Item's source path may also indicate its inclusion as part of a Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Item is associated with the concept of a Knowledge Graph through its tags.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item is categorized or associated with the concept of a Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item is tagged with "knowledge-graph".</data>
  <data key="d9">associated with,associated_with,association,belongs to,categorization,categorized as,categorized by,categorized under,categorizes,category,classification,context,domain,is tagged with,related to,relation,tag,tagged,tagged as,tagged concept,tagged with,tagging,topic</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4921daf2164de8d78817ea40ef7438fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191ee41271401232e9471f34a4c06719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac51671082e2e50bfc5526f58ef427c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7894f489c85dbb132a2803b749a02ca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef9b92487c0eb97be37bbcd945c00f5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf907c5e36499f7a4ccbff7a18a5031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d4a03820cfb4e612754c64db8aa7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6eb4f09fefa949d587a5e642781696d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f9c416cabc71161b7cb94568b677f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfca51e677015e2359e2c533733b33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-547df427edfa0cf69235c98193d66896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-117a01998ed6bd453ae3b3bd5c075ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c81a1607b189e4dccda6f296a585133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba754fb7a934f88d986d68a77c5aedf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dae925b6e333f6ad49e74fff691b321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-959cc787ebf7ba849ceed8fc31031862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c4c3af39228dfc818ea14fb6d2b998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acebf29512b1f172151cb83a3d9c8d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dd82473e60ee409e79c432ae7e88f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e527b91e6a9ad23487f23991185d3899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14eec4ba21399e018e3f0aacefcb6f3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df99b484480e6f1c06f107219c0b867&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f457bf4459ca0434313252cd91de7709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e25ce8b34a0336b469e6f8e4f36694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d896c5d978b2724ee0e163f02c45de7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e27a41e07f2a1a24017c7da0aad718b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebb4347b4c265fb1a8a24b5ff8611dbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de47617ba23e1c5187fa506f9810eb4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1442862b96b3d5c9f6c0a383b69f83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb523eb64da5cc78b32fcd2b4b4df26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a667a400dc093dec5aeac02a341e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed97bca06c7f4723df0597a679b6d4f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0917bc2cce4333b4739e38697a76e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871d601ea0724a2ba77ac39328982ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c92a8f30822839f07bf8caf80a3945e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ae8eebcb1b490d870ca0689f9404763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33488833b7907af8855976c04d1a45b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa5069970cf95b21c56dfd10076d0c0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88bf8df4772c8cb6a5b135c492da5a82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42b7afbefee15f7ec80afb1bf6ff4c56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62ea5e131e305f30