<edge source="Obsidian" target="Knowledge Graph Index">
  <data key="d7">41.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Knowledge Graph Index and Obsidian defines Obsidian's foundational role as the comprehensive platform, host system, and primary source for the Knowledge Graph Index. Obsidian functions as the central knowledge management system, responsible for both the initial creation and the continuous oversight of this index.

The Knowledge Graph Index itself is an auto-generated component that operates exclusively within the Obsidian environment. It is directly generated from the Obsidian system and is stored as a markdown file. This index is entirely managed, maintained, and stored within Obsidian, reinforcing Obsidian's integral function as its sole origin and operational context.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsidian is the system that auto-generates the Knowledge Graph Index.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is sourced from Obsidian.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is generated from a source related to Obsidian.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsidian is the source system that provides the Knowledge Graph Index.</data>
