  <data key="d8">The relation between KnowledgeGraph/_index.md and Obsidian indicates that `KnowledgeGraph/_index.md` is a file that exists within the Obsidian system. Specifically, it is described as a markdown file or file path that is located, managed, hosted, and maintained by Obsidian.

