<edge source="LobsterBoard" target="Server">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation `(LobsterBoard, Server)` indicates that LobsterBoard is installed on a server. This relationship describes both the initial setup and the ongoing operational state of the software. Specifically, the LobsterBoard dashboard, a key component, was installed on a server. Consequently, LobsterBoard is hosted on a server, ensuring its active functionality and accessibility for users.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard software is installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard software was installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard was installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard software is installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard software is installed on a server.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard software is installed on a server.</data>
