<edge source="LobsterBoard" target="Curbob">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Curbob and LobsterBoard signifies that Curbob is the developer and creator of the LobsterBoard software project. LobsterBoard is consistently associated with Curbob, particularly through its GitHub repository. This connection highlights that Curbob developed the LobsterBoard software, with the GitHub repository serving as a key point of association and ongoing involvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Curbob developed LobsterBoard, as indicated by the GitHub repository URL.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard's GitHub repository is associated with Curbob.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard was developed by Curbob.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard's GitHub repository is associated with Curbob.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard's GitHub repository is associated with Curbob.&lt;SEP&gt;LobsterBoard's GitHub repository is associated with Curbob.</data>
