<edge source="Opus Model" target="UX/UI Designer Agent">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Opus Model and the UX/UI Designer Agent indicates a foundational and operational dependency. The UX/UI Designer Agent is consistently described as being based on, or utilizing, the Opus Model. This implies that the Opus Model serves as the underlying framework, architecture, or core technology that powers the UX/UI Designer Agent's functionality and operations.

Therefore, the UX/UI Designer Agent leverages the Opus Model as its primary operational and foundational component.</data>
