<edge source="Writing Team" target="First Novel">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">First Novel created a 6-agent professional writing team as a major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;First Novel created a 6-agent professional writing team as a major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;First Novel created a 6-agent professional writing team as a major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;First Novel created a 6-agent professional writing team as a major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;First Novel created a 6-agent professional writing team as a major accomplishment.</data>
