<edge source="Writing Team" target="Book-Architect">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Book-Architect, Writing Team) defines the structural composition of a writing collaborative. The Book-Architect is identified as an agent who is an integral member of the Writing Team. Conversely, the Writing Team is consistently described as comprising, including, or consisting of a Book-Architect, affirming that this agent role is a fundamental component of the team's structure.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Book-Architect.&lt;SEP&gt;The Book-Architect is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Book-Architect is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Book-Architect.&lt;SEP&gt;The Book-Architect is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Book-Architect.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,includes,member,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910668</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Research-Lead">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Research-Lead, Writing Team) describes a direct compositional and membership relationship between an agent and a collective body. In this defined structure, the Research-Lead is identified as an agent who is an integral member of the Writing Team. Conversely, the Writing Team is consistently understood to comprise, include, and consist of a Research-Lead agent as one of its key components. This indicates that the Research-Lead is a constituent part of the Writing Team's personnel and overall composition.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Research-Lead.&lt;SEP&gt;The Research-Lead is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Research-Lead is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Research-Lead.&lt;SEP&gt;The Research-Lead is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Research-Lead.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,includes,member,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910668</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Chapter-Writer">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between a Chapter-Writer and a Writing Team describes a fundamental structural and functional association. A Chapter-Writer is identified as an agent who is an integral and essential member of the larger entity, the Writing Team, underscoring their crucial role in the team's composition.

Conversely, the Writing Team is defined as comprising, including, and consisting of a Chapter-Writer agent. Functionally, the Chapter-Writer performs specific tasks for the Writing Team and operates under its direct guidance, direction, and oversight, highlighting both the collaborative and supervised aspects of this relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Chapter-Writer.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent,agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,employs,includes,member,oversees,performs tasks for,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e967df27452deff8d725b325aa563ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2d7eca9e5caaa2ebab4c11d5b308eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910669</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Dev-Editor">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Dev-Editor, Writing Team) describes a direct membership and compositional link between a Dev-Editor and a Writing Team. In this relationship, the Dev-Editor functions as an agent and is explicitly identified as a member of the Writing Team, often fulfilling a specific role within it.

Conversely, the Writing Team is characterized as an entity that comprises, includes, and consists of a Dev-Editor. This signifies that the Dev-Editor is an integral part of the Writing Team's composition, serving as one of its agents or members.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Dev-Editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dev-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dev-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Dev-Editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dev-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Dev-Editor.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,includes,member,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910669</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Copy-Editor">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between a Copy-Editor and a Writing Team signifies an organizational and functional connection. A Copy-Editor is defined as an agent who holds membership within a Writing Team. This indicates that the Copy-Editor is an active individual contributing to the team's efforts.

Conversely, the Writing Team is characterized by its composition, which includes the Copy-Editor. This means the role of a Copy-Editor is a constituent part of the Writing Team, demonstrating that the team comprises, includes, or consists of this specific agent. Therefore, the Copy-Editor is an essential agent integrated into the structure and operation of the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Copy-Editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Copy-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Copy-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Copy-Editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Copy-Editor is an agent and a member of the writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team comprises a Copy-Editor.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,includes,member,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910670</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Publisher">
  <data key="d7">22.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Publisher, Writing Team)" describes a fundamental connection where a Publisher is an integral component and member of a Writing Team. In this context, the Publisher consistently functions as an agent within the team's structure. The Writing Team invariably includes, comprises, and is composed of a Publisher, highlighting that the Publisher holds a specific role or acts as one of its essential agents.</data>
  <data key="d9">agent role,composition,comprises,consists of,includes,includes role,member,role,team composition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff7e841b0e01ffce5ef55c819c75a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a68fc9c7479f5ca8f832d201f36644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa3eb63b70351ba692b01c713f5ea165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c15de56039236682f9856e47cab92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37056b34934d569bff0b96c6e8991103</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
