  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Workspaces">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Workspaces and the Writing Team indicates that workspaces are specifically created and allocated for the agents of the Writing Team. These workspaces are dedicated resources that the Writing Team, through its agents, utilizes for its operations. The agents of the Writing Team actively use these established workspaces to carry out their tasks and activities.</data>
  <data key="d9">allocation,contains,operates within,support,uses,utilizes</data>
