</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Opus">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Opus is a model allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Opus model is allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a model allocated for thinking tasks within the context of the Writing Team's operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a model allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a model allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a model allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus is a model allocated for the thinking processes of the Writing Team.</data>
