<edge source="Writing Team" target="Major Accomplishments">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Major Accomplishments, Writing Team) denotes a significant achievement centered on the establishment of a professional writing team. This major accomplishment specifically involved the creation and setup of a 6-agent professional writing team. The successful formation and operationalization of this team is consistently recognized and listed as a key major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Accomplishments created and set up a 6-agent professional writing team.&lt;SEP&gt;The creation of the Writing Team is listed as a major accomplishment.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Accomplishments created and set up a 6-agent professional writing team.</data>
  <data key="d9">achievement,categorization,created,includes,setup</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-481427393c6695a98dde842249c71ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32dc00afb723b10d3141d9f4653b224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa3eb63b70351ba692b01c713f5ea165</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910667</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Writing Team Setup">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Writing Team and its Writing Team Setup describes the foundational event or process through which the Writing Team was brought into existence. The Writing Team Setup specifically refers to the creation and establishment of the Writing Team. This setup initiative involved and ultimately led to the formation of a 6-agent professional Writing Team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Writing Team was created as part of the Writing Team Setup.</data>
  <data key="d9">created,creation,established,establishment,formed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9ff7e841b0e01ffce5ef55c819c75a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0f96b3cab53fea5f500f4f1083e5008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a68fc9c7479f5ca8f832d201f36644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ac079dcb226ab3679810b297930c3b</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910512</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Book Architect">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Book Architect, Writing Team)" describes a structural component of a Writing Team, indicating that it either includes or is composed of a Book Architect. Within this context, the Book Architect functions as a designated role or is represented by a Book Architect agent. This signifies that the Book Architect is an integral part of the Writing Team.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,comprises,includes role,role</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9ff7e841b0e01ffce5ef55c819c75a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a68fc9c7479f5ca8f832d201f36644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa3eb63b70351ba692b01c713f5ea165</data>
