  <data key="d12">1772910516</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Research Lead">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Research Lead, Writing Team)" signifies a compositional or inclusionary relationship. It indicates that a Research Lead, functioning either as a specific agent or as a defined role, is a constituent element or member of a Writing Team. Therefore, the Writing Team includes or is composed of a Research Lead.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,comprises,includes role,role</data>
