</edge>
<edge source="Writing Team" target="Chapter Writer">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Chapter Writer, Writing Team) defines a structural association where a Chapter Writer is an integral component of a Writing Team. This relationship indicates that a Chapter Writer serves as a specific role or an agent included within the broader composition of the Writing Team.

Fundamentally, the Writing Team encompasses or is composed of a Chapter Writer. This positions the Chapter Writer as a designated member or functional element within the team's organizational framework.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,comprises,includes role,role</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9ff7e841b0e01ffce5ef55c819c75a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a68fc9c7479f5ca8f832d201f36644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fee19755a3251618ba78c3efffeb833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa3eb63b70351ba692b01c713f5ea165</data>
