  <data key="d8">The relation "(Dev Editor, Writing Team)" describes the integral inclusion of a Dev Editor within a Writing Team. Specifically, the Writing Team either incorporates, is composed of, or includes a Dev Editor. This Dev Editor functions as a defined role within the team's structure and can also be understood as an agent operating as part of the Writing Team.</data>
