<edge source="Knowledge Graph Index" target="Knowledge-Graph Tag">
  <data key="d7">23.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between a Knowledge Graph Index and a Knowledge-Graph Tag describes a fundamental categorization and association mechanism. In this context, the Knowledge Graph Index is consistently associated with, categorized by, or tagged with the "knowledge-graph" tag.

This signifies that the "knowledge-graph" tag serves as a classification or marking tool within a system, directly linking the index to the broader concept of a knowledge graph. Its purpose is to identify and organize the Knowledge Graph Index under the umbrella of knowledge graph-related entities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is associated with the 'knowledge-graph' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is categorized with the 'knowledge-graph' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is tagged with "knowledge-graph".&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is associated with the 'knowledge-graph' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is categorized with the 'knowledge-graph' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is tagged with "knowledge-graph".</data>
  <data key="d9">associated with,categorization,categorized by,classification,describes,has tag,meta-information,metadata,tagged with,tagging</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cfdf2156ab57f335e70ce67a52fd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e61da92e53b06903a4888daeacc373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a448df3934c0032a1a381293f8854d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc1acb7742fd80221f70cc930bc3f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdc26ddbfd5a67ff793d2535ecee5ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2930106fa93d6381998b32a2282a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38</data>
