<edge source="Knowledge Graph Index" target="Index Tag">
  <data key="d7">29.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Index Tag, Knowledge Graph Index) describes a direct and fundamental association between a Knowledge Graph Index and the specific identifier or characteristic referred to as the 'index' tag. This relationship signifies that a Knowledge Graph Index is characterized, categorized, marked, or otherwise intrinsically linked to this 'index' tag.

The 'index' tag serves as a crucial classification or distinguishing feature for the Knowledge Graph Index. It provides a consistent means to group, identify, and understand the nature or purpose of the associated Knowledge Graph Index. Consequently, within this relation, the Knowledge Graph Index is consistently presented as being associated with, categorized by, and tagged with the 'index' tag, reinforcing its definitional connection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is categorized as an 'index' type.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is associated with the 'index' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is categorized with the 'index' tag.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index is tagged with "index".</data>
  <data key="d9">associated with,categorization,categorized by,classification,describes,has tag,meta-information,metadata,tagged with,tagging,type</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-110b96b0a13f8b8ff5b33a4018cb7b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e964fa90440f30528a4e3fa28953961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cfdf2156ab57f335e70ce67a52fd57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244ad908c60805cff7ae65c455d2736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e61da92e53b06903a4888daeacc373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a448df3934c0032a1a381293f8854d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb061fa6be422bbf34b9117831dfcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7793c1816ef50dc976008de6c6e8601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc1acb7742fd80221f70cc930bc3f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdc26ddbfd5a67ff793d2535ecee5ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e6ec241481889525a6482b252d70dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a95213262632488c3ed69d7623db435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2930106fa93d6381998b32a2282a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4425eeb6a909ec03274c53503d906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0393a6415c78258060096629d199fd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3b6500fd86f8b62a0ad06972179e38</data>
