<edge source="Knowledge Graph Index" target="People">
  <data key="d7">22.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Knowledge Graph Index, People)" describes the representation and accounting of the 'People' category within the Knowledge Graph Index. This index serves as a comprehensive overview and summarization tool for its contents, with 'People' being one of its primary categories. The Knowledge Graph Index specifically lists, includes, and tracks the count of entries within the 'People' category.

The Knowledge Graph Index consistently reports that the 'People' category contains 310 entries across numerous observations. However, a single description also indicates that the index summarizes the 'People' category with a count of 319 entries. This difference suggests a potential discrepancy or minor fluctuation in the reported number of entries for the 'People' category over time.</data>
