  <data key="d8">The relation "(Knowledge Graph Index, People Count)" describes a function of the Knowledge Graph Index. This index is designed to provide an overview that specifically includes a count of individuals, often referred to as "People". The Knowledge Graph Index records, presents, and includes this People Count within its overview. Specifically, the observed count for individuals provided by the Knowledge Graph Index is 310 people.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index provides an overview that includes the count of 310 people.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index records the People Count.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index provides a count of "People".</data>
  <data key="d9">categorization,category,contains,includes,measures,metric,overview,tracks</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2930106fa93d6381998b32a2282a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4</data>
