<edge source="Knowledge Graph Index" target="Projects Count">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation **(Knowledge Graph Index, Projects Count)** describes an attribute of the Knowledge Graph Index that pertains to its aggregation and presentation of project figures. This relation establishes that the Knowledge Graph Index records and provides the total Projects Count.

The Knowledge Graph Index offers an overview that includes the count for the "Projects" category, serving to quantify the number of projects tracked or managed within it. Specifically, it provides an overview that includes a count of 127 projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index provides an overview that includes the count of 127 projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index records the Projects Count.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph Index provides a count of "Projects".</data>
  <data key="d9">categorization,category,contains,includes,measures,metric,overview,tracks</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a987e2ef6f4df602844b47725e43fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dd5351820dd106a02e63dc7e87bf6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2930106fa93d6381998b32a2282a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8450374cc104b9afeb7e8355e06627d4</data>
