<edge source="System Optimization Session" target="Memory Search">
  <data key="d7">24.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Memory Search, System Optimization Session)" describes an interaction in which a System Optimization Session specifically addressed and resolved issues concerning Memory Search. During this session, a targeted fix was applied to Memory Search, effectively rectifying problems associated with it.

The System Optimization Session successfully fixed an issue related to Memory Search, leading to its comprehensive resolution. This indicates that the Memory Search component or process was improved and made functional through the efforts undertaken during the optimization session.&lt;SEP&gt;The System Optimization Session successfully fixed an issue related to Memory Search.&lt;SEP&gt;The Memory Search was fixed during the System Optimization Session.</data>
  <data key="d9">addressed,addresses,fix,fix applied,fixed,improved,improvement,involves,performed during,resolved issue</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbddb0cc8f3daa198946451856e988a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48404c33a0cecaca96752c576cc8ff1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ec70c699368a1d1b9b05586b524c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed742b710d4efe2e644f95efb224333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae13fa55ad806299a2566ee6c8b4e8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de88caa5e86668356c547bf8ad59c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e824642b3bf777770bb81a52dbade87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc0b5accf865538247068fa2c8b6f4a</data>
