<edge source="System Optimization Session" target="Daily Notes">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The System Optimization Session is recorded within the Daily Notes for 2026-03-01.&lt;SEP&gt;The System Optimization Session and its details are documented within the Daily Notes.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily Notes document the events of a System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily Notes document the events of a System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily Notes document the events of a System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily Notes document the events of a System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily Notes document the events of a System Optimization Session.</data>
