<edge source="System Optimization Session" target="Daily Notes 2026-03-01">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Daily Notes 2026-03-01, System Optimization Session)" signifies that the "Daily Notes" compiled on March 1st, 2026, document and describe a "System Optimization Session." This indicates a direct relationship where the content of the aforementioned daily notes details the specifics and outcomes of a system optimization event or meeting held on that particular date.&lt;SEP&gt;The Daily Notes for 2026-03-01 document a System Optimization Session.&lt;SEP&gt;The Daily Notes 2026-03-01 describe the System Optimization Session.</data>
