<edge source="System Optimization Session" target="Google Embedding Provider">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between a Google Embedding Provider and a System Optimization Session describes a scenario where the Google Embedding Provider underwent adjustments and fixes during a specific optimization effort. The System Optimization Session primarily focused on applying necessary corrections and configurations to the Google Embedding Provider.

