<edge source="Session Snapshot" target="Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main, Session Snapshot) describes the connection between an "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" session and a "Session Snapshot". In this relationship, a Session Snapshot is taken from, captured by, or associated with the "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" session. The primary function of the Session Snapshot is to document and capture the details and state of the "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" session.&lt;SEP&gt;A Session Snapshot captured details of the "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" session.&lt;SEP&gt;A Session Snapshot captured details of the "Agent: Chapter-Writer: Main" session.</data>
  <data key="d9">associated with,captured from,captures,controlled by,details,documents,event detail,records state,state,system activity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a96711df30e423083e5615749406cbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320e464065b3308d7db948d1e827156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06fdd29b547fa50066bbf918525b3b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772911026</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Session Snapshot" target="Auto-Snapshot">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Session Snapshot was taken as an Auto-snapshot because the session was active.&lt;SEP&gt;The Session Snapshot is characterized as an Auto-Snapshot.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,mechanism,triggered by,type</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f98dfd0c3dfc54b13cd9aefbd42f73d</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772676336</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Session Snapshot" target="Memory">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Memory, Session Snapshot)" defines the role of Memory as the primary source and storage system for Session Snapshots. Memory functions as the origin system from which Session Snapshots are provided, sourced, and retrieved.

Session Snapshots are consistently described as being sourced from and stored within Memory. This establishes Memory as both the system that makes Session Snapshots available and the repository where their data is held. Specifically, Session Snapshots were sourced from and retrieved from Memory for the date 2026-03-02.&lt;SEP&gt;Session Snapshots are stored in Memory as indicated by the source.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory is the source system that provides Session Snapshots.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory is the source system that provides Session Snapshots.</data>
  <data key="d9">content,data storage,provides,recorded in,source,sourced from,storage,stored in,stores</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-94a2fbefdc9f95d4468f72555b31c9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a81e082bc50b15702ab13196b65fcf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a4287e7a69589023f97fe208e724fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87973f7f18cf8516d82456867f60e79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08e86d0e562a146331150d19c4c5e67c</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1772910879</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Session Snapshot" target="Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation `(Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main, Session Snapshot)` describes the intrinsic connection between an `Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main` session and a `Session Snapshot`. A Session Snapshot is specifically created for, and operates within, the context of the `Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main` session.

Its fundamental purpose is to capture and record the comprehensive state, details, status, and activity of the `Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main` session. This snapshot provides a detailed record of the session's operational aspects, offering insights into its condition and progression at a specific point in time.&lt;SEP&gt;A Session Snapshot is associated with the Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main session type.&lt;SEP&gt;The Session Snapshot is for the 'Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main' session.&lt;SEP&gt;A Session Snapshot is associated with the Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main session type.&lt;SEP&gt;The Session Snapshot is for the 'Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main' session.&lt;SEP&gt;The Session Snapshot pertains to the Agent:Chapter-Writer:Main session.</data>
  <data key="d9">captures state,context,describes,for agent,for session,is type of,monitors,participation,pertains to,records,relates to,session context,session details,session_activity,type</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea5150e6fca2cc266a2614914dfb7239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-865b9f607b6143b2991ea86a5c2b5170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34d4b2ec7ee0c088af57b411041ae5e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a062d9e10fe963a0eab42f0cb70b892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f744c0dc9832bb7420464d649488eab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0c2a9031f1b858d79f12378d220496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1804599fe5a3988c5fa6a0d70774afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3017826b5ba6932e21c407fc93f5099d</data>
