  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Restart Command, Session Snapshot)" defines how a Session Snapshot incorporates the Restart Command. A Session Snapshot is consistently described as containing or recording the Restart Command. More specifically, this Restart Command is explicitly identified by the snippet "/restart". Therefore, the Session Snapshot contains the "/restart" command snippet.

This relationship further clarifies that the Restart Command is recorded or contained within the Session Snapshot as the snippet of its last message. This indicates a specific placement and context for the "/restart" command snippet within the overall structure or content of a Session Snapshot.</data>
