  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Memory: 2026-03-02, Session Snapshot)" characterizes a specific connection type that encompasses both the containment and sourcing of an entity. Within this framework, a Session Snapshot is described as being contained within "Memory: 2026-03-02."

Beyond mere containment, the relationship further specifies that the Session Snapshot is sourced from "Memory: 2026-03-02." This dual aspect of containment and sourcing is consistently reinforced across various descriptions. The presence of this Session Snapshot is also explicitly corroborated and documented within the daily notes corresponding to the date 2026-03-02.&lt;SEP&gt;The daily notes for 2026-03-02 document a Session Snapshot.</data>
