<edge source="Workflow" target="Cron Delivery Settings">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Cron Delivery Settings, Workflow) describes an integral connection where checking cron delivery settings is a fundamental aspect of managing a workflow. This practice is consistently identified as an essential component within various workflow practices, especially when initiating new jobs.

The primary objectives for incorporating this check into a workflow often include overall workflow improvement and the prevention of undesirable outcomes such as spam. Therefore, verifying cron delivery settings is a key operational step for maintaining effective and optimized workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflows involve checking cron delivery settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflow improvement involves checking cron delivery settings to avoid spam.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflows involve checking cron delivery settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflow improvement involves checking cron delivery settings to avoid spam.&lt;SEP&gt;Workflows involve checking cron delivery settings.</data>
