<edge source="Cron Delivery Settings" target="New Jobs">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation `(Cron Delivery Settings, New Jobs)` describes a direct and important connection between Cron Delivery Settings and the management and creation of new jobs. These settings are applied to new jobs and directly affect their behavior and execution.

It is critical to consider and check Cron Delivery Settings when new jobs are being created. This is due to their high relevance for the proper configuration and effective management of new jobs, ensuring that they function as intended according to the specified delivery parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Cron delivery settings are relevant for managing new jobs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cron Delivery Settings need to be checked when creating New Jobs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cron delivery settings affect new jobs.</data>
