<edge source="Cron Delivery Settings" target="Notification Spam">
  <data key="d7">23.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Cron Delivery Settings and Notification Spam signifies a direct influence where the effective management of the former is instrumental in mitigating the latter. Proper configuration, consistent checking, and appropriate definition of Cron Delivery Settings are crucial for controlling and preventing the occurrence of Notification Spam. By ensuring these settings are correctly managed, systems can effectively avoid the generation and delivery of unwanted notifications, thereby preventing Notification Spam.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper Cron Delivery Settings help to avoid Notification Spam.</data>
