<edge source="/Remember Command" target="Session Learnings">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(/Remember Command, Session Learnings)" describes the functional connection between the `/remember` command and the information artifact known as Session Learnings. Specifically, the `/remember` command is the mechanism or action that produces, generates, or is associated with the generation of Session Learnings. This indicates that invoking the `/remember` command results in the creation or retrieval of these learnings within a system.&lt;SEP&gt;The /remember command produces Session Learnings.&lt;SEP&gt;The /remember command is associated with generating Session Learnings.</data>
