  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Decisions Made, Session_Remember.py)" indicates that the implementation of the `Session_Remember.py` script constitutes a specific instance of a "Decision Made". This encompasses both the planning and the eventual execution of implementing the `session_remember.py` script, identifying it as a determined course of action within the scope of "Decisions Made".&lt;SEP&gt;A specific Decision Made is the implementation of Session_Remember.py.&lt;SEP&gt;Decisions Made include the implementation of the `session_remember.py` script.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific Decision Made is the implementation of Session_Remember.py.&lt;SEP&gt;Decisions Made include the implementation of the `session_remember.py` script.</data>
