  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Action Item, Unknown)" describes a state where an action item has an owner who is not specified or is currently unknown. This indicates that the individual responsible for the action item has not been identified, assigned, or designated. The ownership of the action item is explicitly recorded as "Unknown," meaning the responsible party remains unidentified.&lt;SEP&gt;The owner of the action item is currently listed as unknown.&lt;SEP&gt;The owner of the action item is currently unknown.</data>
