<edge source="ClawHub" target="ClawHub CLI">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between ClawHub and ClawHub CLI describes the nature and origin of the ClawHub Command-Line Interface. ClawHub CLI is identified as a command-line interface (CLI) component that is an integral part of the ClawHub platform or system. It serves as an interface for the ClawHub platform and is generally considered to be associated with it.

This ClawHub CLI component originates from and is provided by ClawHub itself. It is installed from ClawHub, indicating that ClawHub is the direct source or distributor of the ClawHub CLI.</data>
  <data key="d9">associated with,association,component,component of,installation,installed from,interface to,originates from,part of,provided by,source,system part,tool for</data>
