<edge source="Bookshelf App Project" target="Next.js 14">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Bookshelf App Project and Next.js 14 indicates a fundamental technological dependency. The Bookshelf App Project is built using Next.js 14, making it an integral component of its underlying technology stack. This signifies that Next.js 14 is utilized in the development and operation of the Bookshelf App Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project is built using the Next.js 14 framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project is built using Next.js 14.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project uses Next.js 14 as part of its technology stack.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project uses Next.js 14 as part of its technology stack.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project uses Next.js 14 as part of its technology stack.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bookshelf App Project uses Next.js 14 as part of its technology stack.</data>
