<edge source="Academic Research Workflow Automation System" target="Daily ArXiv Monitoring">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Academic Research Workflow Automation System and Daily ArXiv Monitoring clarifies that Daily ArXiv Monitoring operates as a dedicated system component within the overarching Academic Research Workflow Automation System.

This Daily ArXiv Monitoring component is consistently identified as a core, key, or one of the essential components integrated into the Academic Research Workflow Automation System. This underscores its fundamental importance to the system's overall design and its integral role in facilitating and automating academic research workflows.</data>
