<edge source="Longevity Healthcare Research" target="Longevity Research">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Longevity Healthcare Research encompasses Longevity Research as a specific and integral component within its broader scope. Longevity Research is consistently described as a distinct area, sub-area, or component that is included under the umbrella of Longevity Healthcare Research. Furthermore, Longevity Research is identified as a new research area or simply a new area that has been added to or is specifically included within Longevity Healthcare Research. This relationship establishes Longevity Research as a focused and potentially recently emphasized aspect of the more extensive field of Longevity Healthcare Research.&lt;SEP&gt;Longevity Research is a new research area under Longevity Healthcare Research.</data>
