<edge source="Longevity Research" target="Life Extension And Aging Studies">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Longevity Research is a field of study that is closely defined by and intrinsically related to Life Extension And Aging Studies. This area of inquiry specifically focuses on the comprehensive examination and various investigations into the biological, environmental, and lifestyle factors associated with the aging process and the potential for extending healthy human lifespan. The term "Life Extension And Aging Studies" effectively clarifies and delineates the core subject matter and primary scope of activities encompassed within Longevity Research.&lt;SEP&gt;Longevity Research includes Life Extension And Aging Studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Extension And Aging Studies are topics within Longevity Research.&lt;SEP&gt;Longevity Research focuses on life extension and aging studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Longevity Research encompasses Life Extension And Aging Studies.</data>
  <data key="d9">categorization,clarification,defined as,defines,definition,description,encompasses,focus,focuses on,includes,inclusion,relates to,scope,sub-topic</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-97fe0dddb24f17a6ff26b65970479fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40fa075485b63447273b59dcdd10fadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a1a85c141b50ecd59f3a228d81569a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76861888b327c0c03774d2fd66bfaab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76ef76bfb529eb0424bbe3db7d86acc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6403ad3df78ad1415d5338e0674cf444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5762a88e509b59d9d8b593ccc501736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb209bf42350b9e170471b4f0b4d8f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a2b27b656d4020fb0b84a1e76aa64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a903be8a6a1e664f8430b600a9d758</data>
