<edge source="Batch" target="Action Item">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Action Item, Batch)" describes a fundamental connection where an Action Item is derived from, linked to, or originates from a Batch. This relation explicitly identifies the Action Item's source or origin as "Batch."

The Action Item's provenance can be traced back to either a "batch process" or a broader "batch source." In addition to indicating origin, "Batch" can also function as a metadata field associated with the Action Item, providing specific details about its source and aiding in its categorization and tracking.</data>
  <data key="d9">has attribute,has source,metadata field,origin,originated from,source</data>
