<edge source="MEMORY.md" target="Weekly Memory Maintenance">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (MEMORY.md, Weekly Memory Maintenance) describes an activity known as Weekly Memory Maintenance. This process consistently involves or includes the action of updating the MEMORY.md file. Essentially, Weekly Memory Maintenance is characterized by its function of updating the content within the MEMORY.md file.&lt;SEP&gt;Weekly Memory Maintenance involves updating MEMORY.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Weekly Memory Maintenance involves updating MEMORY.md.</data>
