<edge source="MEMORY.md" target="Full Installed Skills List">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "Full Installed Skills List, MEMORY.md" signifies that the `MEMORY.md` file is the designated location for storing the complete list of installed skills. This file contains the full inventory of skills that have been installed.

Throughout its existence, `MEMORY.md` has been consistently updated to include or incorporate the "Full Installed Skills List," ensuring that it accurately reflects the current status of installed skills.&lt;SEP&gt;MEMORY.md was updated with the Full Installed Skills List.</data>
  <data key="d9">contains,contains information,content update,data,data storage,documentation,documents,includes,information update,stores,update,updated with</data>
