<edge source="MEMORY.md" target="Installed Skills List">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Installed Skills List, MEMORY.md)" indicates an action where the `MEMORY.md` file or document was updated. This update involved incorporating a list of installed skills, sometimes specified as the "full installed skills list," into its content. The consistency across descriptions affirms that `MEMORY.md` serves as a repository for information concerning the installed skills.</data>
