<edge source="Atlanta" target="Weather Widget">
  <data key="d7">17.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Atlanta, Weather Widget)" describes the historical configuration and original state of the Weather Widget. Atlanta was the initial and original location setting for this widget. It served as the primary and previous location setting for the Weather Widget.

The Weather Widget was originally configured and set to display weather information for Atlanta. However, its location setting was subsequently changed from Atlanta, indicating that Atlanta is no longer its current or active display location.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather widget's location was changed from Atlanta.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather widget's location was changed from Atlanta.</data>
