<edge source="Bangkok" target="Weather Widget">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Bangkok, Weather Widget)" describes the configuration of a weather widget to display weather information specifically for the city of Bangkok. This involves an action to modify the widget's location setting. The process entails updating, changing, correcting, or reconfiguring the weather widget's location to Bangkok. Consequently, Bangkok is established as the current location for which the weather widget presents its data. The widget's setting was thus changed or fixed to display weather for Bangkok.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather widget's location was changed to Bangkok.&lt;SEP&gt;The weather widget's location was changed to Bangkok.</data>
  <data key="d9">configuration,configuration change,configured for,configured location,corrected setting,current configuration,current setting,destination,geographic data,location,location setting,location_changed_to,new location,new setting,updated setting</data>
