<edge source="Sigmoid R@10" target="RRF Baseline">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(RRF Baseline, Sigmoid R@10)" describes a performance comparison where Sigmoid R@10 demonstrates a notable improvement over the RRF Baseline. Specifically, Sigmoid R@10 exhibits an 18.4% improvement compared to the RRF Baseline. This enhancement is not only significant in magnitude but is also confirmed to be statistically significant.&lt;SEP&gt;Sigmoid R@10 shows an 18.4% improvement over the RRF Baseline.</data>
