  <data key="d8">The relation "(Learned Gating, Sigmoid R@10)" signifies a direct performance measurement where the "Learned Gating" method is evaluated using the "Sigmoid R@10" metric. Specifically, Learned Gating achieved a Sigmoid R@10 score of 0.923. This metric, Sigmoid R@10, is reported as a final result, indicating a key performance outcome or metric directly associated with the Learned Gating method.&lt;SEP&gt;Learned Gating produced a Sigmoid R@10 result of 0.923.&lt;SEP&gt;Learned Gating achieved a Sigmoid R@10 score.</data>
