<edge source="Softmax R@10" target="Learned Gating">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Learned Gating and Softmax R@10 describes a specific performance outcome within a methodological context. Softmax R@10 is identified as a performance metric that is obtained as a final result from the Learned Gating method. It is a reported result that is included among the outcomes attributed to Learned Gating.

Specifically, the Learned Gating method consistently achieved a Softmax R@10 score of 0.911. This score represents the performance of Learned Gating as measured by the Softmax R@10 metric.&lt;SEP&gt;Learned Gating produced a Softmax R@10 result of 0.911.&lt;SEP&gt;Learned Gating achieved a Softmax R@10 score.</data>
