<edge source="Learned Gating" target="RAG Second Brain Paper v15">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "Learned Gating, RAG Second Brain Paper v15" signifies the direct association between the "RAG Second Brain Paper v15" and the methodology or concept known as "Learned Gating." The RAG Second Brain Paper v15 is a publication that extensively presents, discusses, and details the final results obtained from or for Learned Gating. Specifically, it outlines the ultimate outcomes and findings derived from the application or study of this particular method or concept.</data>
