<edge source="UX/UI Designer Agent" target="Interface Design">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Interface Design, UX/UI Designer Agent) defines the primary specialization and area of focus for a UX/UI Designer Agent. It establishes that the core function and expertise of a UX/UI Designer Agent are centered on Interface Design, indicating this as their main professional concentration.</data>
