<edge source="UX/UI Designer Agent" target="Visual Polish">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (UX/UI Designer Agent, Visual Polish) describes the primary area of expertise and focus for a UX/UI Designer Agent. This agent's specialization is consistently identified as visual polish, indicating a dedicated emphasis on refining the aesthetic quality and detailed presentation of user interfaces and experiences.</data>
  <data key="d9">design focus,expertise,focus,focus area,focuses on,specialization,specializes in</data>
