<edge source="Three Old Men - Thai Translation" target="Three Old Men: The Last Conversation">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" project translates the work titled "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation".&lt;SEP&gt;The "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" project translates the work titled "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation".&lt;SEP&gt;The project "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" has the English title "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation".&lt;SEP&gt;The English title for "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" is "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation".&lt;SEP&gt;The "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" is a literary translation project of the novel "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation."&lt;SEP&gt;Three Old Men - Thai Translation is a related project providing the Thai version of the novel.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Three Old Men - Thai Translation" is a translation of the original "Three Old Men: The Last Conversation".</data>
