<edge source="Week 6 Sub-Agent" target="Week 6 PPTX">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Week 6 PPTX and the Week 6 Sub-Agent describes a consistent operational failure. The Week 6 Sub-Agent was repeatedly unable to successfully complete its assigned task concerning the Week 6 PPTX.

Specifically, the Week 6 Sub-Agent failed in its efforts to build the Week 6 PPTX. This inability extended to producing the Week 6 PPTX, indicating a comprehensive malfunction where the sub-agent could not generate or construct the required presentation material. Therefore, the core characteristic of this relationship is the sub-agent's consistent failure to perform its designated function in relation to the Week 6 PPTX.&lt;SEP&gt;The Week 6 Sub-Agent failed to build the Week 6 PPTX.&lt;SEP&gt;The Week 6 Sub-Agent failed in building the Week 6 PPTX.</data>
  <data key="d9">attempted creation,automation,build_process,content creation,creation,creation attempt,document creation,failed to build,failed to create,failure,intended output,processing,production,production failure</data>
