<edge source="Proactive Heartbeats" target="HEARTBEAT.md">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between HEARTBEAT.md and Proactive Heartbeats describes how Proactive Heartbeats is documented and updated within the HEARTBEAT.md file. Proactive Heartbeats is identified as a performance improvement, a method, or an implementation. This initiative consistently involved the updating of the HEARTBEAT.md file to incorporate and document details regarding Proactive Heartbeats. Consequently, Proactive Heartbeats led to these updates in HEARTBEAT.md, establishing it as the document where information about this improvement is recorded and maintained.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are implemented by updating HEARTBEAT.md with an actual checklist.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are documented within HEARTBEAT.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are documented within HEARTBEAT.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are documented within HEARTBEAT.md.</data>
  <data key="d9">action,documentation,implementation,modification,record-keeping,update,updated,updates</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-67b1aad64c74e49b536dcee4842fd95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defbb01c471de1f9b119c0fb594cfce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a9809eefacfad853cbe9eca4de35242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982e44c530f25ae52d6250214d23aabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8936b50bda00582724bd2444a1cf3442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cba83ad815daf324fb66f8121ca897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c64a6a2928521dc9353558ea2c8300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa4cdee8aa3fae5d9bc03e58b2c5d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-585ec9012778369490285b396b88b9bd</data>
