</edge>
<edge source="Proactive Heartbeats" target="Performance Improvements">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Performance Improvements and Proactive Heartbeats signifies that Proactive Heartbeats are a specific method or component that contributes to and is integrated within the broader scope of Performance Improvements. Proactive Heartbeats are consistently identified, implemented, and recognized as one of the constituent parts or an aspect of the overall implemented performance enhancements. This indicates that Proactive Heartbeats function as a mechanism that forms part of the strategies or changes enacted to achieve improved performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are a component of the implemented performance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are a component of the implemented performance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Proactive Heartbeats are a component of the implemented performance improvements.</data>
  <data key="d9">action,component,containment,detail,implements,includes,inclusion,method,specific improvement,strategy</data>
