<edge source="Faster Sub-Agent Spawning" target="AGENTS.md">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Faster Sub-Agent Spawning refers to an improvement or method that has been implemented and documented within the `AGENTS.md` file. This process involved the addition of a specific rule, identified as a "spawn fast" rule, to the `AGENTS.md` document, which facilitates the faster spawning of sub-agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is documented within AGENTS.md.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is documented within AGENTS.md.</data>
