  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Faster Sub-Agent Spawning, Performance Improvements)" indicates that Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a significant element within the scope of Performance Improvements. It is consistently identified and implemented as a core component and method that contributes to, and is included among, the overall performance enhancements. Essentially, Faster Sub-Agent Spawning represents one of the specific implemented approaches constituting a broader set of performance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a component of the implemented performance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a component of the implemented performance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Faster Sub-Agent Spawning is a component of the implemented performance improvements.</data>
