<edge source="Action Item" target="Open Status">
  <data key="d7">33.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(Action Item, Open Status)" describes the current state of an Action Item. This relation specifically indicates that the Action Item is in an "Open Status."

An "Open Status" signifies that the Action Item is active and has not yet reached completion. Consequently, it remains unresolved and requires further attention or action before its status can be changed to a different state.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item is currently in an open status, indicating it is not yet completed.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item has an open status.&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Item is currently in an open status.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item is currently in an 'open' state, meaning it is active.</data>
  <data key="d9">attribute,current state,current status,has status,indicates state,progress,state,status</data>
