<edge source="Action Item" target="Batch Source">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Action Item, Batch Source) describes the origin or source of an Action Item. This relationship signifies that an Action Item originates from, or has its source identified and classified as, a Batch Source. Essentially, it indicates that the Action Item came into existence or was generated through a batch process.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item originated from a batch process.&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Item originated from a batch source.&lt;SEP&gt;The action item originated from a 'batch' process or input.</data>
