  <data key="d8">The relation between the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)" and the "Smart HAI Dashboard Project" indicates a direct generative and associative link. The Smart HAI Dashboard Project is responsible for the creation and production of the "30 Complex Dashboards Report (v1)".

