<edge source="30 Dashboards" target="83 DW Tables">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation "(30 Dashboards, 83 DW Tables)" describes a direct mapping between a specific set of dashboards and a collection of data warehouse tables. In this context, 30 distinct dashboards are mapped to 83 Data Warehouse (DW) tables.

This mapping signifies a fundamental data integration, where the dashboards likely draw their underlying data directly from these specified 83 DW tables. This relationship is observed within a report, indicating that the dashboards' content and functionalities are intrinsically linked to, and supported by, the data housed within these particular data warehouse structures.</data>
